-- npl-final-2026-sudurpaschim-royals-champions-20261122 (news; English 670 words; Nepali 276 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'npl-final-2026-sudurpaschim-royals-champions-20261122', 'news', 'Nepal',
'NPL Final 2026: Sudurpaschim Royals Win Maiden Title by 10 Wickets',
'NPL फाइनल २०२६: सुदूरपश्चिम रोयल्स १० विकेटले विजयी',
'Sudurpaschim Royals won the NPL final 2026 by 10 wickets as George Munsey smashed an unbeaten 125 off 54 balls at TU Ground, Kirtipur.',
'जर्ज मुन्सीको अविजित १२५ रनको मद्दतमा सुदूरपश्चिम रोयल्सले NPL फाइनल २०२६ मा लुम्बिनी लायन्सलाई १० विकेटले हराएर पहिलो उपाधि जित्यो।',
$$<p>Sudurpaschim Royals won the NPL final 2026 by 10 wickets on Saturday 21 November, beating defending champions Lumbini Lions at the Tribhuvan University International Cricket Ground in Kirtipur to lift their maiden Nepal Premier League title at the third attempt.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Match</td><td>NPL final 2026, Lumbini Lions v Sudurpaschim Royals, 21 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Result</td><td>Sudurpaschim Royals won by 10 wickets, with 39 balls to spare</td></tr><tr><td>Lumbini Lions</td><td>155 for 6 in 20 overs; Dilip Nath 39 not out off 31, Rohit Paudel 30 off 31</td></tr><tr><td>Sudurpaschim Royals</td><td>158 for 0 in 13.3 overs; George Munsey 125 not out off 54, Binod Bhandari 30 not out off 27</td></tr><tr><td>Player of the match</td><td>George Munsey</td></tr><tr><td>Toss</td><td>Sudurpaschim Royals won the toss and chose to field first</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What happened in the NPL final 2026</h2><p>Lumbini Lions batted first after losing the toss and posted 155 for six in their 20 overs. Dilip Nath top-scored with an unbeaten 39 off 31 balls, and captain Rohit Paudel made 30 off 31 before being run out. Scott Kuggeleijn took two wickets for 25 runs. In reply, Scotland opener George Munsey produced one of the great NPL innings, reaching his half-century in 28 balls and his century in 49, and finishing unbeaten on 125 off 54 balls with eight fours and 12 sixes. He shared an unbeaten 158-run opening stand with Binod Bhandari, who made 30 not out off 27, as the Royals chased down 156 in 13.3 overs. Munsey had been dropped on 44 by Sundeep Jora, and he sealed the win with three consecutive sixes off Sher Malla in the 14th over. His 125 is the highest individual score in NPL history. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/nepal">Nepal</a> cricket can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/mbbs-results-2026-mecee-bl-2027-10326-qualified-20261121">MBBS results 2026, with 10,326 candidates qualified</a>, another big Nepal result from this week.</p><h2>What the NPL final 2026 result means</h2><p>The win ends two years of heartbreak for Sudurpaschim, who lost the finals of the first two NPL seasons, including last year final to Lumbini. It also reverses the season pattern: Lumbini had beaten the Royals twice this season, in the league stage and in Qualifier 1. Munsey arrived as a replacement for his Scotland teammate Brandon McMullen for the playoffs, was out for a duck in his first game against Lumbini and managed only eight runs against Chitwan in Qualifier 2, then delivered the defining innings of the tournament in the final. Dipendra Singh Airee was named player of the tournament and received a cash prize of Rs 500,000. For Nepali cricket, a 10-wicket final win built on a record chase gives the league a signature moment as it heads into its fourth season.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The result reports do not separately re-verify the winner prize money, so this article does not present a figure as confirmed: the Rs 15 million winner prize was the announced prize stated in the preview, not a figure re-verified in the result reports. The sources do not say when the next NPL season will be played, who will coach either side next season, or whether Munsey will return. They also do not give a full breakdown of the prize money for the runners-up or the individual award winners beyond Airee player of the tournament prize of Rs 500,000.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://kathmandupost.com/cricket/2026/11/21/munsey-s-century-powers-sudurpaschim-to-maiden-npl-title">The Kathmandu Post</a>, the match report (scores, Munsey 125 off 54 with eight fours and 12 sixes, century in 49 balls, toss and venue); <a href="https://www.cricinfo.com/series/nepal-premier-league-2026-27-1558581/lumbini-lions-npl-vs-sudur-paschim-royals-npl-final-1558613/live-cricket-score">ESPNcricinfo</a>, the official scorecard (155 for 6, 158 for 0 in 13.3 overs, 10-wicket win with 39 balls remaining, player of the match); <a href="https://kathmandupost.com/cricket/2026/11/22/after-two-heartbreaks-sudurpaschim-finally-have-their-moment">The Kathmandu Post</a>, the follow-up report (third consecutive final, Airee player of the tournament and Rs 500,000 prize).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Who won the NPL final 2026?</h3><p>Sudurpaschim Royals beat Lumbini Lions by 10 wickets to win their maiden NPL title.</p><h3>How many runs did George Munsey score in the final?</h3><p>Munsey scored an unbeaten 125 off 54 balls, with eight fours and 12 sixes, reaching his century in 49 balls.</p><h3>What was the final score?</h3><p>Lumbini Lions made 155 for six in 20 overs and Sudurpaschim Royals replied with 158 for no wicket in 13.3 overs.</p>$$,
$$<p>सुदूरपश्चिम रोयल्सले शनिबार २१ नोभेम्बरमा NPL फाइनल २०२६ मा लुम्बिनी लायन्सलाई १० विकेटले हराएर कीर्तिपुरस्थित त्रिभुवन विश्वविद्यालय अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय क्रिकेट मैदानमा आफ्नो पहिलो नेपाल प्रिमियर लिग उपाधि जित्यो।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>खेल</td><td>NPL फाइनल २०२६, लुम्बिनी लायन्स विरुद्ध सुदूरपश्चिम रोयल्स, २१ नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>नतिजा</td><td>सुदूरपश्चिम रोयल्स १० विकेटले विजयी, ३९ बल बाँकी</td></tr><tr><td>लुम्बिनी लायन्स</td><td>२० ओभरमा १५५/६; दिलीप नाथ ३१ बलमा अविजित ३९, रोहित पौडेल ३१ बलमा ३०</td></tr><tr><td>सुदूरपश्चिम रोयल्स</td><td>१३.३ ओभरमा १५८/०; जर्ज मुन्सी ५४ बलमा अविजित १२५, विनोद भण्डारी २७ बलमा अविजित ३०</td></tr><tr><td>टस</td><td>सुदूरपश्चिम रोयल्सले टस जितेर पहिले फिल्डिङ रोज्यो</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>NPL फाइनल २०२६ मा के भयो</h2><p>टस हारेर पहिले ब्याटिङ गरेको लुम्बिनीले २० ओभरमा ६ विकेट गुमाएर १५५ रन बनायो। दिलीप नाथले ३१ बलमा अविजित ३९ र कप्तान रोहित पौडेलले ३१ बलमा ३० रन बनाए। जवाफमा स्कटल्यान्डका ओपनर जर्ज मुन्सीले ५४ बलमा अविजित १२५ रन बनाए, जसमा आठ चौका र १२ छक्का थिए। उनले ४९ बलमा शतक पूरा गरे। विनोद भण्डारीसँगको अविजित १५८ रनको ओपनिङ साझेदारीमा रोयल्सले १३.३ ओभरमा लक्ष्य पूरा गर्यो। मुन्सीको १२५ रन NPL इतिहासकै उच्चतम व्यक्तिगत स्कोर हो।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>यस जितले सुदूरपश्चिमको दुई वर्षको निराशा अन्त्य गर्यो; टोलीले पहिलो दुई सिजनका फाइनल हारेका थिए, जसमा गत वर्ष लुम्बिनीसँगको फाइनल पनि थियो। दीपेन्द्र सिंह ऐरी प्रतियोगिताका उत्कृष्ट खेलाडी घोषित भए र उनले ५ लाख रुपैयाँ नगद पुरस्कार पाए।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>नतिजाका रिपोर्टहरूले विजेताको पुरस्कार रकम छुट्टै पुष्टि गरेका छैनन्, त्यसैले यस लेखले कुनै अङ्क पुष्टि भएको भनेर प्रस्तुत गरेको छैन। अर्को NPL सिजन कहिले हुन्छ वा मुन्सी फर्कन्छन् भन्ने पनि स्रोतहरूले बताएका छैनन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://kathmandupost.com/cricket/2026/11/21/munsey-s-century-powers-sudurpaschim-to-maiden-npl-title">The Kathmandu Post</a>, खेल रिपोर्ट; <a href="https://www.cricinfo.com/series/nepal-premier-league-2026-27-1558581/lumbini-lions-npl-vs-sudur-paschim-royals-npl-final-1558613/live-cricket-score">ESPNcricinfo</a>, आधिकारिक स्कोरकार्ड।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>NPL फाइनल २०२६ कसले जित्यो?</h3><p>सुदूरपश्चिम रोयल्सले लुम्बिनी लायन्सलाई १० विकेटले हराएर पहिलो उपाधि जित्यो।</p><h3>जर्ज मुन्सीले फाइनलमा कति रन बनाए?</h3><p>मुन्सीले ५४ बलमा अविजित १२५ रन बनाए, जसमा आठ चौका र १२ छक्का थिए।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://kathmandupost.com/cricket/2026/11/21/munsey-s-century-powers-sudurpaschim-to-maiden-npl-title', 'https://www.cricinfo.com/series/nepal-premier-league-2026-27-1558581/lumbini-lions-npl-vs-sudur-paschim-royals-npl-final-1558613/live-cricket-score', 'https://kathmandupost.com/cricket/2026/11/22/after-two-heartbreaks-sudurpaschim-finally-have-their-moment'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- balen-shah-india-visit-arrives-new-delhi-20261122 (news; English 595 words; Nepali 218 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'balen-shah-india-visit-arrives-new-delhi-20261122', 'news', 'Nepal',
'Balen Shah India Visit: Nepal PM Arrives for 25 Hour Delhi Trip',
'बालेन शाह भारत भ्रमण: नेपालका प्रधानमन्त्री २५ घण्टे दिल्ली यात्रामा',
'The Balen Shah India visit began on Sunday as Nepal PM Balendra Shah landed in New Delhi for a 25-hour trip, with Modi talks set for Monday.',
'नेपालका प्रधानमन्त्री बालेन्द्र शाह आइतबार नयाँ दिल्ली पुगेर २५ घण्टे भारत भ्रमण सुरु गरे; मोदीसँगको वार्ता सोमबार हुने तय छ।',
$$<p>The Balen Shah India visit began on Sunday 22 November, as Nepal Prime Minister Balendra Shah landed in New Delhi for a two-day state visit lasting about 25 hours, his first official bilateral trip to India since taking office in March 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Visit</td><td>State visit to India, 22 to 23 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Arrival</td><td>New Delhi, Sunday afternoon, on a regular Nepal Airlines flight</td></tr><tr><td>Delegation</td><td>34 members, including Finance Minister Swarnim Wagle and Foreign Minister Shishir Khanal</td></tr><tr><td>Key meeting</td><td>Delegation-level talks with PM Narendra Modi on Monday 23 November at Hyderabad House</td></tr><tr><td>Return</td><td>Depart New Delhi Monday afternoon, arriving Kathmandu in the evening</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What happened on the Balen Shah India visit</h2><p>Shah departed Kathmandu on Sunday afternoon and was due to land in New Delhi at about 3:15 pm, where he receives a guard of honour as part of the official welcome. On Sunday evening he was scheduled to meet Indian External Affairs Minister S. Jaishankar at the Taj Hotel, where he is staying. The visit is deliberately brief: unlike previous Nepali prime ministers, who often spent three days or more and travelled to other Indian cities, Shah stays in Delhi throughout and holds no meetings outside the capital. He is not scheduled to meet business representatives personally; Finance Minister Wagle and Foreign Minister Khanal handle the business interactions on his behalf. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/nepal">Nepal</a> can also read our earlier report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/nepal-pm-balendra-shah-india-visit-2-billion-20261117">the planned 2 billion dollar package for the visit</a>.</p><h2>What the Balen Shah India visit means</h2><p>The trip is Shah's first foreign visit since he revised his policy of not travelling abroad in his first year in office, and it comes eight months after he took office. Talks are expected to centre on reconstruction after the Bhotekoshi floods in August, energy and connectivity, and a 10-point Joint Vision Document titled Samriddha Nepal, Samunnat Bharat. On Monday Shah will meet Modi at Hyderabad House, with a one-on-one discussion expected to last more than an hour, followed by delegation-level talks, the inauguration of the Ayodhya to Janakpur railway service and other connectivity and energy projects, and a call on President Droupadi Murmu. Nepal is seeking a 2 billion dollar assistance framework, including loans and grants for post-flood reconstruction. The short, business-only format is itself the story: Shah has broken with the ceremonial traditions of his predecessors, with no airport send-off in Kathmandu and no temple or project tours outside Delhi.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>No agreement has been signed yet, so the sources do not confirm what the 2 billion dollar package will contain or whether the Joint Vision Document will be adopted as drafted. They do not say what Modi will offer on flood reconstruction, what the Ayodhya to Janakpur train service timetable will be, or what was discussed in the Sunday evening meeting with Jaishankar. The exact arrival time differs between reports, with some giving 3:15 pm and others 3:45 pm, so this article gives the time as about 3:15 pm and notes the discrepancy.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://english.onlinekhabar.com/balen-shah-diplomatic-tradition.html">Online Khabar</a>, the visit schedule and the break with diplomatic tradition (25-hour trip, Delhi only, Modi one-on-one); <a href="https://radionepalonline.com/en/2026/11/22/439077.html">Radio Nepal</a>, the official departure report (two-day state visit, Rajghat tribute, project inaugurations); <a href="https://ddindia.co.in/2026/11/nepal-pm-balendra-shahs-first-official-india-visit-aims-to-reset-bilateral-ties/">DD India</a>, the visit aims and the Joint Vision Document.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How long is Balen Shah India visit?</h3><p>About 25 hours, from Sunday afternoon 22 November to Monday afternoon 23 November, spent entirely in New Delhi.</p><h3>When does Shah meet Narendra Modi?</h3><p>On Monday 23 November at Hyderabad House, with a one-on-one discussion followed by delegation-level talks.</p><h3>What is on the agenda?</h3><p>Post-flood reconstruction, energy and connectivity, and a 10-point Joint Vision Document, plus the inauguration of the Ayodhya to Janakpur railway service.</p>$$,
$$<p>बालेन्द्र शाहको भारत भ्रमण आइतबार २२ नोभेम्बरमा सुरु भयो। नेपालका प्रधानमन्त्री नयाँ दिल्ली पुगे, जहाँ उनले करिब २५ घण्टा बिताउनेछन्। यो मार्च २०२६ मा पदभार सम्हालेपछि उनको भारतको पहिलो आधिकारिक द्विपक्षीय भ्रमण हो।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>भ्रमण</td><td>भारतको राजकीय भ्रमण, २२–२३ नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>आगमन</td><td>आइतबार दिउँसो नयाँ दिल्ली, नियमित नेपाल एयरलाइन्स उडानबाट</td></tr><tr><td>प्रतिनिधिमण्डल</td><td>३४ सदस्य, अर्थमन्त्री स्वर्णिम वाग्ले र परराष्ट्रमन्त्री शिशिर खनालसहित</td></tr><tr><td>मुख्य भेट</td><td>सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बरमा हैदराबाद हाउसमा प्रधानमन्त्री नरेन्द्र मोदीसँग वार्ता</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>भ्रमणमा के भयो</h2><p>शाह आइतबार दिउँसो काठमाडौंबाट प्रस्थान गरे र नयाँ दिल्लीमा करिब ३:१५ बजे पुग्ने तय थियो। आइतबार साँझ उनले भारतीय विदेशमन्त्री एस. जयशंकरसँग भेट्ने कार्यक्रम छ। अघिल्ला प्रधानमन्त्रीहरूभन्दा फरक, शाह सम्पूर्ण भ्रमण दिल्लीमै बिताउँछन् र दिल्ली बाहिर जाँदैनन्।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>वार्तामा भोटेकोशी बाढीपछि पुनर्निर्माण, ऊर्जा र कनेक्टिभिटी तथा १० बुँदे संयुक्त दृष्टिकोण दस्तावेज केन्द्रमा रहने अपेक्षा छ। सोमबार मोदीसँग हैदराबाद हाउसमा एकल वार्ता र प्रतिनिधिमण्डलस्तरीय वार्ता हुनेछ, साथै अयोध्या–जनकपुर रेल सेवा उद्घाटन हुनेछ।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>अहिलेसम्म कुनै सम्झौतामा हस्ताक्षर भएको छैन, त्यसैले २ अर्ब डलरको सहायता प्याकेजमा के हुन्छ भन्ने पुष्टि भएको छैन। आगमनको ठ्याक्कै समयबारे रिपोर्टहरू फरक छन्, केहीले ३:१५ र केहीले ३:४५ भनेका छन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://english.onlinekhabar.com/balen-shah-diplomatic-tradition.html">Online Khabar</a>, भ्रमण तालिका; <a href="https://radionepalonline.com/en/2026/11/22/439077.html">Radio Nepal</a>, आधिकारिक प्रस्थान रिपोर्ट; <a href="https://ddindia.co.in/2026/11/nepal-pm-balendra-shahs-first-official-india-visit-aims-to-reset-bilateral-ties/">DD India</a>, भ्रमणका उद्देश्य।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>बालेन शाहको भारत भ्रमण कति लामो छ?</h3><p>करिब २५ घण्टा, आइतबार २२ नोभेम्बर दिउँसोदेखि सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर दिउँसोसम्म, पूर्ण रूपमा नयाँ दिल्लीमै।</p><h3>शाहले मोदीसँग कहिले भेट्छन्?</h3><p>सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बरमा हैदराबाद हाउसमा, एकल वार्तापछि प्रतिनिधिमण्डलस्तरीय वार्ता हुनेछ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://english.onlinekhabar.com/balen-shah-diplomatic-tradition.html', 'https://radionepalonline.com/en/2026/11/22/439077.html', 'https://ddindia.co.in/2026/11/nepal-pm-balendra-shahs-first-official-india-visit-aims-to-reset-bilateral-ties/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- g20-summit-johannesburg-opens-without-us-20261122 (news; English 585 words; Nepali 224 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'g20-summit-johannesburg-opens-without-us-20261122', 'news', 'South Africa',
'G20 Summit Johannesburg Opens Without the United States',
'G20 शिखर सम्मेलन जोहानेसबर्ग अमेरिकाबिना सुरु भयो',
'The G20 summit Johannesburg opened on Sunday, the first G20 leaders meeting in Africa, with President Ramaphosa hosting and the United States absent.',
'G20 शिखर सम्मेलन जोहानेसबर्ग आइतबार सुरु भयो, अफ्रिकामा पहिलो पटक, रामाफोसाको अध्यक्षतामा र अमेरिका अनुपस्थित।',
$$<p>The G20 summit Johannesburg opened on Sunday 22 November, the first G20 leaders meeting ever held in Africa, with South African President Cyril Ramaphosa hosting leaders under the theme Solidarity, Equality, Sustainability, and the United States absent.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Summit</td><td>20th G20 Leaders Summit, Johannesburg, 22 to 23 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Host</td><td>President Cyril Ramaphosa, South Africa</td></tr><tr><td>Venue</td><td>Nasrec Expo Centre, Johannesburg</td></tr><tr><td>Theme</td><td>Solidarity, Equality, Sustainability</td></tr><tr><td>Not attending</td><td>United States: no US government official, per President Trump</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What happened at the G20 summit Johannesburg</h2><p>Leaders gathered at the Nasrec Expo Centre for the two-day meeting, with about 42 countries and institutions represented. Among those attending are China Premier Li Qiang, French President Emmanuel Macron, Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi, German Chancellor Friedrich Merz, UK Prime Minister Keir Starmer, Brazilian President Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva, Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan, Italian Prime Minister Giorgia Meloni, Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi, Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney and Australian Prime Minister Anthony Albanese. In his opening remarks, Ramaphosa said leaders had agreed to take concrete action to ensure debt sustainability for low-income countries. The summit agenda covers disaster resilience, debt sustainability for developing countries, a just energy transition and critical minerals. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles">News</a> on the big summits can also read our report on the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/trump-xi-putin-summit-peace-declaration-20261121">Trump, Xi and Putin peace declaration in Shenzhen</a>.</p><h2>What the G20 summit Johannesburg means</h2><p>This is the first G20 leaders summit on African soil, and the African Union is a permanent G20 member since 2023, so the meeting is a test of whether the group can deliver for the Global South without its largest economy at the table. The United States is not taking part at all: President Trump said no US government official would attend, citing human rights violations in South Africa, and Washington has since signalled it would oppose any leaders declaration beyond a chair statement. That leaves the summit facing the prospect of ending without the usual consensus declaration, the first time that would happen since the leaders summits began in 2008. Ramaphosa has said the absence will not stop the event, telling leaders that fundamental decisions will be taken anyway. For workers and businesses, the debt discussion matters most: several leaders warned that many countries are forced to choose between servicing debt and funding essential public services.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>No leaders declaration has been agreed yet, and the sources do not say whether one will be issued at all or whether the meeting will end with a chair statement instead. They do not give the full list of leaders attending, the timetable for the second day, or any figures for debt relief or critical minerals commitments. Reports differ on whether the summit began on Saturday or Sunday, with some dating the opening to Saturday 21 November; this article follows the summit dates of 22 to 23 November given in the preview and the official schedule.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://sundayexpress.co.ls/?p=35436">Sunday Express</a>, the leaders call for debt sustainability and the opening remarks; <a href="https://legalbrief.co.za/diary/legalbrief-africa-new/story/us-to-oppose-any-g20-declaration-2/print/">Legalbrief Africa</a>, the US opposition to a leaders declaration and the chair statement prospect; <a href="https://pulseofafrica.info/news/734">Pulse of Africa</a>, the attendance list and the first G20 in Africa.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>When is the G20 summit Johannesburg?</h3><p>The 20th G20 Leaders Summit runs on 22 and 23 November 2026 in Johannesburg, South Africa.</p><h3>Why is the United States not at the G20 summit?</h3><p>President Trump said no US government official would attend, citing human rights violations in South Africa.</p><h3>Will the summit issue a leaders declaration?</h3><p>That is not yet decided. The US has signalled it would oppose anything beyond a chair statement, so a consensus declaration is in doubt.</p>$$,
$$<p>G20 शिखर सम्मेलन जोहानेसबर्ग आइतबार २२ नोभेम्बरमा सुरु भयो। अफ्रिकामा आयोजना भएको यो पहिलो G20 नेताहरूको बैठक हो, जसको अध्यक्षता दक्षिण अफ्रिकाका राष्ट्रपति सिरिल रामाफोसाले गरेका छन्। अमेरिका भने अनुपस्थित छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>शिखर सम्मेलन</td><td>२०औँ G20 नेताहरूको शिखर सम्मेलन, जोहानेसबर्ग, २२–२३ नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>आयोजक</td><td>राष्ट्रपति सिरिल रामाफोसा, दक्षिण अफ्रिका</td></tr><tr><td>विषय</td><td>एकता, समानता, दिगोपन</td></tr><tr><td>अनुपस्थित</td><td>अमेरिका: कुनै पनि अमेरिकी सरकारी अधिकारी छैनन्</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>G20 शिखर सम्मेलन जोहानेसबर्गमा के भयो</h2><p>नेताहरू नासरेक एक्स्पो सेन्टरमा दुईदिने बैठकका लागि भेला भए, जसमा करिब ४२ देश र संस्थाहरू सहभागी छन्। रामाफोसाले उद्घाटनमा कम आय भएका देशहरूको ऋण दिगोपनाका लागि ठोस कदम चाल्न नेताहरू सहमत भएको बताए। एजेन्डामा विपद् सहनशीलता, विकासोन्मुख देशहरूको ऋण दिगोपना, न्यायपूर्ण ऊर्जा संक्रमण र महत्वपूर्ण खनिज छन्।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>अफ्रिकी भूमिमा भएको यो पहिलो G20 शिखर सम्मेलन हो र अफ्रिकी संघ २०२३ देखि स्थायी सदस्य छ। अमेरिका अनुपस्थित भएकाले सम्मेलनले सर्वसम्मत नेताहरूको घोषणापत्रबिना अन्त्य हुने सम्भावना छ, जुन २००८ पछि पहिलो पटक हुनेछ।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>अहिलेसम्म कुनै नेताहरूको घोषणा सहमति भएको छैन, र स्रोतहरूले अध्यक्षको वक्तव्य जारी हुन्छ वा हुँदैन भन्ने बताएका छैनन्। ऋण राहत वा महत्वपूर्ण खनिजसम्बन्धी कुनै अङ्क पनि दिइएको छैन।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://sundayexpress.co.ls/?p=35436">Sunday Express</a>, ऋण दिगोपनाको आह्वान; <a href="https://legalbrief.co.za/diary/legalbrief-africa-new/story/us-to-oppose-any-g20-declaration-2/print/">Legalbrief Africa</a>, अमेरिकी विरोध; <a href="https://pulseofafrica.info/news/734">Pulse of Africa</a>, सहभागी सूची।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>G20 शिखर सम्मेलन जोहानेसबर्ग कहिले हो?</h3><p>२०औँ G20 नेताहरूको शिखर सम्मेलन २२ र २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा जोहानेसबर्गमा हुँदैछ।</p><h3>अमेरिका किन G20 शिखर सम्मेलनमा छैन?</h3><p>राष्ट्रपति ट्रम्पले दक्षिण अफ्रिकामा मानव अधिकार उल्लङ्घन भएको भन्दै कुनै अमेरिकी सरकारी अधिकारी नपठाउने बताए।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://sundayexpress.co.ls/?p=35436', 'https://legalbrief.co.za/diary/legalbrief-africa-new/story/us-to-oppose-any-g20-declaration-2/print/', 'https://pulseofafrica.info/news/734'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- inter-miami-columbus-crew-playoff-upset-20261122 (news; English 580 words; Nepali 249 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'inter-miami-columbus-crew-playoff-upset-20261122', 'news', 'USA',
'Columbus Crew Stun Messi Inter Miami 3-0 in Playoff Opener',
'कोलम्बस क्रुले मेसीको इन्टर मियामीलाई प्लेअफमा ३–० ले हरायो',
'Columbus Crew stunned Lionel Messi and Inter Miami 3-0 in their MLS Cup playoff opener, with Gonzalo Tapia scoring twice in Miami.',
'कोलम्बस क्रुले MLS कप प्लेअफको पहिलो खेलमा लियोनल मेसीको इन्टर मियामीलाई मियामीमै ३–० ले हराएर सनसनी मच्चायो।',
$$<p>Columbus Crew stunned Lionel Messi and Inter Miami 3-0 on Saturday in Game 1 of their MLS Cup playoff series, with Gonzalo Tapia scoring twice and the seventh seeds now one win from eliminating the defending champions.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Match</td><td>Inter Miami 0, Columbus Crew 3, MLS Cup Playoffs Round One, Game 1</td></tr><tr><td>Venue</td><td>Nu Stadium, Miami, Saturday 21 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Goals</td><td>Tapia 9th minute penalty and 58th minute; Taha Habroune 52nd minute</td></tr><tr><td>Red card</td><td>Gonzalo Lujan, Inter Miami, 36th minute</td></tr><tr><td>Next match</td><td>Game 2 in Columbus on Friday 27 November, 8 pm ET</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What happened in Inter Miami v Columbus</h2><p>Tapia converted a ninth-minute penalty after Miami goalkeeper Dayne St Clair brought him down in the box, and Columbus took full control in the 36th minute when Gonzalo Lujan was sent off, leaving Miami down to 10 men. Homegrown midfielder Taha Habroune doubled the lead in the 52nd minute and Tapia finished his brace six minutes later. Goalkeeper Patrick Schulte made five saves, including a diving stop to deny Messi a trademark free kick. Messi was shown a yellow card just before half-time after bouncing a throw-in off the side of Tapia's face, an incident Columbus coach Laurent Courtois said afterwards should have been a red card. Before kick-off, Inter Miami co-owner Jorge Mas presented Messi with the 2026 Golden Boot award; Messi scored 26 goals in the regular season with 17 assists, and he is the first player to win the award in consecutive seasons. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/usa">USA</a> sport can also read our preview of the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/las-vegas-grand-prix-2026-race-time-schedule-20261121">Las Vegas Grand Prix 2026 race time and schedule</a>.</p><h2>What the Inter Miami Columbus result means</h2><p>The result is the first upset of the 2026 MLS Cup Playoffs and it puts the defending champions on the brink. Columbus, who were 15th in the Eastern Conference on 1 September, have now won their past six regular-season matches plus this playoff opener, the longest active streak in the league. In the best-of-three format there is no aggregate score, so Miami must win Game 2 in Columbus on Friday 27 November to stay alive and force a deciding third match. Miami can lean on being the best road team in MLS this season, with 10 away wins, two more than any other team. For Messi, the defeat echoes 2024, when his first MLS season also ended early in the playoffs.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not say whether Messi will face any further sanction for the throw-in incident beyond the yellow card, or whether Lujan's red card will be appealed. They do not give the attendance at Nu Stadium or the television audience, and they do not say when a deciding Game 3 would be played if Miami win Game 2. The MLS report lists a conflicting Game 2 opponent line for Columbus, so this article follows the AP report and the series schedule: Game 2 is in Columbus on Friday 27 November.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.mlssoccer.com/news/columbus-crew-stun-lionel-messi-miami-in-game-1-upset">MLS</a>, the official match report (goals, red card, Game 2 date); <a href="https://www.thescore.com/mls/news/3662370/tapias-brace-helps-columbus-beat-messi-inter-miami-3-0-in-game-1">theScore</a>, the AP match report (Tapia brace, Schulte five saves, Golden Boot); <a href="https://www.philstar.com/sports/2026/11/22/2571866/messi-furore-after-columbus-thrash-miami-mls-cup">Philstar</a>, the throw-in incident and the coach reaction.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What was the Inter Miami Columbus score?</h3><p>Columbus Crew beat Inter Miami 3-0 in Game 1 of their first-round playoff series.</p><h3>When is Game 2 of Inter Miami v Columbus?</h3><p>Game 2 is in Columbus on Friday 27 November at 8 pm ET, shown on Apple TV and FS1.</p><h3>Can Inter Miami still win the series?</h3><p>Yes. It is a best-of-three series, so Miami must win Game 2 to force a deciding third match.</p>$$,
$$<p>कोलम्बस क्रुले शनिबार MLS कप प्लेअफ शृङ्खलाको पहिलो खेलमा लियोनल मेसीको इन्टर मियामीलाई ३–० ले हराएर सनसनी मच्चायो। गोन्थालो तापियाले दुई गोल गरे र सातौँ वरीयताको टोली अब साविक विजेतालाई बाहिर पार्न एक जित टाढा छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>खेल</td><td>इन्टर मियामी ०, कोलम्बस क्रु ३, MLS कप प्लेअफ पहिलो चरण, खेल १</td></tr><tr><td>स्थल</td><td>नु स्टेडियम, मियामी, शनिबार २१ नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>गोल</td><td>तापिया ९औँ मिनेट पेनाल्टी र ५८औँ मिनेट; ताहा हाब्रुन ५२औँ मिनेट</td></tr><tr><td>रातो कार्ड</td><td>गोन्थालो लुहान, इन्टर मियामी, ३६औँ मिनेट</td></tr><tr><td>अर्को खेल</td><td>खेल २ कोलम्बसमा शुक्रबार २७ नोभेम्बर, राति ८ बजे ET</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>इन्टर मियामी विरुद्ध कोलम्बसमा के भयो</h2><p>तापियाले नवौँ मिनेटमा पेनाल्टीबाट गोल गरे, र ३६औँ मिनेटमा गोन्थालो लुहानले रातो कार्ड पाएपछि मियामी १० खेलाडीमा सीमित भयो। ताहा हाब्रुनले ५२औँ मिनेटमा अग्रता दोब्बर बनाए र तापियाले छ मिनेटपछि दोस्रो गोल गरे। गोलरक्षक प्याट्रिक शुल्टेले पाँच बचाउ गरे। खेल सुरु हुनुअघि मेसीलाई २०२६ गोल्डेन बुट पुरस्कार दिइएको थियो; उनले नियमित सिजनमा २६ गोल र १७ असिस्ट गरे।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>यो २०२६ MLS कप प्लेअफको पहिलो उलटफेर हो र यसले साविक विजेतालाई बाहिरिने संघारमा पुर्याएको छ। बेस्ट-अफ-थ्री ढाँचामा मियामीले जीवित रहन शुक्रबार २७ नोभेम्बरमा कोलम्बसमा खेल २ जित्नै पर्छ।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>थ्रो-इन घटनाका लागि मेसीले पहेँलो कार्डबाहेक थप सजाय पाउँछन् वा पाउँदैनन् भन्ने स्रोतहरूले बताएका छैनन्। नु स्टेडियमको उपस्थिति वा टेलिभिजन दर्शक संख्या पनि दिइएको छैन।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.mlssoccer.com/news/columbus-crew-stun-lionel-messi-miami-in-game-1-upset">MLS</a>, आधिकारिक खेल रिपोर्ट; <a href="https://www.thescore.com/mls/news/3662370/tapias-brace-helps-columbus-beat-messi-inter-miami-3-0-in-game-1">theScore</a>, AP खेल रिपोर्ट; <a href="https://www.philstar.com/sports/2026/11/22/2571866/messi-furore-after-columbus-thrash-miami-mls-cup">Philstar</a>, थ्रो-इन घटना।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>इन्टर मियामी विरुद्ध कोलम्बसको स्कोर के भयो?</h3><p>कोलम्बस क्रुले पहिलो चरणको प्लेअफ शृङ्खलाको खेल १ मा इन्टर मियामीलाई ३–० ले हरायो।</p><h3>खेल २ कहिले हो?</h3><p>खेल २ शुक्रबार २७ नोभेम्बरमा कोलम्बसमा राति ८ बजे ET मा हुनेछ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.mlssoccer.com/news/columbus-crew-stun-lionel-messi-miami-in-game-1-upset', 'https://www.thescore.com/mls/news/3662370/tapias-brace-helps-columbus-beat-messi-inter-miami-3-0-in-game-1', 'https://www.philstar.com/sports/2026/11/22/2571866/messi-furore-after-columbus-thrash-miami-mls-cup'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- hunger-games-sunrise-reaping-box-office-56-million-20261122 (news; English 464 words; Nepali 196 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'hunger-games-sunrise-reaping-box-office-56-million-20261122', 'news', 'USA',
'Hunger Games Sunrise on the Reaping Earns 56 Million on Friday',
'हंगर गेम्स सनराइज अन द रिपिङले शुक्रबार ५६ मिलियन कमायो',
'The Hunger Games Sunrise on the Reaping earned 56 million dollars on Friday from 4,018 theatres, on course for a 120 million dollar opening.',
'द हंगर गेम्स: सनराइज अन द रिपिङले शुक्रबार ४,०१८ हलहरूबाट ५६ मिलियन डलर कमायो, १२० मिलियन डलर ओपनिङतर्फ अघि बढ्यो।',
$$<p>The Hunger Games Sunrise on the Reaping earned 56 million dollars on Friday 20 November from 4,018 North American theatres, putting the Lionsgate prequel on course for an opening weekend of more than 120 million dollars.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Film</td><td>The Hunger Games: Sunrise on the Reaping, directed by Francis Lawrence</td></tr><tr><td>Friday gross</td><td>56 million dollars, including 21 million dollars from Thursday previews</td></tr><tr><td>Theatres</td><td>4,018 in North America</td></tr><tr><td>Projected opening</td><td>More than 120 million dollars for the three-day weekend</td></tr><tr><td>Audience scores</td><td>A-minus CinemaScore; 95 percent audience score on Rotten Tomatoes</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What happened with Hunger Games Sunrise on the Reaping</h2><p>The sixth film in the franchise, centred on a young Haymitch Abernathy and adapted from Suzanne Collins prequel novel, took the number one spot on Friday with about 70 percent of all box office takings that day. Lionsgate had forecast a cautious opening of more than 80 million dollars, while industry watchers expected between 100 and 130 million; the 56 million dollar Friday, including 21 million from previews and early-access screenings, pushed the projection past 120 million. That would make it the fourth-best opening in the franchise, behind Catching Fire, the original Hunger Games and Mockingjay Part 1, and Lionsgate first 100 million dollar opening weekend since Mockingjay Part 2 in 2015. The film also took the third-biggest opening day of 2026, passing Christopher Nolan The Odyssey. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles">News</a> on big releases can also read our preview of <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/wicked-for-good-opens-november-21-box-office-preview-20261120">Wicked: For Good opening on 21 November</a>.</p><h2>What the Hunger Games Sunrise on the Reaping opening means</h2><p>The opening is a franchise comeback after the 2023 prequel The Ballad of Songbirds and Snakes opened to only 19 million dollars on its first Friday. Premium formats drove the result: large-format and IMAX screens accounted for 47 percent of the weekend, with 15 percent from IMAX alone. With no direct competition until 18 December, the film is well placed for the holiday weeks, and analysts expect it to hold the top spot over Thanksgiving, when the franchise has traditionally rallied. The full weekend figure will be confirmed on Sunday, when studio projections follow the Saturday numbers.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The final three-day total is not yet confirmed: 120 million dollars is a projection based on Friday, not a reported weekend gross, and the sources give different model estimates, from 120 million to 131 million. Global figures are also incomplete, with one report giving 76 million dollars worldwide for the opening weekend while others report only the North American Friday. The sources do not state the film exact production budget beyond roughly 150 million dollars, or its marketing spend.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.the-numbers.com/">The Numbers</a>, the Friday box office figures and the Saturday update (56 million dollars, 4,018 theatres, 120 million dollar projection, A-minus CinemaScore); <a href="https://comicbook.com/movies/news/hunger-games-sunrise-on-the-reaping-is-about-to-break-a-major-odyssey-milestone/">ComicBook.com</a>, the opening-day record and the 95 percent audience score; <a href="https://ameriledger.com/article/box-office-hunger-games-sunrise-on-reaping-opening-to-120m-4th-best-series">AmeriLedger</a>, the Deadline-sourced Saturday figures and the franchise ranking.</p>$$,
$$<p>द हंगर गेम्स: सनराइज अन द रिपिङले शुक्रबार २० नोभेम्बरमा उत्तर अमेरिकाका ४,०१८ हलहरूबाट ५६ मिलियन डलर कमायो, जसले लायन्सगेटको प्रिक्वेललाई १२० मिलियन डलरभन्दा बढीको ओपनिङ विकेन्डतर्फ अघि बढायो।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>फिल्म</td><td>द हंगर गेम्स: सनराइज अन द रिपिङ, निर्देशक फ्रान्सिस लरेन्स</td></tr><tr><td>शुक्रबारको कमाइ</td><td>५६ मिलियन डलर, बिहीबार प्रिभ्युबाट २१ मिलियन डलरसहित</td></tr><tr><td>हल</td><td>उत्तर अमेरिकामा ४,०१८</td></tr><tr><td>अनुमानित ओपनिङ</td><td>तीनदिने विकेन्डमा १२० मिलियन डलरभन्दा बढी</td></tr><tr><td>दर्शक स्कोर</td><td>A- सिनेमा स्कोर; रटन टोमाटोजमा ९५ प्रतिशत दर्शक स्कोर</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>हंगर गेम्स सनराइज अन द रिपिङमा के भयो</h2><p>युवा हेमिच एबरनेथीमा केन्द्रित फ्रेन्चाइजीको छैटौँ फिल्मले शुक्रबार नम्बर एक स्थान लियो। लायन्सगेटले ८० मिलियन डलरभन्दा बढीको सतर्क अनुमान गरेको थियो, तर ५६ मिलियन डलरको शुक्रबारपछि अनुमान १२० मिलियन डलर नाघ्यो। यो फ्रेन्चाइजीको चौथो उत्कृष्ट ओपनिङ हुनेछ र २०१५ पछि लायन्सगेटको पहिलो १०० मिलियन डलर ओपनिङ विकेन्ड हुनेछ।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>यो ओपनिङ २०२३ को प्रिक्वेल द ब्यालेड अफ सोङबर्ड्स एन्ड स्नेक्सपछि फ्रेन्चाइजीको पुनरागमन हो, जसले पहिलो शुक्रबार मात्र १९ मिलियन डलर कमाएको थियो। १८ डिसेम्बरसम्म कुनै प्रत्यक्ष प्रतिस्पर्धा नभएकाले फिल्म बिदाका हप्ताहरूमा राम्रो स्थितिमा छ।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>अन्तिम तीनदिने कुल अझै पुष्टि भएको छैन: १२० मिलियन डलर शुक्रबारमा आधारित अनुमान हो, रिपोर्ट गरिएको विकेन्ड कमाइ होइन। विश्वव्यापी अङ्क पनि अपूर्ण छन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.the-numbers.com/">The Numbers</a>, शुक्रबारको बक्स अफिस अङ्क; <a href="https://comicbook.com/movies/news/hunger-games-sunrise-on-the-reaping-is-about-to-break-a-major-odyssey-milestone/">ComicBook.com</a>, ओपनिङ दिनको रेकर्ड; <a href="https://ameriledger.com/article/box-office-hunger-games-sunrise-on-reaping-opening-to-120m-4th-best-series">AmeriLedger</a>, शनिबारका अङ्क।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.the-numbers.com/', 'https://comicbook.com/movies/news/hunger-games-sunrise-on-the-reaping-is-about-to-break-a-major-odyssey-milestone/', 'https://ameriledger.com/article/box-office-hunger-games-sunrise-on-reaping-opening-to-120m-4th-best-series'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- trump-credit-card-interest-rate-cap-10-percent-20261122 (news; English 634 words; Nepali 281 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'trump-credit-card-interest-rate-cap-10-percent-20261122', 'news', 'USA',
'Trump Vows to Cap Credit Card Interest Rates at 10 Percent',
'ट्रम्पले क्रेडिट कार्ड ब्याजदर १० प्रतिशतमा सीमित गर्ने वाचा गरे',
'Trump vowed to work with the incoming Democratic Congress to cap credit card interest rates at 10 percent, reviving his January 2026 pledge.',
'ट्रम्पले क्रेडिट कार्ड ब्याजदर १० प्रतिशतमा सीमित गर्न आगामी डेमोक्र्याटिक कंग्रेससँग काम गर्ने वाचा गरे, जनवरी २०२६ को वाचा दोहोर्याउँदै।',
$$<p>President Donald Trump said on Saturday that he would work with the incoming Democratic Congress to cap credit card interest rates at 10 percent, reviving a campaign promise that stalled under Republican control of Congress.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Proposal</td><td>Cap credit card interest rates at 10 percent</td></tr><tr><td>Current median rate</td><td>About 22.2 percent, per an August survey by the New York Federal Reserve</td></tr><tr><td>Average rate on accounts charged interest</td><td>22.36 percent in the third quarter of 2026, per Federal Reserve data</td></tr><tr><td>Estimated saving</td><td>About 100 billion dollars a year in interest, per researchers who studied the pledge</td></tr><tr><td>Next step</td><td>Congress must pass a law; the president cannot impose a cap alone</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What happened with the credit card interest rate cap</h2><p>Speaking to Fox News Channel Saturday in America, Trump said: I would do it. These credit card companies have made a lot. He first proposed the cap in January 2026 as part of the White House affordability push, but banks and credit card companies opposed it aggressively, and the Republican-controlled Congress made little effort to deliver it. That could change now that Democrats will control both the House and the Senate after the November 2026 midterm elections. Senator Elizabeth Warren, who is expected to become chair of the Senate Banking Committee, has said repeatedly she wants to cap rates, and in response to the Fox News interview she said: Let us cap credit card interest rates and save Americans money. Other Democrats, including Representative Maxine Waters, have also backed the idea. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/usa">USA</a> politics can also read our explainer on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/trump-third-term-22nd-amendment-explained-20261121">Trump, a third term and the 22nd Amendment</a>.</p><h2>What the credit card interest rate cap means</h2><p>A 10 percent cap would substantially cut what card companies can charge: the median card rate is roughly 22.2 percent, and many cards, especially for borrowers with lower credit scores, charge well above 25 percent. Researchers who studied the pledge after it was first announced found Americans would save roughly 100 billion dollars in interest a year. The politics are unusual, with the proposal backed by both Trump and progressive Democrats, and by a bipartisan bill introduced in February 2025 by Senators Bernie Sanders and Josh Hawley in the Senate and Representatives Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez and Anna Paulina Luna in the House. But the industry argument has not gone away: banks say a cap would force them to cancel cards for poorer and less creditworthy customers or cut back sharply on rewards. The proposal has also faced resistance from the financial services industry, and as of November 2026 neither bill has passed.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>No bill has been introduced in the new Congress yet, and the sources do not say when a vote might happen, whether the cap would last one year as Trump originally proposed or longer, or what would happen to existing card agreements. The president cannot impose a nationwide cap by executive order or by a social media post; it would require an act of Congress and his signature. The sources do not say whether the cap would cover all cards or only some, or how lenders would be expected to adjust.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/international/world-news/trump-vows-to-work-with-democrats-to-cap-credit-card-interest-rates-at-10/articleshow/136065785.cms">The Economic Times</a>, the AP report on Trump Saturday interview (10 percent cap, Warren response, 100 billion dollar saving); <a href="https://www.nolo.com/legal-encyclopedia/can-president-trump-legally-cap-credit-card-interest-rates-at-10.html">Nolo</a>, the legal path and the Federal Reserve average rate of 22.36 percent; <a href="https://www.business-standard.com/amp/world-news/trump-seeks-10-cap-on-credit-card-interest-rates-with-democrats-support-126112100946_1.html">Business Standard</a>, the AP report on the January proposal and the industry opposition.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What is the proposed credit card interest rate cap?</h3><p>A cap of 10 percent on credit card interest rates, proposed by President Trump and backed by Democrats including Senator Elizabeth Warren.</p><h3>Can the president cap credit card rates alone?</h3><p>No. A nationwide cap would require Congress to pass a law and the president to sign it.</p><h3>How much would Americans save under a 10 percent cap?</h3><p>Researchers who studied the pledge estimated savings of roughly 100 billion dollars a year in interest.</p>$$,
$$<p>राष्ट्रपति डोनाल्ड ट्रम्पले शनिबार भने कि उनी क्रेडिट कार्ड ब्याजदर १० प्रतिशतमा सीमित गर्न आगामी डेमोक्र्याटिक कंग्रेससँग काम गर्नेछन्। यो उनको चुनावी वाचा हो, जुन रिपब्लिकन नियन्त्रणमा अघि बढ्न सकेन।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>प्रस्ताव</td><td>क्रेडिट कार्ड ब्याजदर १० प्रतिशतमा सीमित गर्ने</td></tr><tr><td>हालको मध्य दर</td><td>करिब २२.२ प्रतिशत, न्यूयोर्क फेडरल रिजर्भको अगस्ट सर्वेक्षणअनुसार</td></tr><tr><td>अनुमानित बचत</td><td>वर्षमा करिब १०० अर्ब डलर ब्याज बचत</td></tr><tr><td>अर्को कदम</td><td>कंग्रेसले कानून पारित गर्नुपर्छ; राष्ट्रपतिले एक्लै सीमा लगाउन सक्दैनन्</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>क्रेडिट कार्ड ब्याजदर सीमामा के भयो</h2><p>फक्स न्यूजसँग कुरा गर्दै ट्रम्पले भने, क्रेडिट कार्ड कम्पनीहरूले धेरै कमाएका छन्। उनले जनवरी २०२६ मा पहिलोपटक यो सीमा प्रस्ताव गरेका थिए, तर बैंकहरूले कडा विरोध गरे र रिपब्लिकन कंग्रेसले खासै प्रयास गरेन। नोभेम्बर २०२६ को मध्यावधि चुनावपछि डेमोक्र्याटहरूले दुवै सदन नियन्त्रण गर्ने भएकाले अब अवस्था बदलिन सक्छ। सिनेटर एलिजाबेथ वारेनले बारम्बार दर सीमित गर्न चाहेको बताएकी छन्।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>१० प्रतिशतको सीमाले कार्ड कम्पनीहरूले लिने शुल्क धेरै घटाउनेछ: मध्य दर करिब २२.२ प्रतिशत छ, र कम क्रेडिट स्कोर भएकाहरूका कार्डमा २५ प्रतिशतभन्दा बढी लाग्छ। अनुसन्धानकर्ताहरूका अनुसार अमेरिकीहरूले वर्षमा करिब १०० अर्ब डलर ब्याज बचत गर्नेछन्। तर बैंकहरू भन्छन्, सीमाले गरिब र कम क्रेडिट योग्य ग्राहकहरूका कार्ड रद्द गर्न वा रिवार्ड घटाउन बाध्य पार्नेछ।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>नयाँ कंग्रेसमा अहिलेसम्म कुनै विधेयक पेस भएको छैन, र स्रोतहरूले मतदान कहिले हुन्छ, सीमा एक वर्षका लागि हुन्छ वा लामो, भन्ने बताएका छैनन्। राष्ट्रपतिले कार्यकारी आदेश वा सामाजिक सञ्जाल पोस्टबाट राष्ट्रव्यापी सीमा लगाउन सक्दैनन्; त्यसका लागि कंग्रेसको कानून चाहिन्छ।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/international/world-news/trump-vows-to-work-with-democrats-to-cap-credit-card-interest-rates-at-10/articleshow/136065785.cms">The Economic Times</a>, AP रिपोर्ट; <a href="https://www.nolo.com/legal-encyclopedia/can-president-trump-legally-cap-credit-card-interest-rates-at-10.html">Nolo</a>, कानुनी बाटो; <a href="https://www.business-standard.com/amp/world-news/trump-seeks-10-cap-on-credit-card-interest-rates-with-democrats-support-126112100946_1.html">Business Standard</a>, AP रिपोर्ट।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>प्रस्तावित क्रेडिट कार्ड ब्याजदर सीमा के हो?</h3><p>क्रेडिट कार्ड ब्याजदरमा १० प्रतिशतको सीमा, जुन राष्ट्रपति ट्रम्पले प्रस्ताव गरेका हुन् र सिनेटर एलिजाबेथ वारेनसहित डेमोक्र्याटहरूले समर्थन गरेका छन्।</p><h3>के राष्ट्रपतिले एक्लै क्रेडिट कार्ड दर सीमित गर्न सक्छन्?</h3><p>होइन। राष्ट्रव्यापी सीमाका लागि कंग्रेसले कानून पारित गर्नुपर्छ र राष्ट्रपतिले हस्ताक्षर गर्नुपर्छ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/international/world-news/trump-vows-to-work-with-democrats-to-cap-credit-card-interest-rates-at-10/articleshow/136065785.cms', 'https://www.nolo.com/legal-encyclopedia/can-president-trump-legally-cap-credit-card-interest-rates-at-10.html', 'https://www.business-standard.com/amp/world-news/trump-seeks-10-cap-on-credit-card-interest-rates-with-democrats-support-126112100946_1.html'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- bayer-roundup-settlement-725-billion-approved-20261122 (news; English 569 words; Nepali 241 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'bayer-roundup-settlement-725-billion-approved-20261122', 'news', 'USA',
'Bayer Roundup Settlement of 7.25 Billion Approved by Judge',
'बायर राउन्डअप सम्झौता ७.२५ अर्ब डलर न्यायाधीशबाट स्वीकृत',
'A Missouri judge approved the Bayer Roundup settlement worth up to 7.25 billion dollars, covering current and future lymphoma claims.',
'मिसौरीका न्यायाधीशले बायर राउन्डअप सम्झौता स्वीकृत गरे, जुन ७.२५ अर्ब डलरसम्मको छ र हाल तथा भविष्यका लिम्फोमा दाबी समेट्छ।',
$$<p>A Missouri judge gave final approval on Friday 20 November to the Bayer Roundup settlement, a nationwide deal worth up to 7.25 billion dollars that could resolve thousands of lawsuits claiming the weedkiller Roundup caused cancer.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Settlement</td><td>Up to 7.25 billion dollars, paid in annual instalments over up to 21 years</td></tr><tr><td>Court</td><td>St. Louis Circuit Court, Missouri; Judge Timothy Boyer</td></tr><tr><td>Claims covered</td><td>Current and future claims of non-Hodgkin lymphoma linked to Roundup exposure</td></tr><tr><td>Individual payouts</td><td>From 10,000 to 165,000 dollars, depending on exposure, age at diagnosis and severity</td></tr><tr><td>Attorneys fees</td><td>600 million dollars included in the settlement</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What happened with the Bayer Roundup settlement</h2><p>St. Louis Circuit Judge Timothy Boyer approved the nationwide class settlement, rejecting all objections. The deal covers two groups: people exposed to Roundup before 17 February 2026 who already have a diagnosis of non-Hodgkin lymphoma, and people who receive such a diagnosis before the end of a 16-year period after final approval. Bayer will make capped annual payments into a special fund over up to 21 years, totalling as much as 7.25 billion dollars, including payments already made. Judge Boyer said the average individual payouts are fair and adequate and the total is among the largest in the history of mass tort personal-injury class action settlements. Bayer chief executive Bill Anderson called the approval a decisive milestone in the company strategy to mitigate the risks of both pending and future Roundup litigation. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/usa">USA</a> business news can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/walmart-q3-results-revenue-188-billion-20261121">Walmart third-quarter results, with revenue of 188 billion dollars</a>.</p><h2>What the Bayer Roundup settlement means</h2><p>The settlement could finally resolve litigation that has weighed on Bayer for close to a decade, since it acquired Monsanto. It is unusual because it covers future claims as well as current ones, giving the company a capped, long-term route out of the Roundup cases rather than facing new lawsuits for years. The approval follows a June US Supreme Court ruling on whether plaintiffs could pursue state law claims over the absence of a cancer warning on the Roundup label, which Judge Boyer cited in finding the settlement met the test for adequacy. For farm workers and others who used the product, the deal opens a claims process with payouts based on how they used Roundup, how old they were when diagnosed and how severe their illness is.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The final approval order remains subject to appeal, and the sources do not say whether any objector will appeal or when the claims process will open. They do not state how many people are expected to claim, what the average payout will be in practice, or how the fund will be administered. The settlement does not establish that Roundup causes cancer: Bayer has consistently denied that the weedkiller causes cancer, and the sources do not say the company admitted liability.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.wdrbwave.com/2026/11/20/court-approves-725-billion-settlement-with-bayer-over-claims-roundup-weedkiller-caused-cancer/">WDRB</a>, the AP report on the approval (7.25 billion dollars, payouts, judge comments, 21-year payments); <a href="https://www.agri-pulse.com/articles/25540-judge-approves-725b-settlement-covering-current-future-roundup-claims">Agri-Pulse</a>, the settlement structure and the two claimant subclasses; <a href="https://www.nprillinois.org/2026-11-21/bayer-reaches-roundup-settlement-that-could-cost-the-company-billions">NPR Illinois</a>, the NPR report on the approval and the payout range.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How much is the Bayer Roundup settlement worth?</h3><p>Up to 7.25 billion dollars, paid in annual instalments over up to 21 years.</p><h3>Who can claim under the settlement?</h3><p>People exposed to Roundup before 17 February 2026 who have, or later receive within 16 years, a diagnosis of non-Hodgkin lymphoma.</p><h3>How much will each person receive?</h3><p>Between 10,000 and 165,000 dollars, depending on exposure, age at diagnosis and the severity of the illness.</p>$$,
$$<p>मिसौरीका न्यायाधीशले शुक्रबार २० नोभेम्बरमा बायर राउन्डअप सम्झौतालाई अन्तिम स्वीकृति दिए। यो ७.२५ अर्ब डलरसम्मको राष्ट्रव्यापी सम्झौता हो, जसले झारनाशक राउन्डअपले क्यान्सर गरायो भन्ने हजारौँ मुद्दा समाधान गर्न सक्छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>सम्झौता</td><td>७.२५ अर्ब डलरसम्म, २१ वर्षसम्म वार्षिक किस्तामा</td></tr><tr><td>अदालत</td><td>सेन्ट लुइस सर्किट अदालत, मिसौरी; न्यायाधीश टिमोथी बोयर</td></tr><tr><td>दाबी</td><td>राउन्डअप सम्पर्कसँग जोडिएको नन-हजकिन लिम्फोमाका हाल र भविष्यका दाबी</td></tr><tr><td>व्यक्तिगत भुक्तानी</td><td>१०,००० देखि १६५,००० डलरसम्म</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>बायर राउन्डअप सम्झौतामा के भयो</h2><p>सेन्ट लुइस सर्किट न्यायाधीश टिमोथी बोयरले सबै आपत्ति अस्वीकार गर्दै राष्ट्रव्यापी वर्ग सम्झौता स्वीकृत गरे। सम्झौताले दुई समूहलाई समेट्छ: १७ फेब्रुअरी २०२६ अघि राउन्डअपको सम्पर्कमा आएका र नन-हजकिन लिम्फोमा निदान भएकाहरू, र अन्तिम स्वीकृतिपछिको १६ वर्षभित्र निदान पाउनेहरू। बायरले २१ वर्षसम्म वार्षिक भुक्तानी गर्नेछ। बायरका प्रमुख कार्यकारी बिल एन्डरसनले स्वीकृतिलाई निर्णायक उपलब्धि भने।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>सम्झौताले बायरमाथि झन्डै एक दशकदेखि भार परेको मुद्दा अन्त्य गर्न सक्छ। यो असामान्य छ किनभने यसले हालका मात्र होइन, भविष्यका दाबी पनि समेट्छ। जुनमा अमेरिकी सर्वोच्च अदालतको फैसलापछि यो स्वीकृति आएको हो।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>अन्तिम स्वीकृति आदेश अपिलको विषय बन्न सक्छ, र स्रोतहरूले कसैले अपिल गर्छन् वा दाबी प्रक्रिया कहिले खुल्छ भन्ने बताएका छैनन्। कति जनाले दाबी गर्छन् वा औसत भुक्तानी कति हुन्छ भन्ने पनि थाहा छैन। सम्झौताले राउन्डअपले क्यान्सर गराउँछ भन्ने स्थापित गर्दैन; बायरले त्यसलाई निरन्तर अस्वीकार गर्दै आएको छ।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.wdrbwave.com/2026/11/20/court-approves-725-billion-settlement-with-bayer-over-claims-roundup-weedkiller-caused-cancer/">WDRB</a>, AP रिपोर्ट; <a href="https://www.agri-pulse.com/articles/25540-judge-approves-725b-settlement-covering-current-future-roundup-claims">Agri-Pulse</a>, सम्झौताको संरचना; <a href="https://www.nprillinois.org/2026-11-21/bayer-reaches-roundup-settlement-that-could-cost-the-company-billions">NPR Illinois</a>, NPR रिपोर्ट।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>बायर राउन्डअप सम्झौता कति मूल्यको छ?</h3><p>७.२५ अर्ब डलरसम्म, २१ वर्षसम्म वार्षिक किस्तामा भुक्तानी गरिनेछ।</p><h3>सम्झौताअन्तर्गत कसले दाबी गर्न सक्छ?</h3><p>१७ फेब्रुअरी २०२६ अघि राउन्डअपको सम्पर्कमा आएका र १६ वर्षभित्र नन-हजकिन लिम्फोमा निदान भएका वा पाउने व्यक्तिहरू।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.wdrbwave.com/2026/11/20/court-approves-725-billion-settlement-with-bayer-over-claims-roundup-weedkiller-caused-cancer/', 'https://www.agri-pulse.com/articles/25540-judge-approves-725b-settlement-covering-current-future-roundup-claims', 'https://www.nprillinois.org/2026-11-21/bayer-reaches-roundup-settlement-that-could-cost-the-company-billions'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- nvidia-sec-accounting-probe-huang-senate-testimony-20261122 (news; English 582 words; Nepali 269 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'nvidia-sec-accounting-probe-huang-senate-testimony-20261122', 'news', 'USA',
'Nvidia Faces SEC Accounting Probe as Huang Agrees to Testify',
'एनभिडियामाथि SEC लेखा अनुसन्धान, हुआङ गवाही दिन सहमत',
'The Nvidia SEC probe deepened as Reuters reported accounting issues under review, while Jensen Huang agreed to testify before the US Senate.',
'रोयटर्सले लेखा समस्या समीक्षामा रहेको बताएपछि एनभिडिया SEC अनुसन्धान गहिरियो, जबकि जेन्सेन हुआङ सिनेटमा गवाही दिन सहमत भए।',
$$<p>The Nvidia SEC probe deepened on Friday 20 November, as Reuters reported that SEC enforcement staff are examining possible accounting issues at the chipmaker, while former chief executive Jensen Huang agreed to testify in public before the US Senate.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Company</td><td>Nvidia, Santa Clara, California</td></tr><tr><td>SEC matter</td><td>Enforcement staff examining possible accounting issues, per Reuters, citing two people briefed on the matter</td></tr><tr><td>Share price</td><td>Closed Friday at 125.53 dollars, down about 14 percent; down 48 percent from the 6 October record of 239.24 dollars</td></tr><tr><td>Senate hearing</td><td>Huang agreed to testify in public before the Senate Banking Committee; no date set, 3 December first requested</td></tr><tr><td>House interview</td><td>Closed-door transcribed interview on 1 December</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What happened in the Nvidia SEC probe</h2><p>Reuters reported on Friday, citing two people briefed on the matter, that SEC enforcement staff are scrutinising potential accounting issues at Nvidia. The SEC declined to comment and Nvidia did not immediately respond. Reuters said an investigation is not evidence of wrongdoing, and many close without an enforcement action, and it could not determine when the inquiry started or exactly what issues are being examined. The Wall Street Journal had reported earlier in the week that the SEC had opened an investigation into Nvidia. Shares were already down more than 6 percent before the Reuters report and closed 14 percent lower at 125.53 dollars, with the Nasdaq down 5.3 percent and the S and P 500 down 3.7 percent on the day. Separately, a spokesperson for Senate Banking chair Tim Scott confirmed on Friday that Huang will testify in public before the committee. Scott first asked for 3 December and has said he wants to hear from Huang and Commerce Secretary Howard Lutnick before Christmas. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/usa">USA</a> tech news can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/nvidia-q3-earnings-results-20261119">Nvidia third-quarter earnings results</a>.</p><h2>What the Nvidia SEC probe means</h2><p>The probe adds a regulatory front to a crisis that has already cost Nvidia about 2.7 trillion dollars in market value since its 6 October record. Huang resigned as chief executive on 12 November, and the board has said it unanimously accepted his resignation and does not intend to reinstate him, even after President Trump said on Friday that Nvidia should bring him back. California Attorney General Rob Bonta served Nvidia with an investigative subpoena on Thursday, investigating whether Nvidia or Huang actions resulted in China obtaining advanced chips or confidential information, and whether the company misled investors about the risk. The Justice Department is running a criminal investigation of Megaspeed, the Singapore company at the centre of the chip diversion claims. For investors, the week ahead is now about two dates: the closed-door House interview on 1 December and the public Senate hearing, which Scott must hold before Democrats take over the committee when the new Congress meets on 3 January.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not say what accounting issues the SEC is examining, when the inquiry began, or whether it will lead to any enforcement action. They do not give a date for the Senate hearing, and they do not say what Huang will be asked about the accounting questions as opposed to the China chip claims. The sources do not say whether the board search for a permanent chief executive has produced a shortlist, or whether any board members are still pushing to reinstate Huang.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.tradingview.com/news/benzinga:02fcd6e1e094b:0-jensen-huang-set-for-public-senate-banking-hearing-as-sec-scrutinizes-nvidia-accounting-report/">TradingView</a>, the Benzinga report on the Senate testimony and the SEC accounting inquiry; <a href="https://www.sovereignmagazine.com/article/nvidia-troubles-sec-accounting">Sovereign Magazine</a>, the Reuters report, the 14 percent fall and the California subpoena; <a href="https://cosanalyst.com/articles/nvidia-jensen-huang-board-investigation-what-it-means-for-nvda-stock-2026-11-08/">Cosanalyst</a>, the Reuters and CNBC sourcing and the hearing dates.</p>$$,
$$<p>शुक्रबार २० नोभेम्बरमा एनभिडिया SEC अनुसन्धान गहिरियो, रोयटर्सले SEC प्रवर्तन कर्मचारीहरूले चिप निर्माताको सम्भावित लेखा समस्याहरू जाँच गरिरहेको रिपोर्ट गरेपछि, जबकि पूर्व प्रमुख कार्यकारी जेन्सेन हुआङ अमेरिकी सिनेटमा सार्वजनिक रूपमा गवाही दिन सहमत भए।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>कम्पनी</td><td>एनभिडिया, सान्ता क्लारा, क्यालिफोर्निया</td></tr><tr><td>SEC विषय</td><td>प्रवर्तन कर्मचारीहरूले सम्भावित लेखा समस्याहरू जाँच गर्दै, रोयटर्सअनुसार</td></tr><tr><td>सेयर मूल्य</td><td>शुक्रबार १२५.५३ डलरमा बन्द, करिब १४ प्रतिशत घट्यो; ६ अक्टोबरको रेकर्डबाट ४८ प्रतिशत तल</td></tr><tr><td>सिनेट सुनुवाइ</td><td>हुआङ सिनेट बैंकिङ समितिमा सार्वजनिक गवाही दिन सहमत; मिति तय छैन, ३ डिसेम्बर पहिलो अनुरोध</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>एनभिडिया SEC अनुसन्धानमा के भयो</h2><p>रोयटर्सले शुक्रबार दुई जानकार स्रोत उद्धृत गर्दै SEC प्रवर्तन कर्मचारीहरूले एनभिडियाका सम्भावित लेखा समस्याहरू जाँच गरिरहेको बताएको छ। SEC ले टिप्पणी गर्न अस्वीकार गर्यो र एनभिडियाले तत्काल जवाफ दिएन। रोयटर्सले अनुसन्धान गलत कामको प्रमाण होइन र धेरै अनुसन्धान कुनै कारबाहीबिना बन्द हुन्छन् भन्यो। सेयर रोयटर्स रिपोर्टअघि नै ६ प्रतिशतभन्दा बढी घटेको थियो र १४ प्रतिशत घटेर १२५.५३ डलरमा बन्द भयो। सिनेट बैंकिङ अध्यक्ष टिम स्कटका प्रवक्ताले शुक्रबार हुआङले समितिमा सार्वजनिक गवाही दिने पुष्टि गरे।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>अनुसन्धानले ६ अक्टोबरको रेकर्डदेखि करिब २.७ ट्रिलियन डलर बजार मूल्य गुमाइसकेको संकटमा नियामक मोर्चा थपेको छ। हुआङले १२ नोभेम्बरमा प्रमुख कार्यकारीबाट राजीनामा दिए, र बोर्डले उनको राजीनामा सर्वसम्मतिले स्वीकार गरेको र पुनः नियुक्त गर्ने मनसाय नभएको बताएको छ। क्यालिफोर्निया महान्यायाधिवक्ता रोब बोन्टाले बिहीबार एनभिडियालाई अनुसन्धानात्मक समन्स दिए।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>SEC ले कुन लेखा समस्याहरू जाँच गरिरहेको छ, अनुसन्धान कहिले सुरु भयो, वा यसले कुनै प्रवर्तन कारबाही निम्त्याउँछ भन्ने स्रोतहरूले बताएका छैनन्। सिनेट सुनुवाइको मिति पनि दिइएको छैन, र स्थायी प्रमुख कार्यकारी खोजीले छोटो सूची बनाएको छ वा छैन भन्ने पनि थाहा छैन।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.tradingview.com/news/benzinga:02fcd6e1e094b:0-jensen-huang-set-for-public-senate-banking-hearing-as-sec-scrutinizes-nvidia-accounting-report/">TradingView</a>, सिनेट गवाही र SEC लेखा अनुसन्धानबारे बेन्जिङ्गा रिपोर्ट; <a href="https://www.sovereignmagazine.com/article/nvidia-troubles-sec-accounting">Sovereign Magazine</a>, रोयटर्स रिपोर्ट र क्यालिफोर्निया समन्स; <a href="https://cosanalyst.com/articles/nvidia-jensen-huang-board-investigation-what-it-means-for-nvda-stock-2026-11-08/">Cosanalyst</a>, स्रोत र सुनुवाइ मितिहरू।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.tradingview.com/news/benzinga:02fcd6e1e094b:0-jensen-huang-set-for-public-senate-banking-hearing-as-sec-scrutinizes-nvidia-accounting-report/', 'https://www.sovereignmagazine.com/article/nvidia-troubles-sec-accounting', 'https://cosanalyst.com/articles/nvidia-jensen-huang-board-investigation-what-it-means-for-nvda-stock-2026-11-08/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

