INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'hpe-zoom-agilent-earnings-monday-november-23-20261122', 'news', 'USA',
'HPE, Zoom and Agilent Report Earnings on Monday 23 November',
'HPE, जुम र एजिलेन्टले सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बरमा कमाइ रिपोर्ट गर्छन्',
'Earnings Monday November 23 brings HPE, Zoom and Agilent results after the US close, plus November PMIs, after a brutal week for stocks.',
'सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बरको कमाइमा HPE, जुम र एजिलेन्टको नतिजा बजार बन्दपछि आउँदैछ, नोभेम्बर PMI सहित, स्टकका लागि कठिन हप्तापछि।',
$$<p>Earnings Monday November 23 brings a heavy slate of results after the US close, led by Hewlett Packard Enterprise, Zoom Communications and Agilent Technologies, alongside November purchasing managers surveys in the eurozone, the UK and the US.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Date</td><td>Monday 23 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>After the US close</td><td>Hewlett Packard Enterprise Q4, Zoom Communications Q3, Agilent Technologies Q4, Jacobs Solutions Q4, Symbotic Q4</td></tr><tr><td>Before the open</td><td>Dick's Sporting Goods Q3, Kohl's Q3, Burlington Stores Q3, Abercrombie and Fitch Q3</td></tr><tr><td>Consensus estimates</td><td>HPE 1.28 to 1.30 dollars a share on about 14.4 billion dollars revenue; Zoom 1.49 to 1.53 dollars on about 1.28 billion dollars</td></tr><tr><td>Data</td><td>November manufacturing and services PMIs for the eurozone, UK and US</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What to watch in earnings Monday November 23</h2><p>Four AI hardware names report this week, and Hewlett Packard Enterprise kicks the sequence off after the US close on Monday, with Analog Devices before the open on Tuesday and Dell Technologies and HP after the close the same day. HPE is expected to report fourth-quarter earnings of about 1.28 to 1.30 dollars a share on revenue of about 14.4 billion dollars. Zoom Communications reports third-quarter results after the close too, with consensus at about 1.49 to 1.53 dollars a share on about 1.28 billion dollars of revenue, followed by Autodesk and Workday after the close on Tuesday. Agilent Technologies and Jacobs Solutions also report after the close on Monday. Before the open, retailers Dick's Sporting Goods, Kohl's, Burlington Stores and Abercrombie and Fitch report third-quarter results, giving an early read on US consumer spending ahead of Black Friday. In total, 26 companies report on Monday, six before the open and 19 after the close. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/usa">USA</a> markets can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/walmart-q3-results-revenue-188-billion-20261121">Walmart third-quarter results, with revenue of 188 billion dollars</a>.</p><h2>What earnings Monday November 23 means for investors</h2><p>The session comes after a brutal week for US stocks: on Friday 20 November the S and P 500 fell 3.7 percent to 6,910.39, its seventh straight loss, leaving it more than 10 percent below its 6 October record and in correction territory, with an 8.6 percent weekly drop, the worst since April 2025. The Nasdaq fell 5.28 percent on Friday. Against that backdrop, HPE results will be read as a test of AI hardware demand after Nvidia fell 14 percent on Friday on the SEC accounting report, and Zoom results will be read as a test of software spending. The November PMIs, due the same day in the eurozone, the UK and the US, will show whether the sell-off is matched by weakening business activity. No outcome is assumed here: these are the numbers to watch, not a forecast of what they will be.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>Consensus estimates differ between providers: MarketBeat gives HPE at 1.28 dollars and Zoom at 1.49 dollars, while other calendars give 1.30 and 1.53 dollars, so this article gives both figures as a range. The sources do not say what guidance any company will give, and earnings dates can move, so readers should check the live calendar before trading around any report. Nothing in this article predicts whether any stock will rise or fall.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.stockopedia.com/content/the-week-ahead-23-27-nov-sell-off-pmis-us-core-pce-gdp-boe-financial-stability-us-ai-hardware-us-software-cmc-markets-1061141/">Stockopedia</a>, the week ahead (Monday reporters, HPE and Zoom timing, AI hardware sequence); <a href="https://www.marketbeat.com/earnings/tomorrow/?AccountID=4041930&hash=0F4BDEC842AA0970778218EE4F75EBAF992325D902368EFB132BDBECC7EA30039E10D884BE9EE066F854DCC77F3F68EA37D364FFB802AD39260BD5D22E0F4756&utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=newsletterclick">MarketBeat</a>, the Monday 23 November earnings list and consensus estimates; <a href="https://www.cmcmarkets.com/en-ie/news-and-analysis/the-week-ahead-global-pmis-us-pce-dell-earnings">CMC Markets</a>, the Monday 23 November data and results schedule.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Which companies report earnings on Monday 23 November?</h3><p>Hewlett Packard Enterprise, Zoom, Agilent and Jacobs report after the US close; Dick's Sporting Goods, Kohl's, Burlington and Abercrombie and Fitch report before the open.</p><h3>What time do HPE and Zoom report?</h3><p>Both report after the US market close on Monday 23 November 2026.</p><h3>What else is due on Monday 23 November?</h3><p>November manufacturing and services PMIs for the eurozone, the UK and the US.</p>$$,
$$<p>सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बरको कमाइमा अमेरिकी बजार बन्द भएपछि हेवलेट प्याकार्ड इन्टरप्राइज, जुम कम्युनिकेसन्स र एजिलेन्ट टेक्नोलोजिजसहित धेरै नतिजा आउँदैछन्, साथै युरोजोन, बेलायत र अमेरिकामा नोभेम्बरको खरिद प्रबन्धक सर्वेक्षण पनि छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>मिति</td><td>सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>बजार बन्दपछि</td><td>हेवलेट प्याकार्ड इन्टरप्राइज Q4, जुम कम्युनिकेसन्स Q3, एजिलेन्ट टेक्नोलोजिज Q4, ज्याकब्स सोलुसन्स Q4</td></tr><tr><td>खुल्नुअघि</td><td>डिक्स स्पोर्टिङ गुड्स Q3, कोल्स Q3, बर्लिङ्टन स्टोर्स Q3, एबरक्रम्बी एन्ड फिच Q3</td></tr><tr><td>तथ्याङ्क</td><td>युरोजोन, बेलायत र अमेरिकाको नोभेम्बर उत्पादन र सेवा PMI</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बरको कमाइमा के हेर्ने</h2><p>यस हप्ता चार AI हार्डवेयर कम्पनीहरूले नतिजा दिन्छन्, र हेवलेट प्याकार्ड इन्टरप्राइजले सोमबार बजार बन्दपछि क्रम सुरु गर्छ। HPE को चौथो त्रैमासिक आम्दानी करिब १.२८ देखि १.३० डलर प्रति सेयर र राजस्व करिब १४.४ अर्ब डलर हुने अपेक्षा छ। जुमले तेस्रो त्रैमासिक नतिजा बजार बन्दपछि दिनेछ। खुल्नुअघि डिक्स, कोल्स, बर्लिङ्टन र एबरक्रम्बीले खुद्रा नतिजा दिनेछन्, जसले ब्ल्याक फ्राइडेअघि अमेरिकी उपभोक्ता खर्चको प्रारम्भिक संकेत दिनेछ।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>यो सत्र अमेरिकी स्टकका लागि कठिन हप्तापछि आएको हो: शुक्रबार २० नोभेम्बरमा S and P 500 ३.७ प्रतिशत घटेर ६,९१०.३९ मा पुग्यो, जुन ६ अक्टोबरको रेकर्डभन्दा १० प्रतिशतभन्दा बढी तल छ। त्यस पृष्ठभूमिमा HPE नतिजालाई AI हार्डवेयर मागको परीक्षणका रूपमा हेरिनेछ। यो लेखले कुनै नतिजाको पूर्वानुमान गर्दैन; यी हेर्नुपर्ने अङ्कहरू मात्र हुन्।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>सहमति अनुमान प्रदायकअनुसार फरक छन्: HPE का लागि १.२८ र १.३० डलर, जुमका लागि १.४९ र १.५३ डलर, त्यसैले यो लेखले दुवैलाई दायराका रूपमा दिन्छ। कुनै कम्पनीले के मार्गदर्शन दिन्छ भन्ने स्रोतहरूले बताएका छैनन्, र कमाइ मितिहरू सर्न सक्छन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.stockopedia.com/content/the-week-ahead-23-27-nov-sell-off-pmis-us-core-pce-gdp-boe-financial-stability-us-ai-hardware-us-software-cmc-markets-1061141/">Stockopedia</a>, आउँदो हप्ता; <a href="https://www.marketbeat.com/earnings/tomorrow/?AccountID=4041930&hash=0F4BDEC842AA0970778218EE4F75EBAF992325D902368EFB132BDBECC7EA30039E10D884BE9EE066F854DCC77F3F68EA37D364FFB802AD39260BD5D22E0F4756&utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=newsletterclick">MarketBeat</a>, सोमबारको कमाइ सूची; <a href="https://www.cmcmarkets.com/en-ie/news-and-analysis/the-week-ahead-global-pmis-us-pce-dell-earnings">CMC Markets</a>, सोमबारको तालिका।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बरमा कुन कम्पनीहरूले कमाइ रिपोर्ट गर्छन्?</h3><p>हेवलेट प्याकार्ड इन्टरप्राइज, जुम, एजिलेन्ट र ज्याकब्सले बजार बन्दपछि; डिक्स, कोल्स, बर्लिङ्टन र एबरक्रम्बीले खुल्नुअघि रिपोर्ट गर्छन्।</p><h3>HPE र जुमले कहिले रिपोर्ट गर्छन्?</h3><p>दुवैले सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा अमेरिकी बजार बन्द भएपछि रिपोर्ट गर्छन्।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.stockopedia.com/content/the-week-ahead-23-27-nov-sell-off-pmis-us-core-pce-gdp-boe-financial-stability-us-ai-hardware-us-software-cmc-markets-1061141/', 'https://www.marketbeat.com/earnings/tomorrow/?AccountID=4041930&hash=0F4BDEC842AA0970778218EE4F75EBAF992325D902368EFB132BDBECC7EA30039E10D884BE9EE066F854DCC77F3F68EA37D364FFB802AD39260BD5D22E0F4756&utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=newsletterclick', 'https://www.cmcmarkets.com/en-ie/news-and-analysis/the-week-ahead-global-pmis-us-pce-dell-earnings'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- g20-summit-day-two-declaration-decision-20261122 (news; English 637 words; Nepali 293 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'g20-summit-day-two-declaration-decision-20261122', 'news', 'Global',
'G20 Day Two: Leaders Face Decision on Joint Declaration',
'G20 दोस्रो दिन: नेताहरू संयुक्त घोषणामा निर्णयको सामना गर्दै',
'G20 day two brings a decision on Monday: a joint leaders declaration, a chair statement only, or no consensus outcome from Johannesburg.',
'G20 दोस्रो दिन सोमबार निर्णय आउँदैछ: संयुक्त नेताहरूको घोषणा, अध्यक्षको वक्तव्य मात्र, वा जोहानेसबर्गबाट सर्वसम्मत नतिजाबिना अन्त्य।',
$$<p>On day two of the G20 summit Johannesburg, leaders face a decision on Monday 23 November: issue a joint leaders declaration, settle for a chair statement, or end the first G20 on African soil without a consensus outcome at all.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Summit</td><td>20th G20 Leaders Summit, Johannesburg, 22 to 23 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Decision day</td><td>Monday 23 November 2026, the second and final day</td></tr><tr><td>At issue</td><td>Whether to issue a consensus leaders declaration or only a chair statement</td></tr><tr><td>US position</td><td>Washington opposes any deliverable beyond a chair statement; no US official is attending</td></tr><tr><td>Host</td><td>President Cyril Ramaphosa, South Africa</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What to watch on G20 day two</h2><p>The summit opened on Sunday with President Ramaphosa saying leaders had agreed to take concrete action on debt sustainability for low-income countries, and with about 42 countries and institutions represented. But the usual closing product of a G20 summit, a consensus leaders declaration, is in doubt. The United States has sent a clarifying note saying it will oppose the issuance of any G20 deliverable beyond a chair statement, and President Trump has said no US government official would attend. If the summit ends without a declaration, it would be the first since the leaders summits began in 2008 to do so. South Africa sherpa Zane Dangor has been chairing meetings of all sherpas to decide the question. The other route is for South Africa and most other members to bypass the US and issue a declaration anyway, but several countries are wary of defying Washington openly and of breaking the principle that G20 decisions are reached by consensus. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles">News</a> on the summit can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/g20-summit-johannesburg-november-22-preview-20261120">the G20 summit Johannesburg preview</a>.</p><h2>What the G20 leaders declaration decision means</h2><p>The declaration question matters because the summit agenda is built around debt sustainability, disaster resilience, a just energy transition and critical minerals, and a chair statement carries less weight than a consensus declaration, especially if it has not been seen or agreed by all members in advance. John Kirton of the G20 Research Group at the University of Toronto said issuing a chair statement rather than a leaders declaration would be a major retreat. On the other hand, a declaration issued without the United States would still be a major blow to the idea of G20 consensus, and Washington would be unlikely to feel bound by it. Argentina, whose foreign minister is attending in place of President Javier Milei, could also veto much of a declaration. Watch for three signals on Monday: whether a declaration appears at all, what it says on debt relief and critical minerals, and whether Ramaphosa hands the presidency to an empty chair, as he has promised to do symbolically if necessary. No outcome is assumed here.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not say which option the sherpas have chosen, what the draft declaration contains, or when on Monday any document will be released. They do not give figures for debt relief or critical minerals commitments, and they do not say whether the IBSA leaders meeting or the bilateral meetings on the margins will produce separate announcements. The summit could still end with a declaration, a chair statement, or neither, and this article predicts none of them.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://legalbrief.co.za/diary/legalbrief-africa-new/story/us-to-oppose-any-g20-declaration-2/print/">Legalbrief Africa</a>, the US opposition to a declaration, the chair statement prospect and the sherpa process; <a href="https://sundayexpress.co.ls/?p=35436">Sunday Express</a>, the opening day and the debt sustainability agreement; <a href="https://pulseofafrica.info/news/734">Pulse of Africa</a>, the attendance list and the handover to the US presidency.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>When does the G20 summit end?</h3><p>The 20th G20 Leaders Summit ends on Monday 23 November 2026, its second day in Johannesburg.</p><h3>Will the G20 issue a leaders declaration?</h3><p>That is not yet decided. The US opposes anything beyond a chair statement, so a consensus declaration is in doubt.</p><h3>What is a chair statement?</h3><p>A statement issued by the summit chair, South Africa, instead of a consensus declaration agreed by all members.</p>$$,
$$<p>G20 शिखर सम्मेलन जोहानेसबर्गको दोस्रो दिन, सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बरमा नेताहरूले निर्णय गर्नुपर्नेछ: संयुक्त नेताहरूको घोषणा जारी गर्ने, अध्यक्षको वक्तव्यमा मात्र सीमित रहने, वा अफ्रिकी भूमिमा भएको पहिलो G20 सर्वसम्मत नतिजाबिना अन्त्य गर्ने।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>शिखर सम्मेलन</td><td>२०औँ G20 नेताहरूको शिखर सम्मेलन, जोहानेसबर्ग, २२–२३ नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>निर्णय दिन</td><td>सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६, दोस्रो र अन्तिम दिन</td></tr><tr><td>विषय</td><td>सर्वसम्मत नेताहरूको घोषणा जारी गर्ने वा अध्यक्षको वक्तव्य मात्र</td></tr><tr><td>अमेरिकी स्थिति</td><td>वाशिङ्टन अध्यक्षको वक्तव्यभन्दा बाहिर कुनै पनि दस्तावेजको विरोधमा; कुनै अमेरिकी अधिकारी उपस्थित छैनन्</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>G20 दोस्रो दिनमा के हेर्ने</h2><p>शिखर सम्मेलन आइतबार राष्ट्रपति रामाफोसाले कम आय भएका देशहरूको ऋण दिगोपनामा ठोस कदम चाल्न नेताहरू सहमत भएको बताएसँगै सुरु भयो। तर G20 को सामान्य अन्तिम उत्पादन, सर्वसम्मत नेताहरूको घोषणा, शंकामा छ। अमेरिकाले अध्यक्षको वक्तव्यभन्दा बाहिर कुनै पनि दस्तावेजको विरोध गर्ने स्पष्ट सन्देश पठाएको छ। यदि सम्मेलन घोषणाबिना अन्त्य भयो भने, २००८ पछि नेताहरूको शिखर सम्मेलनमा यो पहिलो पटक हुनेछ।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>घोषणाको प्रश्न महत्त्वपूर्ण छ किनभने एजेन्डा ऋण दिगोपना, विपद् सहनशीलता, न्यायपूर्ण ऊर्जा संक्रमण र महत्वपूर्ण खनिजमा आधारित छ, र अध्यक्षको वक्तव्य सर्वसम्मत घोषणाभन्दा कम वजनको हुन्छ। अर्कोतर्फ, अमेरिकाबिना जारी गरिएको घोषणाले पनि G20 सर्वसम्मतिको विचारलाई ठूलो धक्का दिनेछ। सोमबार तीन संकेत हेर्नुहोस्: घोषणा आउँछ वा आउँदैन, ऋण राहत र महत्वपूर्ण खनिजबारे के भनिन्छ, र रामाफोसाले अध्यक्षता खाली कुर्सीलाई हस्तान्तरण गर्छन् वा गर्दैनन्। यो लेखले कुनै पनि नतिजाको पूर्वानुमान गर्दैन।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>शेर्पाहरूले कुन विकल्प रोजेका छन्, मस्यौदा घोषणामा के छ, वा सोमबार कुनै दस्तावेज कहिले जारी हुन्छ भन्ने स्रोतहरूले बताएका छैनन्। ऋण राहत वा महत्वपूर्ण खनिज प्रतिबद्धताका अङ्क पनि दिइएका छैनन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://legalbrief.co.za/diary/legalbrief-africa-new/story/us-to-oppose-any-g20-declaration-2/print/">Legalbrief Africa</a>, घोषणाप्रति अमेरिकी विरोध; <a href="https://sundayexpress.co.ls/?p=35436">Sunday Express</a>, उद्घाटन दिन; <a href="https://pulseofafrica.info/news/734">Pulse of Africa</a>, सहभागी सूची।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>G20 शिखर सम्मेलन कहिले सकिन्छ?</h3><p>२०औँ G20 नेताहरूको शिखर सम्मेलन सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा जोहानेसबर्गमा सकिन्छ।</p><h3>के G20 ले नेताहरूको घोषणा जारी गर्नेछ?</h3><p>त्यो अझै तय भएको छैन। अमेरिकाले अध्यक्षको वक्तव्यभन्दा बाहिर केही पनि विरोध गरेको छ, त्यसैले सर्वसम्मत घोषणा शंकामा छ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://legalbrief.co.za/diary/legalbrief-africa-new/story/us-to-oppose-any-g20-declaration-2/print/', 'https://sundayexpress.co.ls/?p=35436', 'https://pulseofafrica.info/news/734'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- jamie-miller-babydoll-fifth-week-uk-number-one-20261122 (pop-music; English 612 words; Nepali 158 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'jamie-miller-babydoll-fifth-week-uk-number-one-20261122', 'pop-music', 'UK',
'Jamie Miller Babydoll Holds UK No 1 for Fifth Week',
'जेमी मिलरको Babydoll बेलायतमा पाँचौं हप्ता नम्बर एक',
'Jamie Miller Babydoll holds the UK No 1 spot for a fifth straight week on the chart published 20 November, with 64,036 units and a new Billboard Hot 100 peak.',
'जेमी मिलरको Babydoll २० नोभेम्बरमा प्रकाशित चार्टमा लगातार पाँचौं हप्ता बेलायतको नम्बर एकमा रह्यो।',
$$<p>Jamie Miller Babydoll is still the UK No. 1 single, holding the top of the Official Singles Chart for a fifth consecutive week on the chart published on Friday 20 November 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Artist</td><td>Jamie Miller</td></tr><tr><td>Single</td><td>Babydoll</td></tr><tr><td>Chart</td><td>Official Singles Chart</td></tr><tr><td>Position</td><td>No. 1 for a fifth consecutive week</td></tr><tr><td>Chart dates</td><td>20 to 26 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Weeks on chart</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>Units</td><td>64,036, including 48 CDs, 2,823 downloads and 61,165 streaming-equivalent streams</td></tr><tr><td>Billboard Hot 100</td><td>No. 37, a new peak</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>How Jamie Miller Babydoll reached five weeks at No 1</h2><p>Babydoll entered the Official Singles Chart at No. 84 in September, climbed into the Top 10 and reached No. 1 in October, and it has not left the summit since. The chart published on 20 November is its 13th week on the chart and its fifth straight week at No. 1. Music Week reports the single sold 64,036 units in the week, made up of 48 CDs, 2,823 downloads and 61,165 streaming-equivalent streams. That is 3.83 percent down on the week before, and the third weekly dip in a row, but it still finished well ahead of its rivals. Readers following the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/popmusic">Pop Music</a> chart race can also read our earlier report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/jamie-miller-babydoll-uk-singles-chart-20261121">Jamie Miller Babydoll UK Singles Chart</a>, which followed the midweek lead that the official chart has now confirmed.</p><p>The run has put Miller into the record books. Music Week notes he is the first UK-born male soloist to spend five consecutive weeks at No. 1 with a debut hit since Chesney Hawkes did it with The One and Only in 1991. Babydoll is also the longest-running No. 1 by a Welsh male since Dave Edmunds spent six weeks at the top with I Hear You Knocking in 1970. In the United States, the single has reached No. 37 on the Billboard Hot 100, a new peak after a previous best of No. 45.</p><p>Miller is also aiming at the Christmas No. 1 race. His cover of the 1951 standard It is Beginning to Look a Lot Like Christmas, written by Meredith Willson, was released on Friday 20 November. Festive songs are already moving up the chart, with 15 vintage Christmas hits in the Top 75, so the timing puts him in the seasonal race while he still holds the regular No. 1 spot.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>Five weeks at the top turns a breakthrough into a genuine chart run. Babydoll arrived in August and climbed steadily rather than debuting at No. 1, and it has now held off a reshuffled Top 10 and the early Christmas rush. The Christmas cover gives Miller a second song in the seasonal race, but it also risks splitting attention from the single that is still leading the chart.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources used here do not give the margin between Babydoll and the No. 2 single, so the size of the lead is not stated. They do not say whether the Christmas cover will enter the Top 40, or whether Miller plans an album around the two singles. They also do not give a UK chart position for the Antonio Cipriano remix of Babydoll.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.music-news.com/news/UK/192385/Jamie-Miller-commands-UK-Singles-Chart-as-Babydoll-hits-five-weeks-at-Number-1">Music News</a>, reporting the fifth week at No. 1; <a href="https://www.musicweek.com/analysis/read/charts-analysis-jamie-miller-steady-at-summit-amid-festive-singles-influx/095549">Music Week</a>, for the weekly units and the chart records; <a href="https://www.nacionale.com/en/articles/jamie-miller-christmas-song-cover-its-beginning-to-look-a-lot-like-christmas">Nacionale</a>, for the Christmas single release and the chart history.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How many weeks has Babydoll spent at No 1?</h3><p>Five consecutive weeks on the Official Singles Chart published on 20 November 2026, in its 13th week on the chart overall.</p><h3>What is Jamie Miller Christmas single?</h3><p>A cover of It is Beginning to Look a Lot Like Christmas, the 1951 standard by Meredith Willson, released on 20 November 2026.</p><h3>What is Babydoll position on the Billboard Hot 100?</h3><p>No. 37, a new peak, after a previous best of No. 45.</p>$$,
$$<p>जेमी मिलरको Babydoll बेलायतको नम्बर एक गीत बनेर रह्यो। २० नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा प्रकाशित आधिकारिक सिंगल्स चार्टमा यो लगातार पाँचौं हप्ता शीर्ष स्थानमा रह्यो।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>कलाकार</td><td>जेमी मिलर</td></tr><tr><td>गीत</td><td>Babydoll</td></tr><tr><td>चार्ट</td><td>आधिकारिक सिंगल्स चार्ट</td></tr><tr><td>स्थान</td><td>लगातार पाँचौं हप्ता नम्बर एक</td></tr><tr><td>चार्ट मिति</td><td>२० देखि २६ नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>एकाइ</td><td>६४,०३६</td></tr><tr><td>बिलबोर्ड हट १००</td><td>नम्बर ३७, नयाँ उच्च स्थान</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Babydoll पाँच हप्ता नम्बर एकमा कसरी पुग्यो</h2><p>Babydoll सेप्टेम्बरमा नम्बर ८४ मा चार्टमा प्रवेश गरेको थियो, त्यसपछि शीर्ष १० मा पुग्यो र अक्टोबरमा नम्बर एकमा पुग्यो। २० नोभेम्बरमा प्रकाशित चार्ट यसको १३औं हप्ता हो। म्युजिक विकका अनुसार उक्त हप्ता ६४,०३६ एकाइ बिक्री भयो, जसमा ४८ सीडी, २,८२३ डाउनलोड र ६१,१६५ स्ट्रिमिङ बराबर स्ट्रिम समावेश छन्।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>पाँच हप्तासम्म शीर्षमा रहनुले यो गीतलाई सफलताबाट वास्तविक चार्ट दौडमा बदलिदिएको छ। मिलरले २० नोभेम्बरमा क्रिसमस गीतको कभर पनि सार्वजनिक गरेका छन्, त्यसैले उनी मौसमी नम्बर एकको दौडमा पनि छन्।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>स्रोतहरूले Babydoll र दोस्रो स्थानको गीतबीचको अन्तर बताएका छैनन्। क्रिसमस कभर शीर्ष ४० मा पर्छ कि पर्दैन भन्ने पनि बताएका छैनन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.music-news.com/news/UK/192385/Jamie-Miller-commands-UK-Singles-Chart-as-Babydoll-hits-five-weeks-at-Number-1">Music News</a>; <a href="https://www.musicweek.com/analysis/read/charts-analysis-jamie-miller-steady-at-summit-amid-festive-singles-influx/095549">Music Week</a>; <a href="https://www.nacionale.com/en/articles/jamie-miller-christmas-song-cover-its-beginning-to-look-a-lot-like-christmas">Nacionale</a>।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.music-news.com/news/UK/192385/Jamie-Miller-commands-UK-Singles-Chart-as-Babydoll-hits-five-weeks-at-Number-1', 'https://www.musicweek.com/analysis/read/charts-analysis-jamie-miller-steady-at-summit-amid-festive-singles-influx/095549', 'https://www.nacionale.com/en/articles/jamie-miller-christmas-song-cover-its-beginning-to-look-a-lot-like-christmas'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- bigbang-giiirip-single-title-revealed-20261122 (pop-music; English 397 words; Nepali 150 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'bigbang-giiirip-single-title-revealed-20261122', 'pop-music', 'South Korea',
'BigBang GiiiRIP Single Title Revealed for 20th Anniversary',
'बिगब्याङको नयाँ गीतको नाम GiiiRIP सार्वजनिक',
'BigBang GiiiRIP is the title of the group surprise digital single, released 20 November for its 20th anniversary, with G-Dragon and Taeyang among the writers.',
'बिगब्याङको नयाँ डिजिटल गीतको नाम GiiiRIP हो। यो २० नोभेम्बरमा समूहको २०औं वार्षिकोत्सवमा सार्वजनिक भयो।',
$$<p>BigBang GiiiRIP is the title of the K-pop group surprise digital single, released at 2 p.m. KST on Friday 20 November 2026, YG Entertainment has confirmed.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Artist</td><td>BIGBANG</td></tr><tr><td>Single</td><td>GiiiRIP</td></tr><tr><td>Release</td><td>20 November 2026, 2 p.m. KST</td></tr><tr><td>Agency</td><td>YG Entertainment</td></tr><tr><td>Writers</td><td>G-Dragon, writing and composing; Taeyang, lyrics</td></tr><tr><td>Sound</td><td>Electronic hip-hop, interpolating Kelis Milkshake</td></tr><tr><td>Occasion</td><td>20th anniversary year</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What BigBang GiiiRIP is</h2><p>When spoken, GiiiRIP sounds like the Korean word girip, which means to stand up. YG Entertainment said the song carries the group firm determination to keep expanding its musical prowess and rewrite its history. G-Dragon took part in writing and composing the song, while Taeyang also took part in writing the lyrics. The track is an electronic hip-hop single that interpolates Kelis Milkshake, written by Chad Hugo and Pharrell Williams. It arrives three months after BiiiG, as the trio mark their 20th anniversary, and while the group are on their XX: Cosmos world tour. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/popmusic">Pop Music</a> can also read our earlier report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/bigbang-surprise-digital-single-november-20-20261121">BigBang surprise digital single November 20</a>, which noted the title was undisclosed at the time.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The reveal closes the gap left by the surprise announcement, when the single was confirmed but its title was held back. GiiiRIP is the second anniversary single after BiiiG, and the writing credits put the group own members at the centre of the release. The timing also matched the MAMA Awards weekend in Osaka, where BIGBANG took Music Visionary of the Year and Best Music Video for BiiiG, so the anniversary run is being recognised on stage as well as on streaming.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources used here do not give first-day chart positions or streaming figures for GiiiRIP, so its commercial start is not stated. They do not say whether a music video is planned, or whether further anniversary releases will follow. They also do not say how the single was received by fans beyond the release announcement itself.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://en.yna.co.kr/view/AEN20261120002151315?section=culture/k-pop">Yonhap News Agency</a>, for the release, the title and the YG Entertainment statement; <a href="https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/entertainment/k-pop/20261120/bigbang-drops-new-single-giiirip">The Korea Times</a>, for the release details; <a href="https://www.bandwagon.asia/articles/bigbang-put-their-spin-on-kelis-milkshake-with-surprise-single-giiirip">Bandwagon</a>, for the Milkshake interpolation and the electronic hip-hop sound; <a href="https://www.koreajoongangdaily.com/entertainment/big-bang-rises-again-with-giiirip-for-20th-anniversary/12983124">Korea JoongAng Daily</a>, for the anniversary context.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What does GiiiRIP mean?</h3><p>When spoken, it sounds like the Korean word girip, which means to stand up.</p><h3>Who wrote GiiiRIP?</h3><p>G-Dragon took part in writing and composing the song, and Taeyang took part in writing the lyrics.</p><h3>When was GiiiRIP released?</h3><p>On 20 November 2026, at 2 p.m. KST.</p>$$,
$$<p>बिगब्याङको नयाँ डिजिटल गीतको नाम GiiiRIP हो। YG इन्टरटेनमेन्टले पुष्टि गरेअनुसार यो शुक्रबार २० नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा दिउँसो २ बजे कोरियाली समयमा सार्वजनिक भयो।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>कलाकार</td><td>बिगब्याङ</td></tr><tr><td>गीत</td><td>GiiiRIP</td></tr><tr><td>सार्वजनिक मिति</td><td>२० नोभेम्बर २०२६, दिउँसो २ बजे</td></tr><tr><td>एजेन्सी</td><td>YG इन्टरटेनमेन्ट</td></tr><tr><td>लेखक</td><td>जी-ड्रागन र तायाङ</td></tr><tr><td>अवसर</td><td>२०औं वार्षिकोत्सव</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>GiiiRIP के हो</h2><p>बोल्दा GiiiRIP कोरियाली शब्द गिरिप जस्तो सुनिन्छ, जसको अर्थ उठ्नु हो। YG इन्टरटेनमेन्टका अनुसार गीतले समूहको संगीत क्षमता विस्तार गर्ने र आफ्नो इतिहास पुनः लेख्ने दृढ संकल्प व्यक्त गर्छ। जी-ड्रागनले लेखन र संगीतमा भाग लिए, तायाङले गीत लेखनमा भाग लिए। यो इलेक्ट्रोनिक हिप-हप गीत हो जसमा केलिसको Milkshake को अंश समावेश छ।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>नाम सार्वजनिक भएपछि अघिल्लो घोषणामा बाँकी रहेको प्रश्न सकियो। यो BiiiG पछिको दोस्रो वार्षिकोत्सव गीत हो, र सोही सप्ताहन्तमा बिगब्याङले MAMA अवार्डमा म्युजिक भिजनरी अफ द इयर जित्यो।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>स्रोतहरूले GiiiRIP को पहिलो दिनको चार्ट स्थान वा स्ट्रिमिङ तथ्याङ्क दिएका छैनन्। म्युजिक भिडियो बन्छ कि बन्दैन भन्ने पनि बताएका छैनन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://en.yna.co.kr/view/AEN20261120002151315?section=culture/k-pop">Yonhap News Agency</a>; <a href="https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/entertainment/k-pop/20261120/bigbang-drops-new-single-giiirip">The Korea Times</a>; <a href="https://www.bandwagon.asia/articles/bigbang-put-their-spin-on-kelis-milkshake-with-surprise-single-giiirip">Bandwagon</a>।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://en.yna.co.kr/view/AEN20261120002151315?section=culture/k-pop', 'https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/entertainment/k-pop/20261120/bigbang-drops-new-single-giiirip', 'https://www.bandwagon.asia/articles/bigbang-put-their-spin-on-kelis-milkshake-with-surprise-single-giiirip', 'https://www.koreajoongangdaily.com/entertainment/big-bang-rises-again-with-giiirip-for-20th-anniversary/12983124'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- mama-awards-2026-winners-bts-cortis-20261122 (pop-music; English 557 words; Nepali 170 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'mama-awards-2026-winners-bts-cortis-20261122', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'MAMA Awards 2026 Winners: BTS Take Five, CORTIS Win Song of Year',
'MAMA अवार्ड २०२६ विजेता: BTS ले पाँच, CORTIS ले वर्षको गीत जिते',
'MAMA Awards 2026 winners include BTS with five prizes, CORTIS with Song of the Year and ENHYPEN with Fans Choice of the Year at the Osaka ceremony.',
'MAMA अवार्ड २०२६ मा BTS ले पाँच पुरस्कार जिते, CORTIS ले वर्षको गीत र ENHYPEN ले फ्यान्स च्वाइस अफ द इयर जिते।',
$$<p>MAMA Awards 2026 winners were led by BTS, who took five prizes including Artist of the Year and Album of the Year, at the two-night ceremony at Kyocera Dome Osaka on 20 and 21 November 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Event</td><td>MAMA Awards 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Venue</td><td>Kyocera Dome Osaka, Japan</td></tr><tr><td>Dates</td><td>20 and 21 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Artist of the Year</td><td>BTS</td></tr><tr><td>Album of the Year</td><td>BTS, Arirang</td></tr><tr><td>Song of the Year</td><td>CORTIS, RedRed</td></tr><tr><td>Fans Choice of the Year</td><td>ENHYPEN</td></tr><tr><td>Music Visionary of the Year</td><td>BIGBANG</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>MAMA Awards 2026 winners in full</h2><p>The four grand prizes were shared between three acts. BTS took Artist of the Year on the opening night and Album of the Year for Arirang on the second night. CORTIS took Song of the Year for RedRed, and ENHYPEN took Fans Choice of the Year for the second year in a row. BTS did not attend the ceremony because of their world tour, and sent a video message instead. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/popmusic">Pop Music</a> can also read our preview of <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/mama-awards-2026-chapter-2-bigbang-nayeon-20261121">MAMA Awards 2026 Chapter 2</a>, published before the winners were known.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Artist of the Year</td><td>BTS</td></tr><tr><td>Album of the Year</td><td>BTS, Arirang</td></tr><tr><td>Song of the Year</td><td>CORTIS, RedRed</td></tr><tr><td>Fans Choice of the Year</td><td>ENHYPEN</td></tr><tr><td>Music Visionary of the Year</td><td>BIGBANG</td></tr><tr><td>Best Male Group</td><td>BTS</td></tr><tr><td>Best Female Group</td><td>IVE</td></tr><tr><td>Best Male Artist</td><td>Yeonjun</td></tr><tr><td>Best Female Artist</td><td>Soyeon</td></tr><tr><td>Best New Artist</td><td>ALPHA DRIVE ONE, TUIDE</td></tr><tr><td>Best Music Video</td><td>BIGBANG, BiiiG</td></tr><tr><td>Best Collaboration</td><td>LE SSERAFIM feat. j-hope, Spaghetti</td></tr><tr><td>Best Choreography</td><td>ATEEZ, Bad</td></tr><tr><td>Best Dance Performance Male Group</td><td>CORTIS, RedRed</td></tr><tr><td>Best Dance Performance Female Group</td><td>ILLIT, It is Me</td></tr><tr><td>Best Vocal Performance Solo</td><td>Hwasa, Good Goodbye</td></tr></tbody></table><p>BTS finished the two nights with five awards in total: Artist of the Year, Album of the Year, Best Male Group, a Fans Choice Male Top 10 place and a Best Song Top 10 place for Swim. CORTIS collected four awards, adding Best Dance Performance Male Group and a Best Song Top 10 place for RedRed to the Song of the Year prize, a year after winning Best New Artist. ENHYPEN took three awards, and BIGBANG took three: Music Visionary of the Year, Best Music Video for BiiiG and a Fans Choice Male Top 10 place, with Taeyang also winning Best Dance Performance Male Solo for Live Fast Die Slow.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The grand prizes went to three different generations of K-pop in one ceremony. BTS remain the dominant act even while absent on tour, CORTIS moved from newcomer to grand prize winner within a year, and ENHYPEN held the fan-voted top prize for a second straight year. For BIGBANG, the Music Visionary prize caps a 20th anniversary year that also brought the new single GiiiRIP, released on 20 November.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources used here do not give viewing figures for the ceremony, so the size of the audience is not stated. They do not say whether BTS will attend a future ceremony in person. One outlet spells the Best New Artist winner as Tyuideu rather than TUIDE; this article uses TUIDE, as given by The Korea Times and The Indian Express.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/entertainment/20261121/bts-wins-5-mama-awards-as-cortis-takes-song-of-the-year">The Korea Times</a>, for the full winners list and the BTS total; <a href="https://indianexpress.com/article/entertainment/korean/mama-awards-2026-winners-full-list-categories-day-2-chapter-2-bts-cortis-bigbang-10972759/">The Indian Express</a>, for the Chapter 2 winners; <a href="https://www.sportschosun.com/en/k-pop/2026-11-22/202611220100135430012749">Sports Chosun</a>, for the grand prize sweep.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Who won Artist of the Year at the MAMA Awards 2026?</h3><p>BTS, who also won Album of the Year for Arirang and Best Male Group.</p><h3>Who won Song of the Year at the MAMA Awards 2026?</h3><p>CORTIS, for RedRed. It was the group first grand prize.</p><h3>Where were the MAMA Awards 2026 held?</h3><p>At Kyocera Dome Osaka in Japan, across two nights on 20 and 21 November 2026.</p>$$,
$$<p>MAMA अवार्ड २०२६ मा BTS ले पाँच पुरस्कार जिते, जसमा वर्षको कलाकार र वर्षको एल्बम समावेश छन्। समारोह २० र २१ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा ओसाकाको क्योसेरा डोममा दुई रातसम्म चल्यो।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>कार्यक्रम</td><td>MAMA अवार्ड २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>स्थान</td><td>क्योसेरा डोम ओसाका, जापान</td></tr><tr><td>मिति</td><td>२० र २१ नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>वर्षको कलाकार</td><td>BTS</td></tr><tr><td>वर्षको एल्बम</td><td>BTS, Arirang</td></tr><tr><td>वर्षको गीत</td><td>CORTIS, RedRed</td></tr><tr><td>फ्यान्स च्वाइस अफ द इयर</td><td>ENHYPEN</td></tr><tr><td>म्युजिक भिजनरी अफ द इयर</td><td>BIGBANG</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>MAMA अवार्ड २०२६ का विजेताहरू</h2><p>चार ठूला पुरस्कार तीन कलाकारबीच बाँडिए। BTS ले वर्षको कलाकार र Arirang का लागि वर्षको एल्बम जिते। CORTIS ले RedRed का लागि वर्षको गीत जिते भने ENHYPEN ले लगातार दोस्रो वर्ष फ्यान्स च्वाइस अफ द इयर जिते। BTS विश्व भ्रमणमा भएकाले समारोहमा उपस्थित भएनन् र भिडियो सन्देश पठाए।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>ठूला पुरस्कार के-पपका तीन फरक पुस्तामा गए। BTS भ्रमणमा हुँदा पनि प्रमुख कलाकार नै रहे, CORTIS एक वर्षभित्र नवागन्तुकबाट ठूलो पुरस्कार विजेतामा पुगे, र ENHYPEN ले फ्यानले छानेको शीर्ष पुरस्कार दोस्रो वर्ष पनि कायम राखे।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>स्रोतहरूले समारोहको दर्शक संख्या दिएका छैनन्। BTS भविष्यमा प्रत्यक्ष उपस्थित हुन्छन् कि हुँदैनन् भन्ने पनि बताएका छैनन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/entertainment/20261121/bts-wins-5-mama-awards-as-cortis-takes-song-of-the-year">The Korea Times</a>; <a href="https://indianexpress.com/article/entertainment/korean/mama-awards-2026-winners-full-list-categories-day-2-chapter-2-bts-cortis-bigbang-10972759/">The Indian Express</a>; <a href="https://www.sportschosun.com/en/k-pop/2026-11-22/202611220100135430012749">Sports Chosun</a>।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/entertainment/20261121/bts-wins-5-mama-awards-as-cortis-takes-song-of-the-year', 'https://indianexpress.com/article/entertainment/korean/mama-awards-2026-winners-full-list-categories-day-2-chapter-2-bts-cortis-bigbang-10972759/', 'https://www.sportschosun.com/en/k-pop/2026-11-22/202611220100135430012749'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- olivia-rodrigo-billboard-200-fifth-week-number-one-20261122 (pop-music; English 498 words; Nepali 164 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'olivia-rodrigo-billboard-200-fifth-week-number-one-20261122', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'Olivia Rodrigo Holds Billboard 200 No 1 for Fifth Week',
'ओलिभिया रोड्रिगो बिलबोर्ड २०० मा पाँचौं हप्ता नम्बर एक',
'Olivia Rodrigo Billboard 200 run reaches a fifth week at No 1 with 62,000 units, tying SOUR and passing every other album released in 2026.',
'ओलिभिया रोड्रिगोको एल्बम बिलबोर्ड २०० मा ६२,००० एकाइका साथ पाँचौं हप्ता नम्बर एकमा रह्यो।',
$$<p>Olivia Rodrigo Billboard 200 run has reached a fifth nonconsecutive week at No. 1, with you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love earning 62,000 equivalent album units on the chart dated 21 November 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Artist</td><td>Olivia Rodrigo</td></tr><tr><td>Album</td><td>you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love</td></tr><tr><td>Chart</td><td>Billboard 200</td></tr><tr><td>Position</td><td>No. 1, fifth nonconsecutive week</td></tr><tr><td>Chart date</td><td>21 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Units</td><td>62,000 equivalent album units, up 9 percent</td></tr><tr><td>Streams</td><td>51,000 streaming-equivalent units, 54.48 million on-demand streams</td></tr><tr><td>Sales</td><td>11,000 album sales, up 53 percent</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>How the Olivia Rodrigo Billboard 200 run reached five weeks</h2><p>The chart reflects consumption in the United States in the tracking week ending 12 November, with the results reported by Billboard on 15 November. Sales did the decisive work this week: album sales rose 53 percent to 11,000, lifting the album from No. 11 to No. 5 on the Top Album Sales chart, while streaming-equivalent units made up 51,000 of the total. The challenger came close. Lil Baby FRESH debuted at No. 2 with 59,000 units, only 3,000 behind Rodrigo, even though it out-streamed her with 56.81 million on-demand streams and opened at No. 1 on Top Streaming Albums. Morgan Wallen I am the Problem held at No. 3 with 50,000 units, and P1Harmony BLOW UP entered at No. 4 with 45,000 units. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/popmusic">Pop Music</a> can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/olivia-rodrigo-take-me-home-4-christmas-debut-20261121">Olivia Rodrigo Take Me Home 4 Christmas debut</a>, her latest single release.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>Five weeks at No. 1 ties SOUR, from 2021, as the longest-running No. 1 of Rodrigo career among her three chart-topping albums. It also gives you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love the most weeks at No. 1 in 2026 for an album released this year, passing Drake four-week run with ICEMAN, and it ties Taylor Swift The Life of a Showgirl for the most weeks on top in 2026 among all albums. The shape of the win matters too: Lil Baby won the streaming race and still lost, because Rodrigo sold more copies.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The reports used here give the top five in detail but do not publish the full top 10, so the rest of the chart is not stated. They do not say whether Rodrigo will hold No. 1 for a sixth week, which would pass SOUR outright. They also do not give a UK chart position for the album this week.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://hypebeast.com/2026/11/p1harmony-blow-up-no-4-debut-billboard-200">Hypebeast</a>, reporting the Billboard 200 top five and the units; <a href="https://en.playback.gr/olivia-rodrigo-billboard-200-five-weeks/">Playback</a>, reporting the Billboard figures and the SOUR tie; <a href="https://www.rockumweb.com/reportes/2786/olivia-rodrigo-tops-billboard-200-for-fifth-week-as-lil-baby-and-p1harmony-make-top-4-debuts">Rockumweb</a>, for the chart positions and the Lil Baby comparison.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How many weeks has Olivia Rodrigo album spent at No 1?</h3><p>Five nonconsecutive weeks on the Billboard 200 dated 21 November 2026, tying SOUR as her longest No. 1 run.</p><h3>How many units did the album earn this week?</h3><p>62,000 equivalent album units in the United States, up 9 percent, including 51,000 streaming-equivalent units and 11,000 album sales.</p><h3>Who was closest to No 1 this week?</h3><p>Lil Baby, whose album FRESH debuted at No. 2 with 59,000 units, 3,000 behind Rodrigo.</p>$$,
$$<p>ओलिभिया रोड्रिगोको एल्बम बिलबोर्ड २०० मा पाँचौं हप्ता नम्बर एकमा रह्यो। २१ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को चार्टमा you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love ले ६२,००० बराबर एल्बम एकाइ कमायो।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>कलाकार</td><td>ओलिभिया रोड्रिगो</td></tr><tr><td>एल्बम</td><td>you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love</td></tr><tr><td>चार्ट</td><td>बिलबोर्ड २००</td></tr><tr><td>स्थान</td><td>पाँचौं हप्ता नम्बर एक</td></tr><tr><td>चार्ट मिति</td><td>२१ नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>एकाइ</td><td>६२,०००, ९ प्रतिशतले बढेको</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पाँच हप्ता नम्बर एकमा कसरी पुग्यो</h2><p>यो चार्टले १२ नोभेम्बरमा समाप्त भएको हप्ताको अमेरिकी उपभोग देखाउँछ। एल्बम बिक्री ५३ प्रतिशतले बढेर ११,००० पुग्यो, जसले एल्बमलाई शीर्ष एल्बम बिक्री चार्टमा नम्बर ११ बाट नम्बर ५ मा पुर्यायो। लिल बेबीको FRESH ५९,००० एकाइका साथ नम्बर दुईमा आयो, रोड्रिगोभन्दा केवल ३,००० पछि।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>पाँच हप्ता नम्बर एकमा रहनुले यो एल्बमलाई SOUR सँग बराबरीमा पुर्यायो, जुन रोड्रिगोको सबैभन्दा लामो नम्बर एक दौड हो। यो २०२६ मा सार्वजनिक भएका एल्बममध्ये सबैभन्दा धेरै हप्ता नम्बर एकमा रहने एल्बम पनि बन्यो।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>स्रोतहरूले शीर्ष पाँचबाहेक पूर्ण शीर्ष १० दिएका छैनन्। रोड्रिगो छैटौं हप्ता पनि नम्बर एकमा रहन्छिन् कि रहँदिनन् भन्ने पनि बताएका छैनन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://hypebeast.com/2026/11/p1harmony-blow-up-no-4-debut-billboard-200">Hypebeast</a>; <a href="https://en.playback.gr/olivia-rodrigo-billboard-200-five-weeks/">Playback</a>; <a href="https://www.rockumweb.com/reportes/2786/olivia-rodrigo-tops-billboard-200-for-fifth-week-as-lil-baby-and-p1harmony-make-top-4-debuts">Rockumweb</a>।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://hypebeast.com/2026/11/p1harmony-blow-up-no-4-debut-billboard-200', 'https://en.playback.gr/olivia-rodrigo-billboard-200-five-weeks/', 'https://www.rockumweb.com/reportes/2786/olivia-rodrigo-tops-billboard-200-for-fifth-week-as-lil-baby-and-p1harmony-make-top-4-debuts'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- u2-carnaval-de-luz-uk-albums-chart-number-one-20261122 (pop-music; English 486 words; Nepali 159 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'u2-carnaval-de-luz-uk-albums-chart-number-one-20261122', 'pop-music', 'UK',
'U2 Carnaval de Luz Tops UK Albums Chart for 12th No 1',
'U2 को Carnaval de Luz बेलायतको एल्बम चार्टमा नम्बर एक',
'U2 Carnaval de Luz debuts at No 1 on the UK albums chart, the band 12th chart topper and first of original material since 2009.',
'U2 को Carnaval de Luz बेलायतको एल्बम चार्टमा नम्बर एकमा आयो, ब्यान्डको १२औं चार्ट विजेता।',
$$<p>U2 Carnaval de Luz has debuted at No. 1 on the Official Albums Chart dated 20 November 2026, giving the Irish band a 12th UK No. 1 album.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Artist</td><td>U2</td></tr><tr><td>Album</td><td>Carnaval de Luz</td></tr><tr><td>Chart</td><td>Official Albums Chart</td></tr><tr><td>Position</td><td>No. 1</td></tr><tr><td>Chart date</td><td>20 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Release</td><td>13 November 2026, Island Records</td></tr><tr><td>Format</td><td>12 tracks, 16th studio album</td></tr><tr><td>First-week sales</td><td>Over 42,000</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>How U2 Carnaval de Luz reached No 1</h2><p>The Official Charts Company confirmed the result on Friday 20 November. Carnaval de Luz is the band first No. 1 album of original material since No Line on the Horizon in 2009, a gap of 17 years, and their first collection of new songs since Songs of Experience in 2017. The 12-track record features the single The Greatest Show on Earth. Around 90 percent of its first-week sales came on physical formats, and it also topped the Official Vinyl Albums Chart. The album outsold the rest of the UK top five combined. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/popmusic">Pop Music</a> can also read our earlier report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/u2-carnaval-de-luz-dolly-parton-torn-20261121">U2 Carnaval de Luz and Dolly Parton Torn</a>, published ahead of the chart result.</p><p>The achievement draws U2 level with Bruce Springsteen on 12 UK No. 1 albums apiece. Only Elvis Presley and Madonna on 13, Taylor Swift on 14, The Rolling Stones and The Beatles on 15, and Robbie Williams on 16 sit ahead of them on the all-time list. The album also arrived in the band 50th anniversary year, marking five decades since the group formed at school in Dublin in 1976, and it gives them UK No. 1 albums across four different decades. It also debuted at No. 1 in Ireland, their 11th Irish chart-topper. Elsewhere on the UK albums chart, Olivia Rodrigo was at No. 2 and Noah Kahan climbed to No. 3.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>A No. 1 built almost entirely on physical sales is a reminder that heritage acts still move records in shops, not just on streaming. For U2, the result ends a nine-year wait for new material with a chart-topper rather than a quiet return, and it puts the band third among groups on the all-time UK albums list, behind only The Beatles and The Rolling Stones.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources used here do not give a precise first-week sales total beyond over 42,000, so the exact figure is not stated. They do not give a US chart position for Carnaval de Luz, and they do not say whether the band plan a tour behind the album.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.officialcharts.com/chart-news/u2-carnaval-de-luz-number-1-album/">Official Charts Company</a>, confirming the No. 1 album and the all-time rankings; <a href="https://www.kjwl.com/2026/11/20/u2s-carnaval-de-luz-becomes-its-12th-u-k-no-1-album-moving-band-up-all-time-leaderboard/">K-Jewel</a>, for the chart position and the Springsteen tie; <a href="https://en.playback.gr/u2-carnaval-de-luz-12th-uk-number-one/">Playback</a>, for the release details and the vinyl chart result.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How many UK No 1 albums do U2 have now?</h3><p>Twelve, drawing level with Bruce Springsteen on the all-time list.</p><h3>When was U2 last No 1 album of original material?</h3><p>No Line on the Horizon in 2009, seventeen years before Carnaval de Luz.</p><h3>What label released Carnaval de Luz?</h3><p>Island Records, on 13 November 2026.</p>$$,
$$<p>U2 को Carnaval de Luz २० नोभेम्बर २०२६ को आधिकारिक एल्बम चार्टमा नम्बर एकमा आयो। यससँगै आइरिस ब्यान्डको बेलायतमा १२औं नम्बर एक एल्बम बन्यो।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>कलाकार</td><td>U2</td></tr><tr><td>एल्बम</td><td>Carnaval de Luz</td></tr><tr><td>चार्ट</td><td>आधिकारिक एल्बम चार्ट</td></tr><tr><td>स्थान</td><td>नम्बर एक</td></tr><tr><td>चार्ट मिति</td><td>२० नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>सार्वजनिक मिति</td><td>१३ नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>पहिलो हप्ताको बिक्री</td><td>४२,००० भन्दा बढी</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Carnaval de Luz नम्बर एकमा कसरी पुग्यो</h2><p>आधिकारिक चार्ट कम्पनीले २० नोभेम्बरमा नतिजा पुष्टि गर्यो। यो २००९ को No Line on the Horizon पछि ब्यान्डको मौलिक सामग्रीसहितको पहिलो नम्बर एक एल्बम हो, अर्थात् १७ वर्षको अन्तर। पहिलो हप्ताको बिक्रीको करिब ९० प्रतिशत भौतिक संस्करणबाट आयो, र एल्बमले आधिकारिक भिनाइल एल्बम चार्टमा पनि शीर्ष स्थान लियो।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>यो नतिजाले U2 लाई ब्रुस स्प्रिङस्टिनसँग बराबरीमा पुर्यायो, दुवैका १२ वटा बेलायती नम्बर एक एल्बम छन्। ब्यान्डको ५०औं वार्षिकोत्सवको वर्षमा आएको यो एल्बमले चार फरक दशकमा नम्बर एक एल्बम दिने उपलब्धि पनि पूरा गर्यो।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>स्रोतहरूले ४२,००० भन्दा बढी भन्नेबाहेक ठ्याक्कै पहिलो हप्ताको बिक्री अङ्क दिएका छैनन्। अमेरिकी चार्ट स्थान र भ्रमण योजनाबारे पनि बताएका छैनन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.officialcharts.com/chart-news/u2-carnaval-de-luz-number-1-album/">Official Charts Company</a>; <a href="https://www.kjwl.com/2026/11/20/u2s-carnaval-de-luz-becomes-its-12th-u-k-no-1-album-moving-band-up-all-time-leaderboard/">K-Jewel</a>; <a href="https://en.playback.gr/u2-carnaval-de-luz-12th-uk-number-one/">Playback</a>।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.officialcharts.com/chart-news/u2-carnaval-de-luz-number-1-album/', 'https://www.kjwl.com/2026/11/20/u2s-carnaval-de-luz-becomes-its-12th-u-k-no-1-album-moving-band-up-all-time-leaderboard/', 'https://en.playback.gr/u2-carnaval-de-luz-12th-uk-number-one/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- harry-styles-zero-grammy-nominations-kiss-all-the-time-20261122 (pop-music; English 477 words; Nepali 135 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'harry-styles-zero-grammy-nominations-kiss-all-the-time-20261122', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'Harry Styles Gets Zero Grammy Nominations for Kiss All the Time',
'ह्यारी स्टाइल्सको Kiss All the Time ले शून्य ग्र्यामी नामाङ्कन पायो',
'Harry Styles Grammy nominations stand at zero for Kiss All the Time, despite the album debuting at No 1 and a 30 night Madison Square Garden residency.',
'ह्यारी स्टाइल्सको Kiss All the Time ले ग्र्यामीमा शून्य नामाङ्कन पायो, एल्बम नम्बर एकमा आए पनि।',
$$<p>Harry Styles Grammy nominations for his fourth album stand at zero, after Kiss All the Time. Disco, Occasionally received no nominations for the 2027 Grammy Awards.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Artist</td><td>Harry Styles</td></tr><tr><td>Album</td><td>Kiss All the Time. Disco, Occasionally</td></tr><tr><td>Released</td><td>6 March 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Grammy nominations</td><td>Zero</td></tr><tr><td>Submitted</td><td>Album of the Year, Pop Vocal Album</td></tr><tr><td>Single submitted</td><td>Aperture, for Record, Song, Pop Solo Performance and Music Video</td></tr><tr><td>Previous album</td><td>Harry's House won Album of the Year</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Why Harry Styles Grammy nominations did not come</h2><p>The album, known to fans as KissCo, was submitted in the major pop categories, including Album of the Year and Pop Vocal Album. The single Aperture was submitted for Record, Song, Pop Solo Performance and Music Video, Coming Up Roses was submitted for Best Arrangement, and the Netflix special One Night in Manchester was submitted for Best Music Film. None of them made the nominations list. Rolling Stone reports that the album was not submitted in the Dance Pop categories, or in Rock, where it might have faced an easier field. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/popmusic">Pop Music</a> can also read our round-up of <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/grammy-nominations-2027-snubs-surprises-20261119">Grammy nominations 2027 snubs and surprises</a>.</p><p>The snub is striking because the album was a commercial success. Kiss All the Time. Disco, Occasionally debuted at No. 1 and, in the UK, sold more than 183,000 copies in its first week, the biggest opening week of the year at that point, according to the Official Charts Company. Styles has also spent 2026 playing his Together, Together tour, including a 30-night residency at Madison Square Garden. Rolling Stone notes the album moved far from the Harry's House sound into moody electroclash club music, and that many first-week reviewers misread the title as promising a straight disco record.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The shutout is already being called one of the biggest snubs of the 2027 nominations, and it shows how far commercial success and Grammy recognition can diverge. Styles won Album of the Year for his last album, yet the follow-up, released in the same eligibility window, was passed over entirely. The tour, meanwhile, goes on regardless, and the album remains one of the year biggest sellers.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources used here do not quote the Recording Academy on the decision, so no official reason is given. They do not say whether Styles or his team will comment, and they do not give the full list of nominees in the categories where the album was submitted.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://rollingstoneindia.com/the-grammy-nominations-blanked-harry-styles-what-happened/">Rolling Stone India</a>, for the shutout, the submissions and the tour; <a href="https://artsandvoices.com/articles/grammys-shut-out-harry-styles-after-album-of-the-year-win">Arts and Voices</a>, for the zero nominations and the Harry's House comparison.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How many Grammy nominations did Harry Styles get for Kiss All the Time?</h3><p>Zero. The album and its singles received no nominations for the 2027 Grammy Awards.</p><h3>What did Harry's House win at the Grammys?</h3><p>Album of the Year, for his previous album.</p><h3>Was Aperture submitted for a Grammy?</h3><p>Yes. It was submitted for Record, Song, Pop Solo Performance and Music Video, but was not nominated.</p>$$,
$$<p>ह्यारी स्टाइल्सको चौथो एल्बमले २०२७ को ग्र्यामी अवार्डमा कुनै पनि नामाङ्कन पाएन। Kiss All the Time. Disco, Occasionally लाई शून्य नामाङ्कन मिल्यो।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>कलाकार</td><td>ह्यारी स्टाइल्स</td></tr><tr><td>एल्बम</td><td>Kiss All the Time. Disco, Occasionally</td></tr><tr><td>सार्वजनिक मिति</td><td>६ मार्च २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>ग्र्यामी नामाङ्कन</td><td>शून्य</td></tr><tr><td>पेस गरिएको</td><td>एल्बम अफ द इयर, पप भोकल एल्बम</td></tr><tr><td>अघिल्लो एल्बम</td><td>Harry's House ले एल्बम अफ द इयर जित्यो</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>नामाङ्कन किन आएन</h2><p>एल्बम एल्बम अफ द इयर र पप भोकल एल्बमसहित प्रमुख पप विधामा पेस गरिएको थियो। गीत Aperture रेकर्ड, गीत, पप सोलो प्रस्तुति र म्युजिक भिडियोमा पेस गरिएको थियो। तर कुनै पनि नामाङ्कन सूचीमा परेन।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>यो २०२७ को नामाङ्कनको सबैभन्दा ठूलो उपेक्षामध्ये एक मानिएको छ। व्यावसायिक सफलता र ग्र्यामी मान्यता कति फरक हुन सक्छन् भन्ने यसले देखाउँछ।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>स्रोतहरूले रेकर्डिङ एकेडेमीको आधिकारिक कारण दिएका छैनन्। स्टाइल्स वा उनको टोलीले टिप्पणी गर्छन् कि गर्दैनन् भन्ने पनि बताएका छैनन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://rollingstoneindia.com/the-grammy-nominations-blanked-harry-styles-what-happened/">Rolling Stone India</a>; <a href="https://artsandvoices.com/articles/grammys-shut-out-harry-styles-after-album-of-the-year-win">Arts and Voices</a>।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://rollingstoneindia.com/the-grammy-nominations-blanked-harry-styles-what-happened/', 'https://artsandvoices.com/articles/grammys-shut-out-harry-styles-after-album-of-the-year-win'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- taylor-swift-dpiff-international-artist-of-the-year-20261122 (pop-music; English 382 words; Nepali 132 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'taylor-swift-dpiff-international-artist-of-the-year-20261122', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'Taylor Swift Named DPIFF International Artist of the Year',
'टेलर स्विफ्ट DPIFF अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय कलाकार अफ द इयर घोषित',
'Taylor Swift DPIFF honour names her International Artist of the Year at the 2026 awards in Mumbai, drawing memes and questions from fans online.',
'टेलर स्विफ्टलाई मुम्बईमा DPIFF २०२६ मा अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय कलाकार अफ द इयर घोषणा गरियो।',
$$<p>Taylor Swift DPIFF news arrived on 20 November 2026, when the Dadasaheb Phalke International Film Festival Awards named her International Artist of the Year for 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Artist</td><td>Taylor Swift</td></tr><tr><td>Award</td><td>International Artist of the Year</td></tr><tr><td>Event</td><td>Dadasaheb Phalke International Film Festival Awards 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Announced</td><td>20 November 2026, Mumbai</td></tr><tr><td>Organiser</td><td>Dadasaheb Phalke International Film Festival</td></tr><tr><td>Note</td><td>Independent festival, not the government Dadasaheb Phalke Award</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the Taylor Swift DPIFF announcement says</h2><p>The organisers shared the news on their social media handles on 20 November, with a post announcing that Taylor Swift wins International Artist of the Year at DPIFF 2026. The pick surprised many fans online, and social media quickly filled with memes and jokes about her 14 Grammys, four of them for Album of the Year, and about the choice itself. Other winners at the same awards included Dhurandhar for Best Film, Ranveer Singh for Best Actor and Aneet Padda for Best Actress for Saiyaara. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/popmusic">Pop Music</a> can also read our report on the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/cma-awards-2026-winners-ella-langley-six-wins-20261119">CMA Awards 2026 winners</a>, where Swift returned to the stage after 13 years.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The honour is unusual for a pop star at a film festival, which is part of why it spread so fast online. The coverage is careful about one distinction: DPIFF is an independent, privately run event in Mumbai, and it is not the same as the Dadasaheb Phalke Award conferred by the Government of India, the country highest cinema honour. The award is real, but it is a festival prize, not a state honour, and that difference is worth keeping straight.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources used here do not give a reason for the choice, and they do not say whether Swift will attend the ceremony or accept the award in person. They do not say whether she was told in advance, and they do not give a date for the ceremony itself.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.news9live.com/entertainment/celebrity/taylor-swift-international-artist-of-the-year-dpiff-2026-internet-reacts-3026560">News9</a>, for the announcement and the fan reaction; <a href="https://www.indiatvnews.com/amp/entertainment/news/taylor-swift-named-for-a-dadasaheb-phalke-award-fans-ask-a-joke-or-what-2026-11-20-1059980">India TV News</a>, for the announcement and the distinction from the government award; <a href="https://inshorts.com/en/amp_news/taylor-swift-to-get-dadasaheb-phalke-international-film-festival-award-1795224602418">Inshorts</a>, for the organisers announcement.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Is the DPIFF award the same as the Dadasaheb Phalke Award?</h3><p>No. DPIFF is a separate, privately run film festival, while the Dadasaheb Phalke Award is the Government of India highest cinema honour.</p><h3>When was the Taylor Swift DPIFF award announced?</h3><p>On 20 November 2026, by the festival organisers on social media.</p>$$,
$$<p>टेलर स्विफ्टलाई दादासाहेब फाल्के अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय फिल्म महोत्सव अवार्ड २०२६ मा अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय कलाकार अफ द इयर घोषणा गरियो। आयोजकले २० नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा यो खबर सार्वजनिक गरे।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>कलाकार</td><td>टेलर स्विफ्ट</td></tr><tr><td>पुरस्कार</td><td>अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय कलाकार अफ द इयर</td></tr><tr><td>कार्यक्रम</td><td>DPIFF अवार्ड २०२६</td></tr><tr><td>घोषणा मिति</td><td>२० नोभेम्बर २०२६, मुम्बई</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>घोषणामा के भनिएको छ</h2><p>आयोजकले २० नोभेम्बरमा सामाजिक सञ्जालमा खबर सार्वजनिक गरे। छनोटले धेरै प्रशंसकलाई अचम्मित बनायो, र सामाजिक सञ्जालमा मेम र मजाक फैलिए। सोही अवार्डमा धुरन्धरले उत्कृष्ट फिल्म, रणवीर सिंहले उत्कृष्ट अभिनेता र अनीत पड्डाले उत्कृष्ट अभिनेत्रीको पुरस्कार जिते।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>फिल्म महोत्सवमा पप गायिकालाई पुरस्कार दिनु असामान्य हो, त्यसैले खबर छिटो फैलियो। तर DPIFF भारत सरकारले दिने दादासाहेब फाल्के पुरस्कार होइन, यो छुट्टै निजी महोत्सव हो भन्ने कुरा ध्यान दिनुपर्छ।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>स्रोतहरूले छनोटको कारण दिएका छैनन्। स्विफ्ट समारोहमा उपस्थित हुन्छिन् कि हुँदिनन् भन्ने पनि बताएका छैनन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.news9live.com/entertainment/celebrity/taylor-swift-international-artist-of-the-year-dpiff-2026-internet-reacts-3026560">News9</a>; <a href="https://www.indiatvnews.com/amp/entertainment/news/taylor-swift-named-for-a-dadasaheb-phalke-award-fans-ask-a-joke-or-what-2026-11-20-1059980">India TV News</a>; <a href="https://inshorts.com/en/amp_news/taylor-swift-to-get-dadasaheb-phalke-international-film-festival-award-1795224602418">Inshorts</a>।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.news9live.com/entertainment/celebrity/taylor-swift-international-artist-of-the-year-dpiff-2026-internet-reacts-3026560', 'https://www.indiatvnews.com/amp/entertainment/news/taylor-swift-named-for-a-dadasaheb-phalke-award-fans-ask-a-joke-or-what-2026-11-20-1059980', 'https://inshorts.com/en/amp_news/taylor-swift-to-get-dadasaheb-phalke-international-film-festival-award-1795224602418'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- bts-arirang-world-tour-asia-kaohsiung-20261122 (pop-music; English 553 words; Nepali 134 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'bts-arirang-world-tour-asia-kaohsiung-20261122', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'BTS Arirang World Tour Opens Asia Leg in Kaohsiung',
'BTS Arirang विश्व भ्रमण एसिया चरण काओसियुङमा सुरु',
'BTS Arirang world tour opens its Asia Pacific leg in Kaohsiung with 26 shows across nine cities, plus cinema screenings of the 21 November show in 80 countries.',
'BTS को Arirang विश्व भ्रमण एसिया-प्रशान्त चरणमा काओसियुङमा सुरु भयो, नौ सहरमा २६ प्रस्तुति।',
$$<p>BTS Arirang world tour has opened its Asia-Pacific leg in Kaohsiung, Taiwan, with the group set for 26 performances across nine cities through February 2027.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Artist</td><td>BTS</td></tr><tr><td>Tour</td><td>BTS World Tour Arirang</td></tr><tr><td>Leg</td><td>Asia-Pacific</td></tr><tr><td>Opening</td><td>19 November 2026, Kaohsiung National Stadium</td></tr><tr><td>Shows</td><td>26 across nine cities</td></tr><tr><td>Kaohsiung dates</td><td>19, 21 and 22 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Cinema screening</td><td>21 November Kaohsiung show, 80-plus countries, about 3,300 screens</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the BTS Arirang world tour Asia leg covers</h2><p>The group perform at Kaohsiung National Stadium on Thursday, Saturday and Sunday, before heading to Bangkok, Kuala Lumpur, Singapore, Jakarta, Hong Kong and Bulacan in the Philippines. Across Asia the group will stage 21 concerts in seven cities, followed by five shows in Melbourne and Sydney in February 2027. Kaohsiung turned itself purple for the opening, lighting the 85 Sky Tower, the Love River, the Great Harbor Bridge and the Kaohsiung Music Center in the colour of the group and their fandom, ARMY. The city also launched tourism promotions, including a shuttle service named after the group 13 June debut date and discounts at night markets and shops. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/popmusic">Pop Music</a> can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/bts-mma-2026-six-wins-aria-award-20261120">BTS at the MMA Awards 2026</a>, where the group took six trophies.</p><p>The concerts also reach audiences beyond the stadiums. The Kaohsiung show on 21 November and the Jakarta concert on 29 December will be screened live in theatres in more than 80 countries and regions, live or delayed depending on time zone. The Kaohsiung screening reaches about 3,300 screens, and the Jakarta show about 2,800. The tour later moves to Singapore, where BTS will perform four shows at the National Stadium on 17, 19, 20 and 22 December. Those concerts coincide with The City Arirang, a month-long city project running from 1 to 31 December with the Singapore Tourism Board, including a light show at Jewel Changi Airport and a performance with about 1,500 drones on Sentosa Island. BTS also won Most Popular International Artist at the ARIA Awards on 18 November in Sydney, beating Ed Sheeran, Harry Styles, Olivia Rodrigo and Taylor Swift.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The Asia-Pacific leg is the biggest regional run of the Arirang tour, and the cinema screenings extend it far beyond the nine cities on the schedule. The city-wide takeovers in Kaohsiung and Singapore show how much a BTS visit is now treated as a tourism event, not just a run of concerts, with landmarks, transport and shopping all drawn into the week.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources used here do not give ticket sales or attendance figures for the Kaohsiung shows, so the size of the crowds is not stated. They do not give cinema ticket prices for the live screenings, and they do not say whether further Asia dates will be added to the tour.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://m-en.yna.co.kr/view/AEN20261119004700315?section=culture/k-wave">Yonhap News Agency</a>, for the tour dates and the Kaohsiung opening; <a href="https://m.koreaherald.com/article/10943078">The Korea Herald</a>, for the 26 shows and the cinema screenings; <a href="https://www.straitstimes.com/life/bts-kicks-off-asia-pacific-leg-of-arirang-world-tour-in-kaohsiung-taiwan?ref=entertainment">The Straits Times</a>, for the Singapore dates and the ARIA Awards win.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How many shows are on the BTS Arirang Asia Pacific leg?</h3><p>Twenty-six performances across nine cities, including 21 shows in seven Asian cities and five in Australia.</p><h3>Which BTS shows are screened in cinemas?</h3><p>The Kaohsiung show on 21 November and the Jakarta concert on 29 December, in more than 80 countries and regions.</p><h3>When do BTS play Singapore?</h3><p>On 17, 19, 20 and 22 December at the National Stadium.</p>$$,
$$<p>BTS को Arirang विश्व भ्रमणको एसिया-प्रशान्त चरण ताइवानको काओसियुङमा सुरु भयो। समूहले फेब्रुअरी २०२७ सम्म नौ सहरमा २६ प्रस्तुति दिनेछ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>कलाकार</td><td>BTS</td></tr><tr><td>भ्रमण</td><td>BTS World Tour Arirang</td></tr><tr><td>चरण</td><td>एसिया-प्रशान्त</td></tr><tr><td>सुरु</td><td>१९ नोभेम्बर २०२६, काओसियुङ राष्ट्रिय रंगशाला</td></tr><tr><td>प्रस्तुति</td><td>नौ सहरमा २६</td></tr><tr><td>काओसियुङ मिति</td><td>१९, २१ र २२ नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>एसिया चरणमा के छ</h2><p>समूहले काओसियुङपछि बैंकक, क्वालालम्पुर, सिंगापुर, जकार्ता, हङकङ र फिलिपिन्सको बुलाकानमा प्रस्तुति दिनेछ। एसियामा सात सहरमा २१ कन्सर्ट र फेब्रुअरी २०२७ मा मेलबर्न र सिड्नीमा पाँच प्रस्तुति हुनेछन्। काओसियुङले ८५ स्काई टावर, लभ रिभर र अन्य स्थललाई बैजनी रंगले उज्यालो बनायो।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>एसिया-प्रशान्त चरण Arirang भ्रमणको सबैभन्दा ठूलो क्षेत्रीय चरण हो। २१ नोभेम्बरको काओसियुङ प्रस्तुति र २९ डिसेम्बरको जकार्ता कन्सर्ट ८० भन्दा बढी देशका सिनेमाघरमा देखाइनेछ।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>स्रोतहरूले काओसियुङ प्रस्तुतिको टिकट बिक्री वा दर्शक संख्या दिएका छैनन्। सिनेमा टिकट मूल्यबारे पनि बताएका छैनन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://m-en.yna.co.kr/view/AEN20261119004700315?section=culture/k-wave">Yonhap News Agency</a>; <a href="https://m.koreaherald.com/article/10943078">The Korea Herald</a>; <a href="https://www.straitstimes.com/life/bts-kicks-off-asia-pacific-leg-of-arirang-world-tour-in-kaohsiung-taiwan?ref=entertainment">The Straits Times</a>।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://m-en.yna.co.kr/view/AEN20261119004700315?section=culture/k-wave', 'https://m.koreaherald.com/article/10943078', 'https://www.straitstimes.com/life/bts-kicks-off-asia-pacific-leg-of-arirang-world-tour-in-kaohsiung-taiwan?ref=entertainment'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- p1harmony-blow-up-billboard-200-debut-20261122 (pop-music; English 455 words; Nepali 162 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'p1harmony-blow-up-billboard-200-debut-20261122', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'P1Harmony BLOW UP Debuts at No 4 on Billboard 200',
'P1Harmony को BLOW UP बिलबोर्ड २०० मा नम्बर चारमा',
'P1Harmony BLOW UP debuts at No 4 on the Billboard 200 with 45,000 units and tops the Top Album Sales chart, the group first sales No 1.',
'P1Harmony को BLOW UP बिलबोर्ड २०० मा नम्बर चारमा आयो र शीर्ष एल्बम बिक्री चार्टमा नम्बर एक लियो।',
$$<p>P1Harmony BLOW UP has debuted at No. 4 on the Billboard 200 dated 21 November 2026, matching the group career best and topping the Top Album Sales chart.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Artist</td><td>P1Harmony</td></tr><tr><td>Album</td><td>BLOW UP, 10th mini album</td></tr><tr><td>Billboard 200</td><td>No. 4, 45,000 equivalent album units</td></tr><tr><td>Top Album Sales</td><td>No. 1, 43,500 copies</td></tr><tr><td>Chart date</td><td>21 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Members</td><td>Keeho, Theo, Jiung, Intak, Soul, Jongseob</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>How P1Harmony BLOW UP reached the top five</h2><p>The debut was built on sales, not streaming. Album sales made up 43,500 of the 45,000 units, sending BLOW UP straight to No. 1 on Top Album Sales, the group first leader on that chart, with streaming contributing only about 1,500 units. Billboard notes the sales were powered by 25 CD variants and five vinyl variants packed with collectible items such as photocards and posters, some randomised. The album also debuted at No. 1 on Independent Albums, the group third leader there, and at No. 1 on World Albums, their fifth chart-topper on that ranking. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/popmusic">Pop Music</a> can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/bts-mma-2026-six-wins-aria-award-20261120">BTS at the MMA Awards 2026</a>, another K-pop chart and awards story.</p><p>The No. 4 debut matches the career-high peak of UNIQUE from March, and gives P1Harmony a third top 10 album on the Billboard 200, following EX, which reached No. 9 in 2025. It is the group seventh entry on the chart overall. The group also re-entered the Billboard Artist 100, which ranks the most popular artists of the week in the United States, at No. 11, earning their 13th total week on that chart.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>A first No. 1 on Top Album Sales is the headline here, and it came the hard way: through physical sales in a week when the No. 2 album, Lil Baby FRESH, was powered almost entirely by streaming. P1Harmony route to the top five looks completely different from the streaming-led debuts around them, and it shows how far a loyal fanbase buying physical editions can carry a K-pop act on the US albums chart.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>Reports differ slightly on the exact sales figure: one outlet rounds it to 43,000 copies, while the Top Album Sales report gives 43,500. The sources used here do not give a UK chart position for BLOW UP, and they do not say whether a tour will follow the release.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://hypebeast.com/2026/11/p1harmony-blow-up-no-4-debut-billboard-200">Hypebeast</a>, for the Billboard 200 debut and the units; <a href="https://music-world.es/p1harmony-earns-first-no-1-on-top-album-sales-chart-with-blow-up/">Music World</a>, for the first No. 1 on Top Album Sales; <a href="https://www.tinygmusic.com/post/p1harmony-earn-first-no-1-on-billboard-s-top-album-sales-chart">TinyG Music</a>, for the sales figure and the Independent and World Albums positions.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What is P1Harmony best Billboard 200 position?</h3><p>No. 4, reached by BLOW UP and by UNIQUE in March 2026.</p><h3>How many copies did BLOW UP sell in the US?</h3><p>43,500 copies in the week ending 12 November 2026, topping the Top Album Sales chart.</p>$$,
$$<p>P1Harmony को BLOW UP २१ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को बिलबोर्ड २०० मा नम्बर चारमा आयो। यो समूहको उत्कृष्ट स्थानसँग बराबर हो, र एल्बमले शीर्ष एल्बम बिक्री चार्टमा नम्बर एक लियो।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>कलाकार</td><td>P1Harmony</td></tr><tr><td>एल्बम</td><td>BLOW UP, १०औं मिनी एल्बम</td></tr><tr><td>बिलबोर्ड २००</td><td>नम्बर ४, ४५,००० एकाइ</td></tr><tr><td>शीर्ष एल्बम बिक्री</td><td>नम्बर १, ४३,५०० प्रति</td></tr><tr><td>चार्ट मिति</td><td>२१ नोभेम्बर २०२६</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>BLOW UP शीर्ष पाँचमा कसरी पुग्यो</h2><p>यो सुरुवात बिक्रीबाट बनेको हो, स्ट्रिमिङबाट होइन। एल्बम बिक्री ४५,००० एकाइमध्ये ४३,५०० थियो, जसले BLOW UP लाई शीर्ष एल्बम बिक्री चार्टमा नम्बर एकमा पुर्यायो। बिक्री २५ सीडी संस्करण र पाँच भिनाइल संस्करणबाट आएको हो, जसमा फोटोकार्ड र पोस्टर जस्ता संग्रहणीय सामग्री छन्।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>शीर्ष एल्बम बिक्री चार्टमा पहिलो नम्बर एक नै यहाँको मुख्य खबर हो। स्ट्रिमिङले नेतृत्व गरेको हप्तामा भौतिक बिक्रीबाट आएको यो नतिजाले वफादार प्रशंसक आधारले के-पप कलाकारलाई अमेरिकी एल्बम चार्टमा कति टाढा पुर्याउन सक्छ भन्ने देखाउँछ।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>बिक्री अङ्कबारे रिपोर्टहरू अलिक फरक छन्: एउटा स्रोतले ४३,००० प्रति भन्छ भने शीर्ष एल्बम बिक्री रिपोर्टले ४३,५०० दिन्छ। बेलायतको चार्ट स्थानबारे स्रोतहरूले बताएका छैनन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://hypebeast.com/2026/11/p1harmony-blow-up-no-4-debut-billboard-200">Hypebeast</a>; <a href="https://music-world.es/p1harmony-earns-first-no-1-on-top-album-sales-chart-with-blow-up/">Music World</a>; <a href="https://www.tinygmusic.com/post/p1harmony-earn-first-no-1-on-billboard-s-top-album-sales-chart">TinyG Music</a>।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://hypebeast.com/2026/11/p1harmony-blow-up-no-4-debut-billboard-200', 'https://music-world.es/p1harmony-earns-first-no-1-on-top-album-sales-chart-with-blow-up/', 'https://www.tinygmusic.com/post/p1harmony-earn-first-no-1-on-billboard-s-top-album-sales-chart'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- taylor-swift-cma-awards-ratings-26-percent-20261122 (pop-music; English 477 words; Nepali 149 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'taylor-swift-cma-awards-ratings-26-percent-20261122', 'pop-music', 'Global',
'Taylor Swift CMA Awards Return Lifts Ratings 26 Percent',
'टेलर स्विफ्टको पुनरागमनले CMA रेटिङ २६ प्रतिशत बढायो',
'Taylor Swift CMA Awards return helped the 60th ceremony to 7.62 million viewers, up 26 percent for the biggest audience in seven years.',
'टेलर स्विफ्टको पुनरागमनले ६०औं CMA अवार्डलाई ७.६२ मिलियन दर्शक दिलायो, सात वर्षयताकै सबैभन्दा धेरै।',
$$<p>Taylor Swift CMA Awards return helped the 60th ceremony draw 7.62 million viewers, up 26 percent on last year and the biggest CMA audience in seven years.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Event</td><td>60th CMA Awards</td></tr><tr><td>Date</td><td>18 November 2026, Nashville</td></tr><tr><td>Viewers</td><td>7.62 million, live plus same day</td></tr><tr><td>Change</td><td>Up 26 percent, against 6.03 million in 2025</td></tr><tr><td>Adults 18 to 49</td><td>1.01 rating, up 55 percent against 0.65</td></tr><tr><td>Broadcaster</td><td>ABC and Disney Plus</td></tr><tr><td>Host</td><td>Lainey Wilson</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>How the Taylor Swift CMA Awards ratings rose</h2><p>The figures come from Nielsen Big Data plus Panel ratings for live plus same-day viewing. The 60th annual ceremony drew 7.62 million total viewers, its largest overall audience in seven years and the most-watched show since 2019. It also scored a 1.01 rating among adults 18 to 49, up 55 percent on last year 0.65 rating, and its best performance in that demo in three years. The show ranked as Wednesday No. 1 programme across broadcast and cable in both total viewers and the demo. Swift performed at the CMA Awards for the first time in 13 years, singing a mashup of I Knew It, I Knew You, her song for Toy Story 5, and Our Song, her first country No. 1 from 20 years ago. She also presented the lifetime achievement award to Brooks and Dunn. Her single lost Single of the Year to Ella Langley Choosin Texas. Readers following <a href="https://growentix.cloud/popmusic">Pop Music</a> can also read our report on the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/cma-awards-2026-winners-ella-langley-six-wins-20261119">CMA Awards 2026 winners</a>, where Langley took six awards.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The coverage credits Swift return with the double-digit jump, and The Hollywood Reporter noted that ABC even reopened previously closed advertising space for the three-hour telecast after Swift officially signed on to perform. But the ratings do not isolate her segment: the 7.62 million figure is for the whole show, and the increase cannot be credited to one performer alone. The show also had other draws, including the Dolly Parton tribute and Langley record night, and the 60th anniversary itself.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources used here do not break out viewing for the Swift performance alone, so no figure exists for her segment. They do not give delayed-viewing totals beyond the live plus same-day window, and they do not say whether Swift will return to the CMA stage next year.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.thewrap.com/media-platforms/tv/cma-awards-2026-ratings-disney-abc/">TheWrap</a>, for the audience total and the seven-year high; <a href="http://www.thefutoncritic.com/ratings/2026/11/20/the-60th-annual-cma-awards-vaults-to-seven-year-high-with-over-7-million-total-viewers-across-abc-and-disneyplus-75214/20261120abc02/">The Futon Critic</a>, for the Nielsen ratings release; <a href="https://heavy.com/sports/nfl/kansas-city-chiefs/taylor-swift-news-emerges-before-cardinals-game/">Heavy</a>, for the Swift performance and the advertising detail; <a href="https://fanfest.com/cma-awards-2026-seven-year-audience-high-nielsen/">FanFest</a>, for the caution that the figure covers the whole show.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How many people watched the 2026 CMA Awards?</h3><p>7.62 million total viewers in live plus same-day viewing, on ABC and Disney Plus.</p><h3>How much did CMA ratings rise?</h3><p>Total viewers rose 26 percent on 2025, and the adults 18 to 49 rating rose 55 percent, from 0.65 to 1.01.</p><h3>When did Taylor Swift last perform at the CMAs before 2026?</h3><p>Thirteen years earlier, making the 2026 show her first CMA performance since 2013.</p>$$,
$$<p>टेलर स्विफ्टको पुनरागमनले ६०औं CMA अवार्डलाई ७.६२ मिलियन दर्शक दिलायो, जुन गत वर्षभन्दा २६ प्रतिशत बढी र सात वर्षयताकै सबैभन्दा ठूलो दर्शक संख्या हो।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>कार्यक्रम</td><td>६०औं CMA अवार्ड</td></tr><tr><td>मिति</td><td>१८ नोभेम्बर २०२६, न्यासभिल</td></tr><tr><td>दर्शक</td><td>७.६२ मिलियन, प्रत्यक्ष तथा सोही दिन</td></tr><tr><td>वृद्धि</td><td>२६ प्रतिशत, २०२५ को ६.०३ मिलियनको तुलनामा</td></tr><tr><td>१८ देखि ४९ उमेर</td><td>१.०१ रेटिङ, ५५ प्रतिशतले बढेको</td></tr><tr><td>प्रसारक</td><td>ABC र Disney Plus</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>रेटिङ कसरी बढ्यो</h2><p>तथ्याङ्क निल्सन बिग डाटा प्लस प्यानलको प्रत्यक्ष तथा सोही दिनको मापनबाट आएको हो। ६०औं समारोहले ७.६२ मिलियन दर्शक तान्यो, जुन २०१९ पछिकै सबैभन्दा धेरै हो। स्विफ्टले १३ वर्षपछि पहिलो पटक CMA मञ्चमा प्रस्तुति दिइन्, I Knew It, I Knew You र Our Song को म्यासअप गाइन्।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>स्विफ्टको पुनरागमनलाई दोहोरो अङ्कको वृद्धिको श्रेय दिइएको छ, तर रेटिङले उनको खण्ड मात्र छुट्याउँदैन: ७.६२ मिलियनको अङ्क पूरै कार्यक्रमको हो।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>स्रोतहरूले स्विफ्टको प्रस्तुतिको मात्र दर्शक संख्या दिएका छैनन्। प्रत्यक्ष तथा सोही दिनबाहेक ढिलो हेर्ने दर्शकको कुल संख्या पनि दिएका छैनन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.thewrap.com/media-platforms/tv/cma-awards-2026-ratings-disney-abc/">TheWrap</a>; <a href="http://www.thefutoncritic.com/ratings/2026/11/20/the-60th-annual-cma-awards-vaults-to-seven-year-high-with-over-7-million-total-viewers-across-abc-and-disneyplus-75214/20261120abc02/">The Futon Critic</a>; <a href="https://heavy.com/sports/nfl/kansas-city-chiefs/taylor-swift-news-emerges-before-cardinals-game/">Heavy</a>।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.thewrap.com/media-platforms/tv/cma-awards-2026-ratings-disney-abc/', 'http://www.thefutoncritic.com/ratings/2026/11/20/the-60th-annual-cma-awards-vaults-to-seven-year-high-with-over-7-million-total-viewers-across-abc-and-disneyplus-75214/20261120abc02/', 'https://heavy.com/sports/nfl/kansas-city-chiefs/taylor-swift-news-emerges-before-cardinals-game/', 'https://fanfest.com/cma-awards-2026-seven-year-audience-high-nielsen/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- anthropic-shares-fall-9-percent-second-day-ipo-20261122 (tech-ai; English 507 words; Nepali 267 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'anthropic-shares-fall-9-percent-second-day-ipo-20261122', 'tech-ai', 'Global',
'Anthropic Shares Fall 9% on Second Day After Record IPO',
'Anthropic सेयर रेकर्ड IPO पछिको दोस्रो दिन ९% घट्यो',
'Anthropic shares fell 9.1% to $88.30 on their second day of trading on 20 November, just above the $83 IPO price, as the Nasdaq plunged 5.3%.',
'Anthropic सेयर दोस्रो दिन २० नोभेम्बरमा ९.१% घटेर $८८.३० मा बन्द भए, $८३ IPO मूल्यभन्दा केही माथि, Nasdaq ५.३% घटेर २०२६ का लाभ मेटिएको दिन।',
$$<p>Anthropic shares fell 9.1% on Friday 20 November, closing at $88.30 on their second day of trading, just above the $83 IPO price and well below the $111.50 opening price of the record-breaking debut a day earlier. The slide came as the Nasdaq Composite plunged 5.3%, wiping out its gains for 2026, in a broad sell-off across artificial intelligence stocks.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Anthropic</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What happened to Anthropic shares</h2><p>Anthropic priced its shares at $83 and began trading on the Nasdaq on Thursday 19 November, opening at $111.50, about 34% above the offer price, and closing the first day at $97.17, up 17%. On Friday the shares fell as much as 14% during the session and touched $83.05 before recovering to close at $88.30, down 9.1% on the day. Anthropic said on Friday that its underwriters had exercised in full their option to buy additional shares, lifting the total raised in the offering to about $93.5 billion, making it the largest IPO on record. Including a $26 billion concurrent private placement, the total raised reached $119.5 billion. Readers can compare this with our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/anthropic-ipo-debut-ant-first-trade-20261119">Anthropic IPO debut and first day trading</a>, and see more market and AI news in our <a href="https://growentix.cloud/tech-ai">Tech</a> section.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The second-day fall shows that even the biggest IPO in history could not steady a market gripped by doubts about the AI trade. The Nasdaq fell 5.3% on Friday, its second-largest one-day points drop in history, while the S&amp;P 500 fell 3.7% and the VIX volatility index rose 33% to 37. At the Friday close, Anthropic was valued at about $1.6 trillion, still among the 15 biggest publicly traded companies in the world, and the first frontier AI model maker to go public.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not say exactly why investors sold on the second day, beyond the wider AI sell-off, and they do not agree on every figure: reports put the intraday low at $83.05 or $85.80, and the total raised at $93.5 billion for the IPO alone or $119.5 billion including the private placement. The sources do not say where the shares will trade next, and none of them forecasts whether the AI sell-off will continue.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.investopedia.com/stock-market-today-dow-jones-s-and-p-500-nasdaq-11202026-12266027">Investopedia</a>, the Friday market moves and the Anthropic close; <a href="https://www.wsj.com/livecoverage/stock-market-today-dow-sp-500-nasdaq-11-20-2026">The Wall Street Journal</a>, the intraday low near the $83 IPO price and the 9.2% fall; <a href="https://www.businesstimes.com.sg/companies-markets/telcos-media-tech/anthropic-slides-9-1-shrink-ipo-gain-ai-trade-unravels">The Business Times</a>, the $88.30 close, the $1.6 trillion valuation and the $119.5 billion total raised; <a href="https://www.aljazeera.com/economy/2026/11/20/us-tech-sell-off-continues-as-anthropic-tumbles-after-mega-ipo">Al Jazeera</a>, the record IPO context and the wider tech sell-off.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What was the Anthropic IPO price?</h3><p>$83 per share. The stock opened at $111.50 on its first day, 19 November, and closed that day at $97.17.</p><h3>How much did Anthropic raise?</h3><p>About $93.5 billion in the IPO itself, after underwriters exercised their option in full. Including a concurrent $26 billion private placement, the total was $119.5 billion.</p><h3>Why did the shares fall on day two?</h3><p>The sources tie the fall to a broad sell-off in AI stocks, with the Nasdaq down 5.3% on the day. They do not give a single company-specific cause.</p>$$,
$$<p>Anthropic का सेयर शुक्रबार २० नोभेम्बरमा दोस्रो दिनको कारोबारमा ९.१% घटेर $८८.३० मा बन्द भए, जुन $८३ को IPO मूल्यभन्दा केही माथि र पहिलो दिनको $१११.५० को उद्घाटन मूल्यभन्दा धेरै तल हो। यो गिरावट Nasdaq ५.३% घटेको दिन आयो, जसले २०२६ का सबै लाभ मेटायो।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>Anthropic</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Anthropic सेयरमा के भयो</h2><p>Anthropic ले सेयर $८३ मा मूल्य निर्धारण गरी बिहीबार १९ नोभेम्बरमा Nasdaq मा कारोबार सुरु गर्यो, $१११.५० मा खुल्यो र पहिलो दिन $९७.१७ मा बन्द भयो। शुक्रबार सेयर दिनभरि १४% सम्म घट्यो र $८३.०५ सम्म झर्यो, त्यसपछि $८८.३० मा बन्द भयो। कम्पनीले शुक्रबार अन्डरराइटरहरूले थप सेयर किन्ने विकल्प पूर्ण रूपमा प्रयोग गरेको बताएको छ, जसले IPO बाट उठेको रकम करिब $९३.५ अर्ब पुर्यायो, जुन इतिहासकै सबैभन्दा ठूलो IPO हो।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>दोस्रो दिनको गिरावटले देखायो कि इतिहासकै सबैभन्दा ठूलो IPO ले पनि AI व्यापारप्रतिको शंकाले ग्रस्त बजारलाई स्थिर बनाउन सकेन। शुक्रबार Nasdaq ५.३% घट्यो भने S&amp;P 500 ३.७% घट्यो। शुक्रबारको बन्दमा Anthropic को मूल्य करिब $१.६ ट्रिलियन थियो, अझै विश्वका १५ सबैभन्दा ठूला सार्वजनिक कम्पनीमध्ये एक।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>स्रोतहरूले दोस्रो दिन लगानीकर्ताले किन बेचे भन्ने ठ्याक्कै कारण बताएका छैनन्, फराकिलो AI बिक्रीबाहेक। उनीहरू हरेक अङ्कमा सहमत पनि छैनन्: दिनभरको न्यून मूल्य $८३.०५ वा $८५.८० भनिएको छ। स्रोतहरूले सेयर अब कहाँ कारोबार हुन्छ भन्ने पनि बताएका छैनन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.investopedia.com/stock-market-today-dow-jones-s-and-p-500-nasdaq-11202026-12266027">Investopedia</a>, शुक्रबारको बजार चाल; <a href="https://www.wsj.com/livecoverage/stock-market-today-dow-sp-500-nasdaq-11-20-2026">The Wall Street Journal</a>, IPO मूल्य नजिकको न्यून बिन्दु; <a href="https://www.businesstimes.com.sg/companies-markets/telcos-media-tech/anthropic-slides-9-1-shrink-ipo-gain-ai-trade-unravels">The Business Times</a>, $८८.३० बन्द र उठेको रकम; <a href="https://www.aljazeera.com/economy/2026/11/20/us-tech-sell-off-continues-as-anthropic-tumbles-after-mega-ipo">Al Jazeera</a>, रेकर्ड IPO को पृष्ठभूमि।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>Anthropic IPO मूल्य कति थियो?</h3><p>प्रति सेयर $८३। सेयर पहिलो दिन $१११.५० मा खुल्यो र $९७.१७ मा बन्द भयो।</p><h3>Anthropic ले कति रकम उठायो?</h3><p>IPO बाट करिब $९३.५ अर्ब। निजी प्लेसमेन्टसहित कुल $११९.५ अर्ब पुग्यो।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.investopedia.com/stock-market-today-dow-jones-s-and-p-500-nasdaq-11202026-12266027', 'https://www.wsj.com/livecoverage/stock-market-today-dow-sp-500-nasdaq-11-20-2026', 'https://www.businesstimes.com.sg/companies-markets/telcos-media-tech/anthropic-slides-9-1-shrink-ipo-gain-ai-trade-unravels', 'https://www.aljazeera.com/economy/2026/11/20/us-tech-sell-off-continues-as-anthropic-tumbles-after-mega-ipo'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- gemini-computer-use-mac-launch-20261122 (tech-ai; English 505 words; Nepali 286 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'gemini-computer-use-mac-launch-20261122', 'tech-ai', 'Global',
'Gemini Computer Use Arrives on Mac to Run Apps for You',
'Mac मा Gemini कम्प्युटर प्रयोग आयो, एप तपाईंका लागि चलाउँछ',
'Gemini computer use is coming to the Gemini app for Mac, letting the AI click, type and finish multi-step tasks across files, apps and the web.',
'Mac का लागि Gemini एपमा कम्प्युटर प्रयोग सुविधा आउँदैछ, जसले AI लाई फाइल, एप र वेबमा क्लिक, टाइप र बहु-चरण कार्य पूरा गर्न दिन्छ।',
$$<p>Google announced on Thursday 19 November that Gemini computer use is coming to the Gemini app for Mac, letting the AI assistant click through menus, type into forms and complete multi-step tasks across local files, desktop apps and the web on behalf of the user. Gemini works inside an isolated background window with a live preview in the chat, so the main screen and cursor stay free while it works.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Google</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What Gemini computer use on Mac does</h2><p>Starting on 19 November, computer use in the Gemini app for Mac helps with multi-step tasks across local files, desktop apps and the web. Google says users only need to describe what they want, and Gemini handles the clicking, typing, menus and forms. Suggested uses include batch colour-grading photos in design software, setting up complex 3D scenes, and extracting weights, dimensions and addresses from local PDFs to fill out multi-box shipping quotes. The feature is initially available in English in the United States and requires the Gemini app for Mac and a Google AI Plus, Pro or Ultra subscription. It runs on Apple Silicon Macs with macOS Sequoia 15.0 or later, for users aged 18 and over. Readers can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/google-gemini-4-neon-launch-20261121">Google Gemini 4 Neon launch</a>, and more AI news in our <a href="https://growentix.cloud/tech-ai">Tech</a> section.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>Computer use moves Gemini from answering questions in a chat window to taking actions directly on the computer, the same agentic direction rivals are pursuing with their own desktop agents. Because the work happens in a separate background window, users can keep typing, designing or taking calls without interruption. The paid-subscription gate also shows Google treating desktop automation as a premium feature rather than a free part of the Gemini app.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>Google has not said when computer use will reach Windows, other countries or languages, or the free tier of Gemini. The sources do not give accuracy figures or limits on what Gemini can safely do unsupervised, and they do not say how long the live preview history is kept. One report says Gemini makes temporary backup copies of files it touches, but Google own announcement quoted in the coverage does not confirm that detail.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/19/google-gives-gemini-the-ability-to-use-your-mac-for-you/">TechCrunch</a>, the 19 November announcement, the United States and paid-subscription limits; <a href="https://betanews.com/article/google-gemini-control-macos/">BetaNews</a>, how computer use works across files, apps and the web and the isolated background window; <a href="https://phandroid.com/2026/11/19/gemini-can-now-take-over-your-mac-apps-to-finish-tasks/">Phandroid</a>, the rollout and the example tasks Google suggests.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Who can use Gemini computer use on Mac?</h3><p>Users in the United States, aged 18 and over, with the Gemini app for Mac and a Google AI Plus, Pro or Ultra subscription, on an Apple Silicon Mac running macOS Sequoia 15.0 or later. It works in English only at launch.</p><h3>Does Gemini take over my screen?</h3><p>No. It works inside an isolated background window with a live preview in the chat, and your main screen and cursor remain free.</p><h3>Is computer use available on Windows?</h3><p>Not yet. Google has announced it for the Gemini app on Mac only, and has not given a date for Windows.</p>$$,
$$<p>Google ले बिहीबार १९ नोभेम्बरमा Mac का लागि Gemini एपमा कम्प्युटर प्रयोग सुविधा आउँदैछ भनेर घोषणा गर्यो, जसले AI सहायकलाई प्रयोगकर्ताको तर्फबाट स्थानीय फाइल, डेस्कटप एप र वेबमा मेनु क्लिक गर्ने, फारम भर्ने र बहु-चरण कार्य पूरा गर्न दिन्छ। Gemini छुट्टै पृष्ठभूमि विन्डोभित्र काम गर्छ, त्यसैले मुख्य स्क्रिन खाली रहन्छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>Google</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Mac मा Gemini कम्प्युटर प्रयोग के गर्छ</h2><p>१९ नोभेम्बरदेखि, Mac का लागि Gemini एपमा कम्प्युटर प्रयोगले स्थानीय फाइल, डेस्कटप एप र वेबमा बहु-चरण कार्यमा मद्दत गर्छ। Google का अनुसार प्रयोगकर्ताले के चाहिन्छ भनेर वर्णन गर्नुपर्छ, Gemini ले क्लिक, टाइप, मेनु र फारम सम्हाल्छ। यो सुविधा सुरुमा संयुक्त राज्य अमेरिकामा अंग्रेजीमा मात्र उपलब्ध छ र यसका लागि Mac का लागि Gemini एप र Google AI Plus, Pro वा Ultra सदस्यता चाहिन्छ। यो Apple Silicon Mac मा macOS Sequoia 15.0 वा नयाँ संस्करणमा, १८ वर्ष वा माथिका प्रयोगकर्ताका लागि चल्छ।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>कम्प्युटर प्रयोगले Gemini लाई च्याट विन्डोमा प्रश्नको जवाफ दिनेबाट कम्प्युटरमा सिधै कार्य गर्नेतर्फ लैजान्छ, जुन प्रतिस्पर्धीहरूले पनि आफ्ना डेस्कटप एजेन्टसँग पछ्याइरहेको दिशा हो। काम छुट्टै पृष्ठभूमि विन्डोमा हुने भएकाले प्रयोगकर्ताले टाइप, डिजाइन वा कल जारी राख्न सक्छन्।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>Google ले कम्प्युटर प्रयोग Windows, अन्य देश वा भाषा, वा Gemini को निःशुल्क तहमा कहिले पुग्छ भन्ने बताएको छैन। स्रोतहरूले शुद्धताको तथ्याङ्क वा Gemini ले निगरानीबिना सुरक्षित रूपमा के गर्न सक्छ भन्ने सीमा दिएका छैनन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/19/google-gives-gemini-the-ability-to-use-your-mac-for-you/">TechCrunch</a>, १९ नोभेम्बरको घोषणा र सीमाहरू; <a href="https://betanews.com/article/google-gemini-control-macos/">BetaNews</a>, कम्प्युटर प्रयोग कसरी काम गर्छ; <a href="https://phandroid.com/2026/11/19/gemini-can-now-take-over-your-mac-apps-to-finish-tasks/">Phandroid</a>, रोलआउट र उदाहरण कार्यहरू।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>Mac मा Gemini कम्प्युटर प्रयोग कसले प्रयोग गर्न सक्छ?</h3><p>संयुक्त राज्य अमेरिकाका १८ वर्ष वा माथिका प्रयोगकर्ता, जससँग Mac का लागि Gemini एप र Google AI Plus, Pro वा Ultra सदस्यता छ। सुरुमा अंग्रेजीमा मात्र।</p><h3>के Gemini ले मेरो स्क्रिन लिन्छ?</h3><p>होइन। यो छुट्टै पृष्ठभूमि विन्डोभित्र काम गर्छ, र तपाईंको मुख्य स्क्रिन र कर्सर खाली रहन्छ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/19/google-gives-gemini-the-ability-to-use-your-mac-for-you/', 'https://betanews.com/article/google-gemini-control-macos/', 'https://phandroid.com/2026/11/19/gemini-can-now-take-over-your-mac-apps-to-finish-tasks/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- nothing-ai-device-launch-december-8-20261122 (tech-ai; English 499 words; Nepali 300 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'nothing-ai-device-launch-december-8-20261122', 'tech-ai', 'Global',
'Nothing AI Device to Launch on 8 December, Screenless',
'Nothing AI उपकरण ८ डिसेम्बरमा लन्च हुँदै, स्क्रिनरहित',
'The Nothing AI device will be unveiled on 8 December 2026. It is screenless, with a Talk button and a record button, but its name and price are still secret.',
'Nothing AI उपकरण ८ डिसेम्बर २०२६ मा सार्वजनिक हुनेछ। यो स्क्रिनरहित छ, Talk र रेकर्ड बटनसहित, तर Nothing ले नाम वा मूल्य खुलाएको छैन।',
$$<p>Nothing confirmed on Friday 20 November that its first AI-native device will be unveiled on 8 December 2026, with the tagline Be present. It is noted. The Nothing AI device has no screen, and the company has not yet revealed its name, its price or its full features.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Nothing</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What we know about the Nothing AI device</h2><p>Nothing shared a teaser on X with a close-up of a polished circular element set into a brushed metal surface, captioned Be present. It is noted. 8 December. The clearest look at the device so far comes from a photograph shared on 19 November by Sebastian Ingrosso of Swedish House Mafia, who tagged the Nothing account. It shows a slim, black, palm-sized gadget with a large Talk button, a second button marked with a record symbol, and red and green status LEDs. Nothing chief executive Carl Pei has said the device has no new screen and could not have been built as an app, and that shipments will begin in December. In a 4 November post, Pei framed the product as a productivity tool aimed at the context gap in AI, rather than an all-purpose companion. Readers can also read our report on the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/xiaomi-18-pro-max-global-launch-20261121">Xiaomi 18 Pro Max global launch</a>, and see more gadget news in our <a href="https://growentix.cloud/tech-ai">Tech</a> section.</p><h2>What it means</h2><p>The physical controls and the tagline point towards a voice-first recorder that captures conversations and turns them into notes without a phone screen, though Nothing has not confirmed recording, transcription or note-taking features. The launch is a test of whether a small, focused AI gadget can succeed where earlier all-purpose AI hardware struggled, a track record that Engadget notes is not encouraging. Nothing is betting that a single clear job, capturing what is said while the user stays present, is a stronger pitch than a device that tries to do everything.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>Nothing has not announced the product name, the price, battery life, connectivity, or where it will be sold. The company has not confirmed whether the device records, transcribes or summarises, or whether it supports live translation. The leaked photograph has not been confirmed by Nothing as the real device, and the sources do not say whether the 8 December event will include a sale date or only the unveiling.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.engadget.com/2323187/nothings-ai-device-debuts-december-8-and-it-looks-like-two-vapes-stuck-together/">Engadget</a>, the 8 December date, the leaked photograph and the camera hint; <a href="https://www.gizmochina.com/2026/11/21/nothings-first-ai-gadget-finally-has-a-launch-date/">GizmoChina</a>, the teaser, the tagline and the note-taking clues; <a href="https://gadgets.beebom.com/news/nothing-ai-device-recorder-launch-date-revealed">Beebom</a>, the December 8 confirmation and the details Nothing has not revealed.</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>When does the Nothing AI device launch?</h3><p>Nothing will unveil it on 8 December 2026. Carl Pei has said shipments will begin in December, but no sale date has been announced.</p><h3>Does it have a screen?</h3><p>No. Nothing has confirmed the device has no screen. It has physical buttons, including a Talk button and a record button, plus red and green status LEDs.</p><h3>What is its name and price?</h3><p>Nothing has not revealed either. The name, price and full specifications are expected at the 8 December event.</p>$$,
$$<p>Nothing ले शुक्रबार २० नोभेम्बरमा आफ्नो पहिलो AI-नेटिभ उपकरण ८ डिसेम्बर २०२६ मा सार्वजनिक गरिने पुष्टि गर्यो, जसको नारा Be present. It is noted. हो। यस Nothing AI उपकरणमा स्क्रिन छैन, र कम्पनीले अहिलेसम्म यसको नाम, मूल्य वा पूर्ण विशेषता खुलाएको छैन।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>Nothing</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Nothing AI उपकरणबारे के थाहा छ</h2><p>Nothing ले X मा ब्रस गरिएको धातु सतहमा चम्किलो गोलाकार तत्वको नजिकको तस्वीरसहित टीजर साझा गर्यो, जसमा Be present. It is noted. 8 December. लेखिएको थियो। उपकरणको सबैभन्दा स्पष्ट झलक १९ नोभेम्बरमा Swedish House Mafia का Sebastian Ingrosso ले साझा गरेको फोटोबाट आएको हो, जसमा पातलो, कालो, हत्केलाजत्रो उपकरणमा ठूलो Talk बटन, रेकर्ड चिह्न भएको दोस्रो बटन र रातो तथा हरियो LED देखिन्छन्। प्रमुख कार्यकारी Carl Pei ले उपकरणमा नयाँ स्क्रिन नभएको र यो एपका रूपमा बनाउन नसकिने बताएका छन्, र डिसेम्बरमा ढुवानी सुरु हुने बताएका छन्।</p><h2>यसको अर्थ के हो</h2><p>भौतिक बटन र नाराले फोन स्क्रिनबिना कुराकानी रेकर्ड गरी नोटमा बदल्ने आवाज-प्रधान रेकर्डरतर्फ संकेत गर्छन्, यद्यपि Nothing ले रेकर्डिङ, ट्रान्सक्रिप्सन वा नोट लिने सुविधा पुष्टि गरेको छैन। यो लन्चले सानो, केन्द्रित AI उपकरण सफल हुन सक्छ कि भन्ने परीक्षण गर्छ, जहाँ पहिलेका सबै-उद्देश्य AI हार्डवेयर संघर्ष गरेका थिए।</p><h2>स्रोतहरूले के भनेका छैनन्</h2><p>Nothing ले उत्पादनको नाम, मूल्य, ब्याट्री आयु, कनेक्टिभिटी वा कहाँ बेचिन्छ भन्ने घोषणा गरेको छैन। कम्पनीले उपकरणले रेकर्ड, ट्रान्सक्राइब वा सारांश गर्छ कि गर्दैन, वा प्रत्यक्ष अनुवाद समर्थन गर्छ कि भन्ने पुष्टि गरेको छैन। लिक भएको फोटोलाई Nothing ले वास्तविक उपकरण भनेर पुष्टि गरेको छैन।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.engadget.com/2323187/nothings-ai-device-debuts-december-8-and-it-looks-like-two-vapes-stuck-together/">Engadget</a>, ८ डिसेम्बर मिति र लिक फोटो; <a href="https://www.gizmochina.com/2026/11/21/nothings-first-ai-gadget-finally-has-a-launch-date/">GizmoChina</a>, टीजर र नोट लिने संकेत; <a href="https://gadgets.beebom.com/news/nothing-ai-device-recorder-launch-date-revealed">Beebom</a>, डिसेम्बर ८ पुष्टि।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>Nothing AI उपकरण कहिले लन्च हुन्छ?</h3><p>Nothing ले ८ डिसेम्बर २०२६ मा यसलाई सार्वजनिक गर्नेछ। Carl Pei ले डिसेम्बरमा ढुवानी सुरु हुने बताएका छन्, तर बिक्री मिति घोषणा भएको छैन।</p><h3>के यसमा स्क्रिन छ?</h3><p>छैन। Nothing ले उपकरणमा स्क्रिन नभएको पुष्टि गरेको छ। यसमा Talk बटन र रेकर्ड बटनसहित भौतिक बटन छन्।</p>$$,
