VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'deputy-director-data-maturity-jobs-gds-20261123', 'uk', 'UK',
'Deputy Director Data Maturity Jobs: GDS, Close 30 November',
'उपनिर्देशक डेटा परिपक्वता जागिर: GDS, ३० नोभेम्बरमा बन्द',
'Deputy Director Data Maturity jobs are open at Government Digital Service in London, Bristol or Manchester, paying £86,000 to £117,800. Apply by 30 Nov 2026.',
'सरकारी डिजिटल सेवामा लन्डन, ब्रिस्टल वा म्यानचेस्टरमा उपनिर्देशक डेटा परिपक्वता जागिर खुलेका छन्, तलब £86,000 देखि £117,800 सम्म। ३० नोभेम्बर २०२६ सम्म आवेदन दिनुहोस्।',
$$<p>The Government Digital Service is hiring for Deputy Director Data Maturity jobs, leading data maturity and transformation work across government, with applications closing at 23:55 on Monday 30 November 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Government Digital Service, Department for Science, Innovation and Technology</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>Deputy Director, Data Maturity and Transformation, SCS Pay Band 1, permanent</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>£86,000 to £117,800, based on capability</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Closing 23:55 Monday 30 November 2026; sift completion 8 December 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through Civil Service Jobs</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>Sift, then global resourcing interviews 10 to 18 December 2026 and panel interviews from the week of 25 January 2026 as listed</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the Deputy Director Data Maturity jobs involve</h2><p>The Deputy Director will lead the Government Digital Service data transformation work, helping government make data part of everyday work. The role sits in the digital centre of government and covers data strategy, agreed standards and a growing data capability across departments. Locations are London, Bristol or Manchester, with flexible working options including occasionally working from home, though the department does not normally offer full home working. Readers following other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/uk">UK jobs</a> can also read our report on the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/hmrc-tax-specialist-programme-500-posts-20261025">HMRC Tax Specialist Programme</a>, another senior Civil Service opening.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>The post is at Senior Civil Service Pay Band 1, so applicants need senior leadership experience in data, digital or transformation work, with the capability to lead a complex government data function. The vacancy is advertised with flexible working patterns, including full time, job share, part time and compressed hours. Security clearance at SC level is required, as stated in the vacancy details. The Civil Service welcomes applications from everyone, including people underrepresented in the workforce.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>Pay is £86,000 to £117,800, based on capability. Benefits include a Civil Service pension with an average employer contribution of 28.97%, 25 days of annual leave increasing by a day each year up to a maximum of 30 days, and advances on pay including for travel season tickets.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply online through Civil Service Jobs, on the Deputy Director, Data Maturity and Transformation vacancy, before 23:55 on Monday 30 November 2026. Applications are handled electronically, so applicants should check their Civil Service Jobs account and spam folder regularly for updates.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The vacancy details I read do not state how many Deputy Director posts are open. The published timeline lists panel interviews in the week of 25 January 2026, which falls before the closing date, so applicants should treat that date as listed and check the live vacancy for any correction. The notice does not state whether visa sponsorship is available for this post.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> Civil Service Jobs applications are free, and the Government Digital Service will never ask for money in exchange for an application, an assessment or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.civilservicejobs.service.gov.uk/csr/jobs.cgi?jcode=2020245">Civil Service Jobs</a>, the official vacancy notice (closing date, locations and timeline); <a href="https://www.civilserviceworld.com/jobs/listing/deputy-director-data-maturity-transformation">Civil Service World</a>, the vacancy listing (salary range and closing date).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What does the post pay?</h3><p>From £86,000 to £117,800, based on capability, at SCS Pay Band 1.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>At 23:55 on Monday 30 November 2026.</p><h3>Where is the role based?</h3><p>London, Bristol or Manchester, with flexible working options.</p><h3>What happens after the closing date?</h3><p>The sift completes on 8 December 2026, followed by global resourcing interviews from 10 to 18 December 2026.</p>$$,
$$<p>सरकारी डिजिटल सेवाले सरकारीभरि डेटा परिपक्वता र रूपान्तरण कार्यको नेतृत्व गर्न उपनिर्देशक डेटा परिपक्वता जागिरका लागि आवेदन खुलाएको छ। आवेदन सोमबार ३० नोभेम्बर २०२६ को २३:५५ मा बन्द हुन्छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>सरकारी डिजिटल सेवा, विज्ञान, नवप्रवर्तन तथा प्रविधि विभाग</td></tr><tr><td>पद</td><td>उपनिर्देशक, डेटा परिपक्वता तथा रूपान्तरण, SCS तलब ब्यान्ड १, स्थायी</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>क्षमताअनुसार £86,000 देखि £117,800 सम्म</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन मिति</td><td>सोमबार ३० नोभेम्बर २०२६ को २३:५५ मा बन्द; छनोट ८ डिसेम्बर २०२६ मा पूरा</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन तरिका</td><td>सिभिल सर्भिस जब्सबाट अनलाइन</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पद के हो</h2><p>उपनिर्देशकले सरकारी डिजिटल सेवाको डेटा रूपान्तरण कार्यको नेतृत्व गर्छन् र सरकारलाई डेटालाई दैनिक कार्यको हिस्सा बनाउन सहयोग गर्छन्। स्थान लन्डन, ब्रिस्टल वा म्यानचेस्टर हो, कहिलेकाहीँ घरबाट काम गर्ने लचिलो विकल्पसहित।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>यो पद वरिष्ठ नागरिक सेवा तलब ब्यान्ड १ मा छ, त्यसैले आवेदकसँग डेटा, डिजिटल वा रूपान्तरण कार्यमा वरिष्ठ नेतृत्व अनुभव चाहिन्छ। SC तहको सुरक्षा जाँच आवश्यक छ।</p><h2>तलब कति छ</h2><p>तलब क्षमताअनुसार £86,000 देखि £117,800 सम्म छ। सुविधामा औसत 28.97% रोजगारदाता योगदानसहितको नागरिक सेवा पेन्सन र २५ दिनको वार्षिक बिदा समावेश छन्।</p><h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2><p>सोमबार ३० नोभेम्बर २०२६ को २३:५५ अघि सिभिल सर्भिस जब्सबाट अनलाइन आवेदन दिनुहोस्।</p><h2>सूचनाले के भनेको छैन</h2><p>मैले पढेको विज्ञापनले कति पद खुलेका छन् भन्ने बताएको छैन, र भिसा प्रायोजन उपलब्ध छ कि छैन भन्ने पनि बताएको छैन।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> सिभिल सर्भिस जब्समा आवेदन निःशुल्क छ।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.civilservicejobs.service.gov.uk/csr/jobs.cgi?jcode=2020245">सिभिल सर्भिस जब्स</a>, आधिकारिक रिक्ति सूचना; <a href="https://www.civilserviceworld.com/jobs/listing/deputy-director-data-maturity-transformation">सिभिल सर्भिस वर्ल्ड</a>, रिक्ति सूची।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>तलब कति छ?</h3><p>क्षमताअनुसार £86,000 देखि £117,800 सम्म।</p><h3>आवेदन कहिले बन्द हुन्छ?</h3><p>सोमबार ३० नोभेम्बर २०२६ को २३:५५ मा।</p><h3>स्थान कहाँ हो?</h3><p>लन्डन, ब्रिस्टल वा म्यानचेस्टर।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.civilservicejobs.service.gov.uk/csr/jobs.cgi?jcode=2020245', 'https://www.civilserviceworld.com/jobs/listing/deputy-director-data-maturity-transformation'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-22'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

