'Head of Technical Architecture jobs are open at Companies House, paying £76,312 to £93,308 a year. Apply by 29 November 2026 for the Grade 6 post.',
'कम्पनीज हाउसमा प्राविधिक वास्तुकला प्रमुख जागिर खुलेका छन्, तलब वार्षिक £76,312 देखि £93,308 सम्म। ग्रेड ६ पदका लागि २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ सम्म आवेदन दिनुहोस्।',
$$<p>Companies House is hiring for Head of Technical Architecture jobs, leading the technical architecture capability for one of the largest sources of data in the UK, with applications closing at 23:55 on Sunday 29 November 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Companies House</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>Head of Technical Architecture, Grade 6, permanent</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>£76,312 to £93,308 a year, including a DDaT allowance of £4,350 to £11,000</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Closing 23:55 Sunday 29 November 2026; sifting from the week of 30 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through Civil Service Jobs</td></tr><tr><td>Interview</td><td>From the week of 7 December 2026, via Microsoft Teams</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>Proven experience leading a technical architecture function in a complex organisation</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the Head of Technical Architecture jobs involve</h2><p>The Head of Technical Architecture is responsible for defining and leading the technical architecture capability, ensuring that technology solutions, platforms and engineering practices are designed, implemented and governed in line with enterprise architecture principles, organisational standards and strategic technology objectives. The role establishes the standards, principles and technical direction needed to deliver a secure, resilient, scalable and sustainable technology landscape. Companies House holds one of the largest sources of data in the UK, supporting transparency, economic research and public trust. Readers following other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/uk">UK jobs</a> can also read our report on the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/hmrc-tax-specialist-programme-500-posts-20261025">HMRC Tax Specialist Programme</a>, another senior Civil Service opening.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>Applicants need proven experience leading, developing or setting the strategic direction of a technical architecture function within a complex organisation. The post is at Grade 6 in the Digital, Data and Technology profession, it is permanent, and security clearance at SC level is required. The vacancy is advertised with a range of working patterns, and applicants can read the Government Digital and Data candidate information pack for more on a career in Digital and Data within the Civil Service.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>Pay is £76,312 to £93,308 a year. The base salary is £76,312 to £82,308 a year, with an additional DDaT allowance of £4,350 to £11,000 available. Companies House contributes £22,107 towards the Civil Service Defined Benefit Pension scheme alongside a salary of £76,312, and the pension scheme carries an average employer contribution of 28%.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply online through Civil Service Jobs, on the Head of Technical Architecture vacancy at Companies House, before 23:55 on Sunday 29 November 2026. Communications will be electronic by email, so applicants should check their Civil Service Jobs account regularly, as well as their spam folder.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The vacancy details I read do not state how many Head of Technical Architecture posts are open, or the duty location beyond the Companies House organisation. The notice does not state whether visa sponsorship is available for this post, and it does not give an exact interview date, only the week of 7 December 2026.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> Civil Service Jobs applications are free, and Companies House will never ask for money in exchange for an application, an assessment or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.civilservicejobs.service.gov.uk/csr/jobs.cgi?jcode=2021175">Civil Service Jobs</a>, the official vacancy notice (closing date, sifting and interview dates); <a href="https://www.csinterviewcoach.com/civil-service-jobs-tracker/vacancy/head-of-technical-architecture-490259">CS Interview Coach</a>, the vacancy tracker (salary range, grade and post count as listed).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What does the post pay?</h3><p>From £76,312 to £93,308 a year, including a DDaT allowance of £4,350 to £11,000.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>At 23:55 on Sunday 29 November 2026.</p><h3>Who is the employer?</h3><p>Companies House, which holds one of the largest sources of data in the UK.</p><h3>When are interviews held?</h3><p>From the week of 7 December 2026, via Microsoft Teams.</p>$$,
$$<p>कम्पनीज हाउसले बेलायतको सबैभन्दा ठूलो डेटा स्रोतमध्ये एकका लागि प्राविधिक वास्तुकला क्षमताको नेतृत्व गर्न प्राविधिक वास्तुकला प्रमुख जागिरका लागि आवेदन खुलाएको छ। आवेदन आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को २३:५५ मा बन्द हुन्छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>कम्पनीज हाउस</td></tr><tr><td>पद</td><td>प्राविधिक वास्तुकला प्रमुख, ग्रेड ६, स्थायी</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>वार्षिक £76,312 देखि £93,308 सम्म, DDaT भत्ता £4,350 देखि £11,000 सहित</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन मिति</td><td>आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को २३:५५ मा बन्द; ३० नोभेम्बर २०२६ को हप्तादेखि छनोट</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन तरिका</td><td>सिभिल सर्भिस जब्सबाट अनलाइन</td></tr><tr><td>अन्तर्वार्ता</td><td>७ डिसेम्बर २०२६ को हप्तादेखि, माइक्रोसफ्ट टिम्सबाट</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पद के हो</h2><p>प्राविधिक वास्तुकला प्रमुखले प्राविधिक वास्तुकला क्षमतालाई परिभाषित र नेतृत्व गर्छन्, प्रविधि समाधान, प्लेटफर्म र इन्जिनियरिङ अभ्यासहरू उद्यम वास्तुकला सिद्धान्त र संगठनात्मक मापदण्डअनुसार डिजाइन र कार्यान्वयन हुने सुनिश्चित गर्छन्।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>आवेदकसँग जटिल संगठनभित्र प्राविधिक वास्तुकला कार्यको नेतृत्व, विकास वा रणनीतिक दिशा निर्धारण गरेको प्रमाणित अनुभव चाहिन्छ। यो पद ग्रेड ६ मा छ र SC तहको सुरक्षा जाँच आवश्यक छ।</p><h2>तलब कति छ</h2><p>तलब वार्षिक £76,312 देखि £93,308 सम्म छ। आधार तलब £76,312 देखि £82,308 सम्म छ, साथै £4,350 देखि £11,000 सम्मको DDaT भत्ता उपलब्ध छ।</p><h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2><p>आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को २३:५५ अघि सिभिल सर्भिस जब्सबाट अनलाइन आवेदन दिनुहोस्।</p><h2>सूचनाले के भनेको छैन</h2><p>मैले पढेको विज्ञापनले कति पद खुलेका छन् वा कर्तव्य स्थान बताएको छैन, र भिसा प्रायोजन उपलब्ध छ कि छैन भन्ने पनि बताएको छैन।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> सिभिल सर्भिस जब्समा आवेदन निःशुल्क छ।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.civilservicejobs.service.gov.uk/csr/jobs.cgi?jcode=2021175">सिभिल सर्भिस जब्स</a>, आधिकारिक रिक्ति सूचना; <a href="https://www.csinterviewcoach.com/civil-service-jobs-tracker/vacancy/head-of-technical-architecture-490259">CS Interview Coach</a>, रिक्ति ट्र्याकर।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>तलब कति छ?</h3><p>वार्षिक £76,312 देखि £93,308 सम्म, DDaT भत्तासहित।</p><h3>आवेदन कहिले बन्द हुन्छ?</h3><p>आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को २३:५५ मा।</p><h3>अन्तर्वार्ता कहिले हुन्छ?</h3><p>७ डिसेम्बर २०२६ को हप्तादेखि, माइक्रोसफ्ट टिम्सबाट।</p>$$,
