VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'team-leader-jobs-ramsgate-dwp-20261123', 'uk', 'UK',
'Team Leader Jobs in Ramsgate: DWP, 7 Posts, Close 1 December',
'टोली नेता जागिर: राम्सगेटमा DWP, ७ पद, १ डिसेम्बरमा बन्द',
'Team Leader jobs in Ramsgate are open at the Department for Work and Pensions, with 7 posts paying £36,239 to £37,664 a year. Apply by 1 December 2026.',
'कार्य तथा पेन्सन विभागमा राम्सगेटमा टोली नेता जागिर खुलेका छन्, ७ पद, तलब वार्षिक £36,239 देखि £37,664 सम्म। १ डिसेम्बर २०२६ सम्म आवेदन दिनुहोस्।',
$$<p>The Department for Work and Pensions is hiring for Team Leader jobs in Ramsgate, with 7 posts in its Counter Fraud, Compliance and Debt directorate, and applications close at 23:55 on Tuesday 1 December 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Department for Work and Pensions, Counter Fraud, Compliance and Debt directorate</td></tr><tr><td>Total posts</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>£36,239 to £37,664 a year</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Closing 23:55 Tuesday 1 December 2026; sift 2 to 18 December 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through Civil Service Jobs</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>Application form, Civil Service Management Judgement Test, CV and written statement, then interview</td></tr><tr><td>Interview</td><td>25 January to 5 February 2027, face to face in Ramsgate where possible</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the Team Leader jobs in Ramsgate involve</h2><p>Team Leaders in the Counter Fraud, Compliance and Debt directorate sit at the heart of the Department for Work and Pensions front line operations, helping to change peoples lives and supporting the directorate purpose of fighting fraud in the welfare system. The roles are based at Queens House, Queen Street, Ramsgate, CT11 9EW, subject to space availability at the time of posting. A webinar about the roles takes place on Wednesday 25 November 2026 between 12 noon and 1pm. Readers following other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/uk">UK jobs</a> can also read our report on the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/hmrc-tax-specialist-programme-500-posts-20261025">HMRC Tax Specialist Programme</a>, another Civil Service opening with many posts.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>The posts are at Executive Officer grade in the Operational Delivery profession, and they are permanent. Applicants complete an application form with basic information, eligibility and any reasonable adjustments needed, then a Civil Service Management Judgement Test, and then a CV and written statement. The test takes at least one hour, plus time for the CV and full application, so applicants should allow time before the deadline. A candidate is not eligible to apply for a role within the Civil Service if the application is made within a five year period following a dismissal for carrying out internal fraud against government. The department values diversity and actively encourages applications from everyone, including people underrepresented in the workforce.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>Pay is £36,239 to £37,664 a year. Alongside a salary of £36,239, the Department for Work and Pensions contributes £10,498 towards membership of the Civil Service Defined Benefit Pension scheme. The role includes completion of the Leadership and Management Apprenticeship at Level 3.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply online through Civil Service Jobs, on the Team Leader, Ramsgate vacancy, reference 490400. The closing date for all stages of the application, including the test, CV and written statement, is 23:55 on Tuesday 1 December 2026, and an application is withdrawn if any stage is not completed before the deadline.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The notice does not state an exact interview date, only the window from 25 January to 5 February 2027, and it notes that candidates may be expected to travel to an alternative location if needed. The vacancies are not currently eligible for new applications for visa sponsorship on the Skilled Worker route, for candidates who do not currently have permission to be in the UK as a Skilled Worker sponsored before 4 April 2024, as the roles are not included in the published Immigration Salary List.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> Civil Service Jobs applications are free, and the Department for Work and Pensions will never ask for money in exchange for an application, a test or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.civilservicejobs.service.gov.uk/csr/jobs.cgi?jcode=2021779&utm_campaign=jobies&utm_medium=job_board&utm_source=jobies.co.uk">Civil Service Jobs</a>, the official vacancy notice (closing date, test and interview dates); <a href="https://www.csinterviewcoach.com/civil-service-jobs-tracker/vacancy/team-leader-ramsgate-490400">CS Interview Coach</a>, the vacancy tracker (7 posts, grade and salary range).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How many posts are open?</h3><p>Seven Team Leader posts in Ramsgate.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>At 23:55 on Tuesday 1 December 2026, for all stages including the online test.</p><h3>What does the post pay?</h3><p>From £36,239 to £37,664 a year, with a Civil Service pension.</p><h3>Is visa sponsorship available?</h3><p>No. The notice states these vacancies are not currently eligible for new Skilled Worker visa sponsorship applications.</p>$$,
$$<p>कार्य तथा पेन्सन विभागले राम्सगेटमा टोली नेता जागिरका लागि आवेदन खुलाएको छ, यसको काउन्टर फ्रड, कम्प्लायन्स तथा ऋण निर्देशनालयमा ७ पद छन्। आवेदन मंगलबार १ डिसेम्बर २०२६ को २३:५५ मा बन्द हुन्छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>कार्य तथा पेन्सन विभाग, काउन्टर फ्रड, कम्प्लायन्स तथा ऋण निर्देशनालय</td></tr><tr><td>कुल पद</td><td>७</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>वार्षिक £36,239 देखि £37,664 सम्म</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन मिति</td><td>मंगलबार १ डिसेम्बर २०२६ को २३:५५ मा बन्द; छनोट २ देखि १८ डिसेम्बर २०२६ सम्म</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन तरिका</td><td>सिभिल सर्भिस जब्सबाट अनलाइन</td></tr><tr><td>छनोट</td><td>आवेदन फारम, सिभिल सर्भिस व्यवस्थापन निर्णय परीक्षण, CV र लिखित विवरण, त्यसपछि अन्तर्वार्ता</td></tr><tr><td>अन्तर्वार्ता</td><td>२५ जनवरीदेखि ५ फेब्रुअरी २०२७ सम्म, सम्भव भए राम्सगेटमा प्रत्यक्ष</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पद के हो</h2><p>काउन्टर फ्रड, कम्प्लायन्स तथा ऋण निर्देशनालयका टोली नेताहरू कार्य तथा पेन्सन विभागको अग्रपंक्तिको सञ्चालनको केन्द्रमा हुन्छन्, कल्याणकारी प्रणालीमा ठगीविरुद्ध लड्न सहयोग गर्छन्। स्थान क्वीन्स हाउस, क्वीन्स स्ट्रिट, राम्सगेट हो।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>पदहरू कार्यकारी अधिकृत ग्रेडमा स्थायी छन्। आवेदकले आवेदन फारम, सिभिल सर्भिस व्यवस्थापन निर्णय परीक्षण, CV र लिखित विवरण पूरा गर्नुपर्छ। परीक्षणमा कम्तीमा एक घण्टा लाग्छ।</p><h2>तलब कति छ</h2><p>तलब वार्षिक £36,239 देखि £37,664 सम्म छ। £36,239 तलबसँगै विभागले नागरिक सेवा परिभाषित लाभ पेन्सन योजनामा £10,498 योगदान गर्छ।</p><h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2><p>मंगलबार १ डिसेम्बर २०२६ को २३:५५ अघि सिभिल सर्भिस जब्सबाट अनलाइन आवेदन दिनुहोस्, टोली नेता, राम्सगेट रिक्ति, सन्दर्भ 490400।</p><h2>सूचनाले के भनेको छैन</h2><p>सूचनाले ठ्याक्कै अन्तर्वार्ता मिति बताएको छैन, २५ जनवरीदेखि ५ फेब्रुअरी २०२७ सम्मको अवधि मात्र दिएको छ। यी रिक्तिहरू नयाँ दक्ष कामदार भिसा प्रायोजनका लागि हाल योग्य छैनन्।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> सिभिल सर्भिस जब्समा आवेदन निःशुल्क छ।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.civilservicejobs.service.gov.uk/csr/jobs.cgi?jcode=2021779&utm_campaign=jobies&utm_medium=job_board&utm_source=jobies.co.uk">सिभिल सर्भिस जब्स</a>, आधिकारिक रिक्ति सूचना; <a href="https://www.csinterviewcoach.com/civil-service-jobs-tracker/vacancy/team-leader-ramsgate-490400">CS Interview Coach</a>, रिक्ति ट्र्याकर।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>कति पद खुलेका छन्?</h3><p>राम्सगेटमा सात टोली नेता पद।</p><h3>आवेदन कहिले बन्द हुन्छ?</h3><p>मंगलबार १ डिसेम्बर २०२६ को २३:५५ मा।</p><h3>तलब कति छ?</h3><p>वार्षिक £36,239 देखि £37,664 सम्म।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.civilservicejobs.service.gov.uk/csr/jobs.cgi?jcode=2021779&utm_campaign=jobies&utm_medium=job_board&utm_source=jobies.co.uk', 'https://www.csinterviewcoach.com/civil-service-jobs-tracker/vacancy/team-leader-ramsgate-490400'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-22'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

