'NRC Technical Officer jobs in Montreal support GMP production of biotherapeutics and vaccines, paying $66,126 to $91,012 a year. Apply by 23 November 2026.',
'मोन्ट्रियलमा NRC प्राविधिक अधिकृत जागिरले जैवचिकित्सा र खोपको GMP उत्पादनमा सहयोग गर्छन्, तलब वार्षिक $66,126 देखि $91,012 सम्म। २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ सम्म आवेदन दिनुहोस्।',
$$<p>The National Research Council Canada is hiring for NRC Technical Officer jobs in Montreal, supporting GMP production of biotherapeutics and vaccines, with applications closing at 23:59 Eastern Time on Monday 23 November 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>National Research Council Canada, Human Health Therapeutics</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>Technical Officer, GMP Buffer and Solution Preparation, TO-3, term of 2 years</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>$66,126 to $91,012 a year</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Closing 23 November 2026, 23:59 Eastern Time</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through the National Research Council careers site</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>Bachelor in Sciences, Biotechnology, Engineering or a related field</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the NRC Technical Officer jobs involve</h2><p>The Technical Officer supports the Production team at the Clinical Trial Material Facility, preparing buffer solutions under GMP, documenting and analysing experiments and tests, and maintaining clean room and process equipment in a highly controlled environment. The team works on the production process for promising biotherapeutics and vaccines, from technology transfer to GMP manufacturing, and its work directly contributes to the clinical development of vaccines and therapeutic candidates for Canadian small and medium-sized enterprises. The role is based in Montreal and requires full time physical presence at the work location. Readers following other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/canada">Canada jobs</a> can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/canada-federal-government-jobs-november-2026-20261121">Canada federal government jobs in November 2026</a>, covering other federal openings with December deadlines.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>Applicants need a bachelor degree in Sciences, Biotechnology, Engineering or a related field, though a collegial diploma combined with relevant and significant experience may be considered. Significant experience is mandatory in buffer and solution preparation in a GMP laboratory environment for pharmaceutical or biotechnology production, preferably related to vaccines or biotherapies, and in aseptic techniques, plus experience operating, cleaning, sanitising and maintaining process equipment for buffer preparation, filtration, mixing and material handling. Candidates are assessed on knowledge of biomanufacturing and GMP requirements, standard operating procedures, and working techniques in an aseptic environment. Preference will be given to Canadian citizens and permanent residents of Canada, and applicants should include citizenship information in the application. A Reliability Status is needed, with verification of background information over 5 years.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>Pay is from $66,126 to $91,012 a year. National Research Council employees receive a pension plan, comprehensive health and dental coverage, disability and life insurance, office closure at the end of December, and additional wellbeing supports. Relocation assistance will be determined under the National Research Council directives.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply online through the National Research Council careers site, quoting requisition number 26430, before 23:59 Eastern Time on Monday 23 November 2026. Questions go to the NRC Hiring team at the email address given in the posting. A pre-qualified list may be established for similar positions for a one year period.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The notice does not state how many Technical Officer posts are open, an interview date, or an assessment date. It does not state an application fee, and it does not say whether the term post can be extended beyond the 2 year duration. Only candidates selected for further consideration will be contacted.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> National Research Council applications are free, and the Council will never ask for money in exchange for an application, an assessment or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://recruitment-recrutement.nrc-cnrc.gc.ca/job/Montr%C3%A9al-Technical-Officer%2C-GMP-BufferSolution-Preparation-QC/607824417/">National Research Council Canada</a>, the official vacancy notice (pay, closing date, qualifications and duties).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What does the post pay?</h3><p>From $66,126 to $91,012 a year, at classification TO-3.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>At 23:59 Eastern Time on Monday 23 November 2026.</p><h3>Who gets preference?</h3><p>Preference will be given to Canadian citizens and permanent residents of Canada.</p><h3>Is GMP experience required?</h3><p>Yes. Significant experience in buffer and solution preparation in a GMP laboratory is mandatory, preferably related to vaccines or biotherapies.</p>$$,
$$<p>क्यानडाको राष्ट्रिय अनुसन्धान परिषद्ले मोन्ट्रियलमा NRC प्राविधिक अधिकृत जागिरका लागि आवेदन खुलाएको छ, जैवचिकित्सा र खोपको GMP उत्पादनमा सहयोग गर्न। आवेदन सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को पूर्वी समय २३:५९ मा बन्द हुन्छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>क्यानडाको राष्ट्रिय अनुसन्धान परिषद्, मानव स्वास्थ्य उपचार</td></tr><tr><td>पद</td><td>प्राविधिक अधिकृत, GMP बफर तथा समाधान तयारी, TO-3, २ वर्षको अवधि</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>वार्षिक $66,126 देखि $91,012 सम्म</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन मिति</td><td>२३ नोभेम्बर २०२६, पूर्वी समय २३:५९ मा बन्द</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन तरिका</td><td>राष्ट्रिय अनुसन्धान परिषद् करियर साइटबाट अनलाइन</td></tr><tr><td>योग्यता</td><td>विज्ञान, जैवप्रविधि, इन्जिनियरिङ वा सम्बन्धित क्षेत्रमा स्नातक</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पद के हो</h2><p>प्राविधिक अधिकृतले क्लिनिकल परीक्षण सामग्री सुविधामा उत्पादन टोलीलाई सहयोग गर्छन्, GMP अन्तर्गत बफर समाधान तयार गर्छन्, प्रयोग तथा परीक्षण दस्तावेज र विश्लेषण गर्छन्, र उच्च नियन्त्रित वातावरणमा सफा कोठा तथा प्रक्रिया उपकरण मर्मत गर्छन्। यो भूमिका मोन्ट्रियलमा छ र कार्यस्थलमा पूर्णकालीन भौतिक उपस्थिति चाहिन्छ।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>आवेदकसँग विज्ञान, जैवप्रविधि, इन्जिनियरिङ वा सम्बन्धित क्षेत्रमा स्नातक डिग्री चाहिन्छ। औषधि वा जैवप्रविधि उत्पादनको GMP प्रयोगशाला वातावरणमा बफर तथा समाधान तयारीमा उल्लेखनीय अनुभव अनिवार्य छ, खोप वा जैवचिकित्सासँग सम्बन्धित भए राम्रो। क्यानडाका नागरिक तथा स्थायी बासिन्दालाई प्राथमिकता दिइनेछ।</p><h2>तलब कति छ</h2><p>तलब वार्षिक $66,126 देखि $91,012 सम्म छ। कर्मचारीले पेन्सन योजना, व्यापक स्वास्थ्य तथा दन्त कभरेज, असक्षमता तथा जीवन बीमा पाउँछन्।</p><h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2><p>सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को पूर्वी समय २३:५९ अघि राष्ट्रिय अनुसन्धान परिषद् करियर साइटबाट अनलाइन आवेदन दिनुहोस्, माग नम्बर 26430 उल्लेख गरेर।</p><h2>सूचनाले के भनेको छैन</h2><p>सूचनाले कति पद खुलेका छन्, अन्तर्वार्ता मिति वा मूल्याङ्कन मिति बताएको छैन। आवेदन शुल्क पनि बताएको छैन।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> राष्ट्रिय अनुसन्धान परिषद्मा आवेदन निःशुल्क छ।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://recruitment-recrutement.nrc-cnrc.gc.ca/job/Montr%C3%A9al-Technical-Officer%2C-GMP-BufferSolution-Preparation-QC/607824417/">क्यानडाको राष्ट्रिय अनुसन्धान परिषद्</a>, आधिकारिक रिक्ति सूचना।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>तलब कति छ?</h3><p>वार्षिक $66,126 देखि $91,012 सम्म।</p><h3>आवेदन कहिले बन्द हुन्छ?</h3><p>सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को पूर्वी समय २३:५९ मा।</p><h3>GMP अनुभव आवश्यक छ?</h3><p>हो। GMP प्रयोगशालामा बफर तथा समाधान तयारीमा उल्लेखनीय अनुभव अनिवार्य छ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://recruitment-recrutement.nrc-cnrc.gc.ca/job/Montr%C3%A9al-Technical-Officer%2C-GMP-BufferSolution-Preparation-QC/607824417/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-22'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- virtual-mail-clerk-jobs-canada-pspc-20261123 (canada; English 559 words; Nepali 266 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-22'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'virtual-mail-clerk-jobs-canada-pspc-20261123', 'canada', 'Canada',
'Virtual Mail Clerk Jobs in Canada: PSPC, Close 29 November',
'भर्चुअल मेल क्लर्क जागिर: क्यानडामा PSPC, २९ नोभेम्बरमा बन्द',
'Virtual Mail Clerk jobs are open at Public Services and Procurement Canada in Winnipeg and Matane, paying $51,642 to $55,707 a year. Apply by 29 November.',
'क्यानडामा सार्वजनिक सेवा तथा खरिद विभागमा विनिपेग र मातानेमा भर्चुअल मेल क्लर्क जागिर खुलेका छन्, तलब वार्षिक $51,642 देखि $55,707 सम्म। २९ नोभेम्बर सम्म आवेदन दिनुहोस्।',
$$<p>Public Services and Procurement Canada is hiring for Virtual Mail Clerk jobs in Winnipeg and Matane, with applications closing at 23:59 Pacific Time on Sunday 29 November 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Public Services and Procurement Canada, Receiver General and Pension Branch</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>Virtual Mail and Document Control Clerk, CR-03</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>$51,642 to $55,707 a year</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Closing Sunday 29 November 2026, 23:59 Pacific Time</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online only through the Public Service Resourcing System</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>Successful completion of two years of secondary school, or an acceptable combination of education, training and experience</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the Virtual Mail Clerk jobs involve</h2><p>Virtual Mail and Document Control Clerks work in the Imaging and Receiver General Operations Directorate, handling virtual mail and document control for the Receiver General. The work involves digitisation operations, including high volume document scanning, and the operational requirements include being able and willing to lift and handle loads of 10 to 23 kg. Physical presence is required, as telework is not offered on a full time basis. An initial wave of assessments will be conducted for operational needs in Matane, Quebec, followed by a second wave for Winnipeg, Manitoba. Readers following other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/canada">Canada jobs</a> can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/canada-federal-government-jobs-november-2026-20261121">Canada federal government jobs in November 2026</a>, covering other federal openings with December deadlines.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>Persons residing in Canada, and Canadian citizens and permanent residents abroad, can apply. The education standard is successful completion of two years of secondary school, or an acceptable combination of education, training and experience. Experience using a computer and various software programs is essential, and client service competency at Level 1 is assessed. Various language requirements apply, and they are assessed at a later date. Experience in digitisation operations as a high volume document scanner operator is listed as an asset. This process is anticipatory, and a pool of partially or fully qualified candidates will be established to staff identical or similar positions with various language or security requirements and tenures within Public Services and Procurement Canada.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>Pay is $51,642 to $55,707 a year at the CR-03 level. The posting does not state allowances or a starting step within the range.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply online only through the Public Service Resourcing System, on the Virtual Mail and Document Control Clerk posting, reference number SVC26J-021989-000667 and selection process number 2026-SVC-HQ-EA-687321, before 23:59 Pacific Time on Sunday 29 November 2026.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The notice does not state how many clerk posts are open, as it establishes a pool for future vacancies, and it does not state an interview or assessment date beyond the two waves of assessments for Matane and then Winnipeg. It does not state an application fee, and it does not say which language profiles will be assessed first.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> Federal hiring in Canada is free, and Public Services and Procurement Canada will never ask for money in exchange for an application, an assessment or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://emploisfp-psjobs.cfp-psc.gc.ca/psrs-srfp/applicant/page1800?iscr=iscr&icr=icr&poster=2481201&from=facebook">GC Jobs</a>, the official Government of Canada vacancy notice (pay, closing date, locations and qualifications); <a href="https://www.gjobs.ca/jobs/2481201">GJobs</a>, the Government of Canada posting text as published (reference number and who can apply).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What does the post pay?</h3><p>From $51,642 to $55,707 a year, at the CR-03 level.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>At 23:59 Pacific Time on Sunday 29 November 2026.</p><h3>Where are the jobs?</h3><p>Winnipeg, Manitoba, and Matane, Quebec, with physical presence required.</p><h3>Who can apply?</h3><p>Persons residing in Canada, and Canadian citizens and permanent residents abroad.</p>$$,
$$<p>क्यानडाको सार्वजनिक सेवा तथा खरिद विभागले विनिपेग र मातानेमा भर्चुअल मेल क्लर्क जागिरका लागि आवेदन खुलाएको छ। आवेदन आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को प्रशान्त समय २३:५९ मा बन्द हुन्छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>क्यानडाको सार्वजनिक सेवा तथा खरिद विभाग, रिसीभर जनरल तथा पेन्सन शाखा</td></tr><tr><td>पद</td><td>भर्चुअल मेल तथा दस्तावेज नियन्त्रण क्लर्क, CR-03</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>वार्षिक $51,642 देखि $55,707 सम्म</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन मिति</td><td>आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६, प्रशान्त समय २३:५९ मा बन्द</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन तरिका</td><td>सार्वजनिक सेवा स्रोत प्रणालीबाट मात्र अनलाइन</td></tr><tr><td>योग्यता</td><td>माध्यमिक विद्यालयको दुई वर्ष पूरा, वा शिक्षा, तालिम र अनुभवको स्वीकार्य संयोजन</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पद के हो</h2><p>भर्चुअल मेल तथा दस्तावेज नियन्त्रण क्लर्कहरूले इमेजिङ तथा रिसीभर जनरल सञ्चालन निर्देशनालयमा काम गर्छन्, भर्चुअल मेल र दस्तावेज नियन्त्रण सम्हाल्छन्। काममा उच्च मात्रामा दस्तावेज स्क्यानिङसहित डिजिटाइजेसन सञ्चालन पर्छ, र १० देखि २३ किलो तौल उठाउन सक्नुपर्छ। टेलिवर्क पूर्णकालीन रूपमा उपलब्ध छैन।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>क्यानडामा बसोबास गर्ने व्यक्ति, र विदेशमा रहेका क्यानडाका नागरिक तथा स्थायी बासिन्दाले आवेदन दिन सक्छन्। शिक्षा मापदण्ड माध्यमिक विद्यालयको दुई वर्ष पूरा वा शिक्षा, तालिम र अनुभवको स्वीकार्य संयोजन हो। कम्प्युटर र विभिन्न सफ्टवेयर प्रयोगको अनुभव आवश्यक छ।</p><h2>तलब कति छ</h2><p>तलब CR-03 तहमा वार्षिक $51,642 देखि $55,707 सम्म छ।</p><h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2><p>आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को प्रशान्त समय २३:५९ अघि सार्वजनिक सेवा स्रोत प्रणालीबाट मात्र अनलाइन आवेदन दिनुहोस्, सन्दर्भ नम्बर SVC26J-021989-000667।</p><h2>सूचनाले के भनेको छैन</h2><p>सूचनाले कति क्लर्क पद खुलेका छन् भन्ने बताएको छैन, किनकि यसले भविष्यका रिक्तिका लागि समूह बनाउँछ, र अन्तर्वार्ता वा मूल्याङ्कन मिति पनि बताएको छैन।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> क्यानडामा संघीय भर्ती निःशुल्क छ।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://emploisfp-psjobs.cfp-psc.gc.ca/psrs-srfp/applicant/page1800?iscr=iscr&icr=icr&poster=2481201&from=facebook">GC Jobs</a>, क्यानडा सरकारको आधिकारिक रिक्ति सूचना; <a href="https://www.gjobs.ca/jobs/2481201">GJobs</a>, प्रकाशित सरकारी पोस्टिङ पाठ।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>तलब कति छ?</h3><p>वार्षिक $51,642 देखि $55,707 सम्म, CR-03 तहमा।</p><h3>आवेदन कहिले बन्द हुन्छ?</h3><p>आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को प्रशान्त समय २३:५९ मा।</p><h3>जागिर कहाँ छन्?</h3><p>विनिपेग, मनिटोबा, र माताने, क्युबेकमा।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://emploisfp-psjobs.cfp-psc.gc.ca/psrs-srfp/applicant/page1800?iscr=iscr&icr=icr&poster=2481201&from=facebook', 'https://www.gjobs.ca/jobs/2481201'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-22'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- aps5-asset-accountant-jobs-australia-20261123 (australia; English 630 words; Nepali 247 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-22'::timestamptz)
