VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'aps5-asset-accountant-jobs-australia-20261123', 'australia', 'Australia',
'APS5 Asset Accountant Jobs in Australia: Close 29 November',
'APS5 सम्पत्ति लेखापाल जागिर: अस्ट्रेलियामा २९ नोभेम्बरमा बन्द',
'APS5 Asset Accountant jobs in Australia are open in Canberra and Adelaide, paying $89,225 to $96,829 a year plus superannuation. Apply by 29 November 2026.',
'अस्ट्रेलियामा क्यानबेरा र एडिलेडमा APS5 सम्पत्ति लेखापाल जागिर खुलेका छन्, तलब वार्षिक $89,225 देखि $96,829 सम्म, सुपरएन्युएसनसहित। २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ सम्म आवेदन दिनुहोस्।',
$$<p>The Australian Department of Infrastructure, Transport, Regional Development, Communications, Sport and the Arts is hiring for APS5 Asset Accountant jobs in Canberra and Adelaide, with applications closing at 11:59pm AEDT on Sunday 29 November 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Australian Department of Infrastructure, Transport, Regional Development, Communications, Sport and the Arts</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>APS5 Asset Accountant, Financial Management, ongoing, full time</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>$89,225 to $96,829 a year plus 15.4% superannuation</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Opened 13 November 2026; closing 11:59pm AEDT Sunday 29 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through APS Jobs</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>Shortlisting 7 December 2026, further assessments 14 December 2026, selection report finalised 24 December 2026</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the APS5 Asset Accountant jobs involve</h2><p>The Asset Accountant works in the Financial Accounting Team, in the Finance, Strategy, Budget and Research Division, undertaking a broad range of financial and asset accounting activities. The role covers the financial information and processes that support the asset register and corporate finance systems, and it needs capability consistent with the APS5 Work Level Standards, including sound judgement, a degree of independence and effective contribution to a professional financial environment. The roles are located in Canberra and Adelaide, with flexible work arrangements including hybrid working from departmental offices, and a merit pool may be formed for future similar vacancies in these locations and other locations in the same metropolitan area. Readers following other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/australia">Australia jobs</a> can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/australia-aps-jobs-november-2026-20261121">Australia APS jobs in November 2026</a>, covering other APS openings this month.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>Applicants need accounting capability at APS5 level, with experience in financial and asset accounting. The vacancy is advertised as ongoing and full time, and the department supports flexible work arrangements. The general Asset Accountant vacancy, reference 48309, is the open competition; the department is also advertising separate Asset Accountant vacancies under affirmative measures, one for people with disability and one for Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander people, each with its own reference number, so applicants should check they are applying for the vacancy that matches their eligibility. Australian citizenship is normally required for APS employment, and the successful candidate will need a baseline security clearance, as stated in the vacancy details for this division.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>Pay is $89,225 to $96,829 a year, plus 15.4% superannuation. The vacancy does not state a starting step within the range.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply online through APS Jobs, on the APS5 Asset Accountant, Financial Management vacancy, reference 48309, before 11:59pm AEDT on Sunday 29 November 2026. Shortlisting is scheduled for 7 December 2026, further assessments for 14 December 2026, and offers and announcements for 4 January 2027. If a merit pool is established, it will be valid for 18 months from the date it first appeared in the APS Gazette.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The notice does not state how many Asset Accountant posts are open under the general vacancy, and it does not state an interview date, only the further assessment date of 14 December 2026. It does not state an application fee. The dates in the timeline are indicative only, and applicants should contact the contact officer if they have questions about the recruitment process or timeframes.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> APS Jobs applications are free, and the Department of Infrastructure will never ask for money in exchange for an application, an assessment or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.viewjobs.com.au/listing/9bad92b8-49ea-4844-abe3-e590b619c939">ViewJobs</a>, the APS vacancy listing as published (salary, closing date, locations and reference 48309); <a href="https://www.recruitercontacts.com/jobs/aps5-asset-accountant-financial-management-at-australian-department-of-infrastructure-and-regional-development-cd6879b5">Recruiter Contacts</a>, the APS vacancy text (timeline, contact officer and merit pool).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What does the post pay?</h3><p>From $89,225 to $96,829 a year, plus 15.4% superannuation.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>At 11:59pm AEDT on Sunday 29 November 2026.</p><h3>Where are the jobs?</h3><p>Canberra and Adelaide, with hybrid working available.</p><h3>Is this the affirmative measures vacancy?</h3><p>No. This is the general vacancy, reference 48309. Separate Asset Accountant vacancies are advertised under affirmative measures for people with disability and for Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander people.</p>$$,
$$<p>अस्ट्रेलियाको पूर्वाधार, यातायात, क्षेत्रीय विकास, सञ्चार, खेलकुद तथा कला विभागले क्यानबेरा र एडिलेडमा APS5 सम्पत्ति लेखापाल जागिरका लागि आवेदन खुलाएको छ। आवेदन आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को AEDT २३:५९ मा बन्द हुन्छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>अस्ट्रेलियाको पूर्वाधार, यातायात, क्षेत्रीय विकास, सञ्चार, खेलकुद तथा कला विभाग</td></tr><tr><td>पद</td><td>APS5 सम्पत्ति लेखापाल, वित्तीय व्यवस्थापन, निरन्तर, पूर्णकालीन</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>वार्षिक $89,225 देखि $96,829 सम्म, साथै 15.4% सुपरएन्युएसन</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन मिति</td><td>१३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा खुल्यो; आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को AEDT २३:५९ मा बन्द</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन तरिका</td><td>APS Jobs बाट अनलाइन</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पद के हो</h2><p>सम्पत्ति लेखापालले वित्त, रणनीति, बजेट तथा अनुसन्धान प्रभागको वित्तीय लेखा टोलीमा काम गर्छन्, वित्तीय तथा सम्पत्ति लेखासम्बन्धी विभिन्न गतिविधि गर्छन्। भूमिका क्यानबेरा र एडिलेडमा छन्, हाइब्रिड कार्य व्यवस्थासहित।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>आवेदकसँग APS5 तहमा लेखा क्षमता र वित्तीय तथा सम्पत्ति लेखामा अनुभव चाहिन्छ। यो सामान्य रिक्ति हो, सन्दर्भ 48309; विभागले अपाङ्गता भएका व्यक्ति र आदिवासी तथा टोरेस स्ट्रेट टापुवासीका लागि छुट्टै सकारात्मक उपाय रिक्ति पनि विज्ञापन गरेको छ, त्यसैले आवेदकले आफ्नो योग्यतासँग मेल खाने रिक्ति जाँच्नुपर्छ।</p><h2>तलब कति छ</h2><p>तलब वार्षिक $89,225 देखि $96,829 सम्म छ, साथै 15.4% सुपरएन्युएसन।</p><h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2><p>आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को AEDT २३:५९ अघि APS Jobs बाट अनलाइन आवेदन दिनुहोस्, APS5 सम्पत्ति लेखापाल रिक्ति, सन्दर्भ 48309।</p><h2>सूचनाले के भनेको छैन</h2><p>सूचनाले सामान्य रिक्तिअन्तर्गत कति पद खुलेका छन् भन्ने बताएको छैन, र अन्तर्वार्ता मिति पनि बताएको छैन।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> APS Jobs मा आवेदन निःशुल्क छ।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.viewjobs.com.au/listing/9bad92b8-49ea-4844-abe3-e590b619c939">ViewJobs</a>, प्रकाशित APS रिक्ति सूची; <a href="https://www.recruitercontacts.com/jobs/aps5-asset-accountant-financial-management-at-australian-department-of-infrastructure-and-regional-development-cd6879b5">Recruiter Contacts</a>, APS रिक्ति पाठ।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>तलब कति छ?</h3><p>वार्षिक $89,225 देखि $96,829 सम्म, साथै 15.4% सुपरएन्युएसन।</p><h3>आवेदन कहिले बन्द हुन्छ?</h3><p>आइतबार २९ नोभेम्बर २०२६ को AEDT २३:५९ मा।</p><h3>जागिर कहाँ छन्?</h3><p>क्यानबेरा र एडिलेडमा।</p>$$,
