-- singapore-work-permit-jobs-nts-occupations-20261123 (asia; English 720 words; Nepali 317 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-22'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'singapore-work-permit-jobs-nts-occupations-20261123', 'asia', 'Singapore',
'Singapore Work Permit Jobs: 8 New Occupations for Foreigners',
'सिंगापुर कार्य अनुमति जागिर: विदेशीका लागि ८ नयाँ पेशा',
'Singapore work permit jobs are open in 8 new occupations for foreign workers from 9 countries, with a fixed salary of at least S$2,000 a month. Check the list.',
'सिंगापुरमा ९ देशका विदेशी कामदारका लागि ८ नयाँ पेशामा कार्य अनुमति जागिर खुलेका छन्, कम्तीमा S$2,000 को निश्चित मासिक तलबसहित। सूची हेर्नुहोस्।',
$$<p>Singapore has opened Singapore work permit jobs in eight new occupations to foreign workers from nine countries, under an expanded Non-Traditional Sources Occupation List that took effect on 1 September 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Singapore Ministry of Manpower</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>Eight occupations added to the Non-Traditional Sources Occupation List</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>Fixed monthly salary of at least S$2,000 for workers hired under the list</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Expansion announced March 2026 and in effect from 1 September 2026; no single closing date</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Through a Singapore employer, which applies for the Work Permit</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>National of Bangladesh, Bhutan, Cambodia, India, Laos, Myanmar, Philippines, Sri Lanka or Thailand, hired for a listed occupation</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the Singapore work permit jobs cover</h2><p>The eight occupations added to the Non-Traditional Sources Occupation List are cooks; butchers, fishmongers and related food preparers; food and drink stall assistants; kitchen assistants; waiters; cabin attendants; babysitters and infant caregivers; and educarers and teacher aides. They span food services, social services and air transportation, sectors the Ministry of Manpower identified as having insufficient local worker pipelines. The list is part of the Work Permit framework for the Manufacturing and Services sectors, and employers must meet strict licence conditions for each occupation. Readers following other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/asia">Asia jobs</a> can also read our guide on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/singapore-work-visa-for-indians-employment-pass-s-pass-20261120">Singapore work visas for Indians, Employment Pass and S Pass</a>, which covers the higher skilled passes.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>Workers from nine non-traditional source countries can be hired for these occupations: Bangladesh, Bhutan, Cambodia, India, Laos, Myanmar, the Philippines, Sri Lanka and Thailand. The employer must hold the licence the occupation requires, such as a Singapore Food Agency Food Shop or Supermarket licence for food services roles, a valid Early Childhood Development Centre licence for childcare roles, or a Civil Aviation Authority of Singapore Air Operator Certificate for cabin attendants. Workers must only perform the occupation stated on their Work Permit. Firms in the Manufacturing and Services sectors can hire under the list, within a sub-Dependency Ratio Ceiling of 8% for Non-Traditional Sources Work Permit holders.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>Employers hiring under the expanded list must pay each worker a fixed monthly salary of at least S$2,000. The Ministry of Manpower states plainly that a fixed monthly salary of less than S$2,000 is not allowed, and the Work Permit should be cancelled if the requirement cannot be met. The Employment Pass minimum qualifying salary is separate and will rise from S$5,600 to S$6,000 for most sectors for new applications from January 2027, with the Financial Services threshold rising from S$6,200 to S$6,600.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>There is no single application form for these occupations. A worker applies for a job with a Singapore employer in a listed occupation, and the employer or an authorised employment agent applies for the Work Permit. Applicants should confirm with the employer that it holds the licence for the occupation and that it can meet the S$2,000 salary floor and the 8% quota before accepting an offer.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The Ministry of Manpower announcement does not state how many posts are open, as hiring depends on individual employers, and it does not give a closing date for the expanded list. It does not name specific employers hiring under the list, and it does not guarantee a Work Permit to any applicant, since the employer must meet the eligibility conditions and obtain the permit. The expansion was announced in March 2026 and took effect in September 2026, so it is not a new announcement this week, even though it is being restated in recent reports.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> A genuine Singapore employer applies for the Work Permit itself, and no agent should charge a fee for a job, an interview, a visa or an offer letter.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.mom.gov.sg/passes-and-permits/work-permit-for-foreign-worker/sector-specific-rules/non-traditional-sources-occupation-list?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Singapore Ministry of Manpower</a>, the official Non-Traditional Sources Occupation List (occupations, countries, salary floor and quota); <a href="https://www.legit.ng/people/1742431-singapore-announces-8-jobs-foreign-workers-9-countries-includes-aviation-roles/">Legit.ng</a>, reporting the Ministry announcement (eight occupations and nine countries).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Which jobs are covered?</h3><p>Cooks, butchers and fishmongers, food and drink stall assistants, kitchen assistants, waiters, cabin attendants, babysitters and infant caregivers, and educarers and teacher aides.</p><h3>Which nationalities can be hired?</h3><p>Nationals of Bangladesh, Bhutan, Cambodia, India, Laos, Myanmar, the Philippines, Sri Lanka and Thailand.</p><h3>What is the minimum salary?</h3><p>A fixed monthly salary of at least S$2,000 for workers hired under the list.</p><h3>Is there a closing date?</h3><p>No. The expansion took effect on 1 September 2026 and hiring depends on individual employers, so there is no single deadline.</p>$$,
$$<p>सिंगापुरले नौ देशका विदेशी कामदारका लागि आठ नयाँ पेशामा सिंगापुर कार्य अनुमति जागिर खोलेको छ, विस्तारित गैर-परम्परागत स्रोत पेशा सूचीअन्तर्गत, जुन १ सेप्टेम्बर २०२६ देखि लागू भएको छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>सिंगापुर जनशक्ति मन्त्रालय</td></tr><tr><td>पद</td><td>गैर-परम्परागत स्रोत पेशा सूचीमा थपिएका आठ पेशा</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>सूचीअन्तर्गत नियुक्त कामदारका लागि कम्तीमा S$2,000 को निश्चित मासिक तलब</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन मिति</td><td>मार्च २०२६ मा घोषणा, १ सेप्टेम्बर २०२६ देखि लागू; कुनै एकल अन्तिम मिति छैन</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन तरिका</td><td>सिंगापुर रोजगारदातामार्फत, जसले कार्य अनुमतिका लागि आवेदन दिन्छ</td></tr><tr><td>योग्यता</td><td>बंगलादेश, भुटान, कम्बोडिया, भारत, लाओस, म्यानमार, फिलिपिन्स, श्रीलंका वा थाइल्याण्डका नागरिक, सूचीबद्ध पेशाका लागि नियुक्त</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पद के हो</h2><p>गैर-परम्परागत स्रोत पेशा सूचीमा थपिएका आठ पेशा हुन्: कुक; कसाई, माछा मार्ने र सम्बन्धित खाद्य तयारीकर्ता; खाद्य तथा पेय स्टल सहायक; भान्सा सहायक; वेटर; केबिन परिचारक; बच्चा हेरचाहकर्ता तथा शिशु हेरचाहकर्ता; र शिक्षक तथा शिक्षक सहायक। यी खाद्य सेवा, सामाजिक सेवा र हवाई यातायात क्षेत्रमा पर्छन्।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>नौ गैर-परम्परागत स्रोत देशका कामदारलाई यी पेशाका लागि नियुक्त गर्न सकिन्छ: बंगलादेश, भुटान, कम्बोडिया, भारत, लाओस, म्यानमार, फिलिपिन्स, श्रीलंका र थाइल्याण्ड। रोजगारदातासँग पेशाका लागि आवश्यक लाइसेन्स हुनुपर्छ।</p><h2>तलब कति छ</h2><p>विस्तारित सूचीअन्तर्गत नियुक्त प्रत्येक कामदारलाई कम्तीमा S$2,000 को निश्चित मासिक तलब दिनुपर्छ। S$2,000 भन्दा कम तलब दिन पाइँदैन।</p><h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2><p>यी पेशाका लागि कुनै एकल आवेदन फारम छैन। कामदारले सूचीबद्ध पेशामा सिंगापुर रोजगारदातासँग जागिरका लागि आवेदन दिन्छन्, र रोजगारदाताले कार्य अनुमतिका लागि आवेदन दिन्छ।</p><h2>सूचनाले के भनेको छैन</h2><p>मन्त्रालयको घोषणाले कति पद खुलेका छन् भन्ने बताएको छैन, किनकि भर्ती व्यक्तिगत रोजगारदातामा निर्भर छ, र विस्तारित सूचीका लागि अन्तिम मिति पनि दिएको छैन। यसले कुनै आवेदकलाई कार्य अनुमति ग्यारेन्टी गर्दैन।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> वास्तविक सिंगापुर रोजगारदाताले आफैं कार्य अनुमतिका लागि आवेदन दिन्छ।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.mom.gov.sg/passes-and-permits/work-permit-for-foreign-worker/sector-specific-rules/non-traditional-sources-occupation-list?utm_source=chatgpt.com">सिंगापुर जनशक्ति मन्त्रालय</a>, आधिकारिक गैर-परम्परागत स्रोत पेशा सूची; <a href="https://www.legit.ng/people/1742431-singapore-announces-8-jobs-foreign-workers-9-countries-includes-aviation-roles/">Legit.ng</a>, मन्त्रालय घोषणाको रिपोर्ट।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>कुन जागिर समेटिएका छन्?</h3><p>कुक, कसाई तथा माछा मार्ने, खाद्य तथा पेय स्टल सहायक, भान्सा सहायक, वेटर, केबिन परिचारक, बच्चा हेरचाहकर्ता, र शिक्षक तथा शिक्षक सहायक।</p><h3>न्यूनतम तलब कति छ?</h3><p>सूचीअन्तर्गत नियुक्त कामदारका लागि कम्तीमा S$2,000 को निश्चित मासिक तलब।</p><h3>अन्तिम मिति छ?</h3><p>छैन। विस्तार १ सेप्टेम्बर २०२६ देखि लागू भएको छ र भर्ती व्यक्तिगत रोजगारदातामा निर्भर छ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.mom.gov.sg/passes-and-permits/work-permit-for-foreign-worker/sector-specific-rules/non-traditional-sources-occupation-list?utm_source=chatgpt.com', 'https://www.legit.ng/people/1742431-singapore-announces-8-jobs-foreign-workers-9-countries-includes-aviation-roles/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-22'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- affirm-software-engineer-jobs-remote-20261123 (remote; English 627 words; Nepali 343 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-22'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'affirm-software-engineer-jobs-remote-20261123', 'remote', 'Remote',
'Affirm Software Engineer Jobs: Remote US and Canada',
'अफर्म सफ्टवेयर इन्जिनियर जागिर: अमेरिका र क्यानडामा टाढाबाट',
'Affirm Software Engineer jobs are open remotely in the US and Canada, with US base pay of $115,000 to $180,000 a year. Check the live posting to apply.',
'अफर्म सफ्टवेयर इन्जिनियर जागिर अमेरिका र क्यानडामा टाढाबाट काम गर्ने रूपमा खुलेका छन्, अमेरिकी आधार तलब वार्षिक $115,000 देखि $180,000 सम्म। आवेदनका लागि लाइभ पोस्टिङ हेर्नुहोस्।',
$$<p>Affirm is hiring for Affirm Software Engineer jobs in a remote role, with Software Engineer I, Backend (Streaming Infrastructure) open in the United States and Canada and US base pay of $115,000 to $180,000 a year.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Affirm</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>Software Engineer I, Backend (Streaming Infrastructure), remote</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>US base pay $115,000 to $165,000 a year in most states, $130,000 to $180,000 in CA, WA, NY, NJ and CT; Canada CAD $101,000 to $151,000</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Posted 21 November 2026; no closing date stated</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through the Affirm careers board on Greenhouse</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>Bachelor degree or equivalent practical experience</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the Affirm Software Engineer jobs involve</h2><p>The Software Engineer I, Backend works on Streaming Infrastructure in the Infrastructure Platform Engineering department, building backend systems at scale for Affirm buy now, pay later products. Affirm describes itself as a remote-first company, and most roles can be done from almost anywhere within the country of employment. The role is listed as remote in the US and remote in Canada, with the US and Canada postings carrying different pay ranges. Readers following other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/remote">remote jobs</a> can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/seasonal-remote-jobs-holiday-hiring-november-2026-20261121">seasonal remote jobs in holiday hiring for November 2026</a>.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>Applicants need a bachelor degree in a related field or equivalent practical experience. The US posting is open to candidates based in the United States, and the Canada posting is open only to candidates residing in Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland and Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island or Saskatchewan. The role is an entry level backend engineering post, at base pay grade J and equity grade 4, and new employees typically come in at the start of the pay range.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>US base pay is $115,000 to $165,000 a year in most US states, and $130,000 to $180,000 a year in California, Washington, New York, New Jersey and Connecticut. The Canada posting lists CAD $101,000 to $151,000 a year. Base pay is part of a total compensation package that may include equity rewards, monthly stipends for health, wellness and tech spending, and benefits including 100% subsidised medical coverage, dental and vision for the employee and dependents.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply online only through the Affirm careers board, on the Software Engineer I, Backend (Streaming Infrastructure) posting for the United States or Canada, as applicable. Affirm states that pay depends on location, experience and job related skills, so applicants should check the range for their own location on the live posting before applying.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The posting does not state a closing date, how many Software Engineer I posts are open, or an interview date. It does not state whether visa sponsorship is offered, and it does not list a fixed start date. The role may occasionally require in-person work, even though it is listed as remote.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> Affirm applications are free, and a genuine employer will never ask for money, or for a deposit, in exchange for an application or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.joroute.com/jobs/jr_8613bc7aad6b68077e9e">JoRoute</a>, the Affirm job board listing as published (pay ranges, remote locations and posting date); <a href="https://remotive.com/remote/jobs/software-development/software-engineer-i-backend-6584282">Remotive</a>, the Affirm remote posting (Canada pay range and location restriction).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What does the post pay?</h3><p>US base pay of $115,000 to $165,000 a year in most states, $130,000 to $180,000 in CA, WA, NY, NJ and CT, and CAD $101,000 to $151,000 in Canada.</p><h3>Is the role fully remote?</h3><p>It is listed as remote in the US and Canada, and Affirm is remote-first, though some roles may occasionally require in-person work.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>The posting does not state a closing date, so applicants should apply through the live Affirm careers board and check the current status there.</p><h3>Who can apply from Canada?</h3><p>Only candidates residing in Alberta, British Columbia, Manitoba, New Brunswick, Newfoundland and Labrador, Nova Scotia, Ontario, Prince Edward Island or Saskatchewan.</p>$$,
$$<p>अफर्मले टाढाबाट काम गर्ने भूमिकामा अफर्म सफ्टवेयर इन्जिनियर जागिरका लागि आवेदन खुलाएको छ, सफ्टवेयर इन्जिनियर I, ब्याकएन्ड (स्ट्रिमिङ पूर्वाधार) अमेरिका र क्यानडामा खुला छ, अमेरिकी आधार तलब वार्षिक $115,000 देखि $180,000 सम्म।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>अफर्म</td></tr><tr><td>पद</td><td>सफ्टवेयर इन्जिनियर I, ब्याकएन्ड (स्ट्रिमिङ पूर्वाधार), टाढाबाट काम गर्ने</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>अमेरिकी आधार तलब धेरै राज्यमा वार्षिक $115,000 देखि $165,000 सम्म, CA, WA, NY, NJ र CT मा $130,000 देखि $180,000 सम्म; क्यानडा CAD $101,000 देखि $151,000 सम्म</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन मिति</td><td>२१ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा प्रकाशित; अन्तिम मिति उल्लेख छैन</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन तरिका</td><td>ग्रीनहाउसमा अफर्म करियर बोर्डबाट अनलाइन</td></tr><tr><td>योग्यता</td><td>स्नातक डिग्री वा सोही व्यावहारिक अनुभव</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पद के हो</h2><p>सफ्टवेयर इन्जिनियर I, ब्याकएन्डले पूर्वाधार प्लेटफर्म इन्जिनियरिङ विभागमा स्ट्रिमिङ पूर्वाधारमा काम गर्छन्, अफर्मको अहिले किन्नुहोस्, पछि तिर्नुहोस् उत्पादनहरूका लागि ठूलो मात्रामा ब्याकएन्ड प्रणाली बनाउँछन्। अफर्म आफूलाई टाढाबाट काम गर्ने पहिलो कम्पनी भन्छ, र धेरै भूमिका रोजगारीको देशभित्र लगभग जहाँबाट पनि गर्न सकिन्छ।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>आवेदकसँग सम्बन्धित क्षेत्रमा स्नातक डिग्री वा सोही व्यावहारिक अनुभव चाहिन्छ। अमेरिकी पोस्टिङ अमेरिकामा आधारित उम्मेदवारका लागि खुला छ, र क्यानडा पोस्टिङ अल्बर्टा, ब्रिटिस कोलम्बिया, मनिटोबा, न्यू ब्रन्सविक, न्यूफाउन्डल्याण्ड र ल्याब्राडोर, नोभा स्कोसिया, ओन्टारियो, प्रिन्स एडवर्ड टापु वा सस्काचेवानमा बसोबास गर्ने उम्मेदवारका लागि मात्र खुला छ।</p><h2>तलब कति छ</h2><p>अमेरिकी आधार तलब धेरै राज्यमा वार्षिक $115,000 देखि $165,000 सम्म छ, र क्यालिफोर्निया, वासिङ्टन, न्यूयोर्क, न्यू जर्सी र कनेक्टिकटमा $130,000 देखि $180,000 सम्म छ। क्यानडा पोस्टिङमा CAD $101,000 देखि $151,000 सम्म छ।</p><h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2><p>अफर्म करियर बोर्डबाट मात्र अनलाइन आवेदन दिनुहोस्, अमेरिका वा क्यानडाका लागि सफ्टवेयर इन्जिनियर I, ब्याकएन्ड (स्ट्रिमिङ पूर्वाधार) पोस्टिङमा।</p><h2>सूचनाले के भनेको छैन</h2><p>पोस्टिङले अन्तिम मिति, कति पद खुलेका छन्, वा अन्तर्वार्ता मिति बताएको छैन। भिसा प्रायोजन दिइन्छ कि दिइँदैन भन्ने पनि बताएको छैन।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> अफर्ममा आवेदन निःशुल्क छ।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.joroute.com/jobs/jr_8613bc7aad6b68077e9e">JoRoute</a>, प्रकाशित अफर्म जागिर बोर्ड सूची; <a href="https://remotive.com/remote/jobs/software-development/software-engineer-i-backend-6584282">Remotive</a>, अफर्म टाढाबाट काम गर्ने पोस्टिङ।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>तलब कति छ?</h3><p>अमेरिकी आधार तलब धेरै राज्यमा वार्षिक $115,000 देखि $165,000 सम्म, CA, WA, NY, NJ र CT मा $130,000 देखि $180,000 सम्म, र क्यानडामा CAD $101,000 देखि $151,000 सम्म।</p><h3>भूमिका पूर्ण रूपमा टाढाबाट काम गर्ने हो?</h3><p>अमेरिका र क्यानडामा टाढाबाट काम गर्ने रूपमा सूचीबद्ध छ, यद्यपि केही भूमिकामा कहिलेकाहीँ प्रत्यक्ष उपस्थिति आवश्यक पर्न सक्छ।</p><h3>आवेदन कहिले बन्द हुन्छ?</h3><p>पोस्टिङले अन्तिम मिति बताएको छैन, त्यसैले आवेदकले लाइभ अफर्म करियर बोर्डबाट आवेदन दिनुपर्छ।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.joroute.com/jobs/jr_8613bc7aad6b68077e9e', 'https://remotive.com/remote/jobs/software-development/software-engineer-i-backend-6584282'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-22'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- nlc-get-jobs-gate-2025-143-posts-20261123 (asia; English 762 words; Nepali 432 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-22'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'nlc-get-jobs-gate-2025-143-posts-20261123', 'asia', 'India',
'NLC GET Jobs Through GATE 2025: 143 Posts, Close 14 December',
'NLC GET जागिर GATE 2025 मार्फत: १४३ पद, १४ डिसेम्बरमा बन्द',
'NLC GET jobs through GATE 2025 are open for 143 Graduate Executive Trainee posts in engineering, paying Rs 50,000 to Rs 1,60,000 a month. Apply by 14 December.',
'GATE 2025 मार्फत NLC GET जागिर इन्जिनियरिङमा १४३ स्नातक कार्यकारी प्रशिक्षार्थी पदका लागि खुलेका छन्, तलब मासिक रु 50,000 देखि रु 1,60,000 सम्म। १४ डिसेम्बर सम्म आवेदन दिनुहोस्।',
$$<p>NLC India Limited is hiring for NLC GET jobs through GATE 2025, with 143 Graduate Executive Trainee posts in Mechanical, Electrical, Civil and Mining engineering, and applications close at 5:00pm on Monday 14 December 2026.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>NLC India Limited, a Navratna Central Public Sector Enterprise</td></tr><tr><td>Total posts</td><td>143</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>E-2 grade, Rs 50,000 to Rs 1,60,000 a month, about Rs 14.50 lakh CTC a year</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Opened 13 November 2026, 10:00am; registration closes 14 December 2026, 5:00pm; fee payment closes 14 December 2026, 11:45pm</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online only through nlcindia.in, Careers section, Advt. No. 10/2026</td></tr><tr><td>Application fee</td><td>Rs 854 for UR, EWS and OBC (NCL); Rs 354 for SC, ST, PwBD and Ex-Servicemen</td></tr><tr><td>Age limit</td><td>30 years for UR and EWS as on 1 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>Full time or part time bachelor degree in the relevant engineering discipline, with a valid GATE 2025 score in the matching paper</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>Shortlisting on GATE 2025 score, 80%, followed by personal interview, 20%</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the NLC GET jobs involve</h2><p>Graduate Executive Trainees join NLC India Limited in four disciplines: Mechanical with 66 posts, Electrical with 44 posts, Civil with 23 posts and Mining with 10 posts, making 143 posts in total. Trainees are posted to four areas: Area 1, Thermal Power Stations; Area 2, Mines and Allied Services; Area 3, Renewable Energy, Projects and Planning; and Area 4, Services and Support. Each candidate applies for one area only, and the choice cannot be changed after the form is submitted. Trainees join in the E-2 grade on a basic pay of Rs 50,000 and are absorbed into the E-3 grade at Rs 60,000 basic after one year of training. Readers following other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/asia">Asia jobs</a> can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/nlc-india-executive-recruitment-145-posts-20261119">NLC India executive recruitment for 145 posts</a>, a separate NLC India advertisement for experienced professionals.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>Applicants need a full time or part time bachelor degree in Mechanical, Electrical, Civil or Mining engineering from a university or institution recognised by UGC, AICTE or the applicable statutory authority, with 60% marks for UR, EWS and OBC (NCL) and 50% marks for SC and ST, and a valid GATE 2025 score in the matching paper: ME for Mechanical, EE for Electrical, CE for Civil and MN for Mining. Only GATE 2025 scores count; a GATE 2026 score, or an engineering degree without a GATE 2025 score, is not sufficient. The degree must be passed by the crucial date, 1 November 2026. The upper age limit is 30 years for UR and EWS as on 1 November 2026, with relaxations as per rules, including 10 years for PwBD, 13 years for OBC and 15 years for SC and ST, subject to a maximum of 58 years in all cases.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>Pay is in the E-2 grade, Rs 50,000 to Rs 1,60,000 a month, with an approximate CTC of Rs 14.50 lakh a year. After one year of training, trainees move to the E-3 grade at Rs 60,000 basic.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply online only through the NLC India website, nlcindia.in, in the Careers section, selecting Advt. No. 10/2026, Recruitment of Graduate Executive Trainee through GATE 2025. Register only once, with the GATE 2025 registration number, name, email ID and mobile number, and choose one area. Pay the fee online through SBI e-Collect by 14 December 2026 at 11:45pm. Final submission for candidates who have already registered and paid in time is 16 December 2026 at 5:00pm.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The advertisement does not state an interview date or a document verification date. It does not state a separate direct application URL, as the link is reached through the Careers section of the NLC India website. The detailed notification was revised by corrigendum, changing the total from 145 posts to 143 posts, so applicants should rely on the revised figure of 143.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> NLC India applications go through the official website only, and the fee is paid online through SBI e-Collect. No agent should charge a fee for an application or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.nlcindia.in/">NLC India Limited</a>, the official website (Careers section, Advt. No. 10/2026); <a href="https://www.jagranjosh.com/lite/articles/nlc-india-limited-recruitment-2026-apply-online-begins-for-graduate-executive-trainee-posts-check-eligibility-and-direct-link-here-1800019077-1">JagranJosh</a>, reporting the NLC India GET notification (143 posts, dates, fee and selection).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How many posts are open?</h3><p>143 Graduate Executive Trainee posts: Mechanical 66, Electrical 44, Civil 23 and Mining 10.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>Registration closes at 5:00pm on Monday 14 December 2026, with fee payment by 11:45pm the same day.</p><h3>Is GATE 2025 required?</h3><p>Yes. Only GATE 2025 scores in the matching paper count; GATE 2026 scores are not accepted.</p><h3>What is the application fee?</h3><p>Rs 854 for UR, EWS and OBC (NCL), and Rs 354 for SC, ST, PwBD and Ex-Servicemen, paid online through SBI e-Collect.</p>$$,
$$<p>NLC इन्डिया लिमिटेडले GATE 2025 मार्फत NLC GET जागिरका लागि आवेदन खुलाएको छ, मेकानिकल, इलेक्ट्रिकल, सिभिल र माइनिङ इन्जिनियरिङमा १४३ स्नातक कार्यकारी प्रशिक्षार्थी पद छन्। आवेदन सोमबार १४ डिसेम्बर २०२६ को दिउँसो ५:०० मा बन्द हुन्छ।</p><table><tbody><tr><td>संस्था</td><td>NLC इन्डिया लिमिटेड, नवरत्न केन्द्रीय सार्वजनिक क्षेत्र उद्यम</td></tr><tr><td>कुल पद</td><td>१४३</td></tr><tr><td>तलब</td><td>E-2 ग्रेड, मासिक रु 50,000 देखि रु 1,60,000 सम्म, वार्षिक करिब रु 14.50 लाख CTC</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन मिति</td><td>१३ नोभेम्बर २०२६, बिहान १०:०० मा खुल्यो; दर्ता १४ डिसेम्बर २०२६, दिउँसो ५:०० मा बन्द; शुल्क भुक्तानी १४ डिसेम्बर २०२६, राति ११:४५ मा बन्द</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन तरिका</td><td>nlcindia.in को करियर खण्डबाट मात्र अनलाइन, विज्ञापन नं. 10/2026</td></tr><tr><td>आवेदन शुल्क</td><td>UR, EWS र OBC (NCL) का लागि रु 854; SC, ST, PwBD र पूर्व सैनिकका लागि रु 354</td></tr><tr><td>उमेर सीमा</td><td>१ नोभेम्बर २०२६ का अनुसार UR र EWS का लागि ३० वर्ष</td></tr><tr><td>योग्यता</td><td>सम्बन्धित इन्जिनियरिङ विषयमा स्नातक डिग्री, मिल्दो पेपरमा मान्य GATE 2025 स्कोरसहित</td></tr><tr><td>छनोट</td><td>GATE 2025 स्कोरमा छनोट, ८०%, त्यसपछि व्यक्तिगत अन्तर्वार्ता, २०%</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>पद के हो</h2><p>स्नातक कार्यकारी प्रशिक्षार्थीहरू चार विषयमा NLC इन्डिया लिमिटेडमा सामेल हुन्छन्: मेकानिकल ६६ पद, इलेक्ट्रिकल ४४ पद, सिभिल २३ पद र माइनिङ १० पद, कुल १४३ पद। प्रशिक्षार्थीहरू चार क्षेत्रमा खटिन्छन्: क्षेत्र १, थर्मल पावर स्टेशन; क्षेत्र २, खानी तथा सम्बद्ध सेवा; क्षेत्र ३, नवीकरणीय ऊर्जा, परियोजना तथा योजना; र क्षेत्र ४, सेवा तथा सहयोग।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>आवेदकसँग मेकानिकल, इलेक्ट्रिकल, सिभिल वा माइनिङ इन्जिनियरिङमा स्नातक डिग्री र मिल्दो पेपरमा मान्य GATE 2025 स्कोर चाहिन्छ: मेकानिकलका लागि ME, इलेक्ट्रिकलका लागि EE, सिभिलका लागि CE र माइनिङका लागि MN। GATE 2025 स्कोर मात्र मान्य हुन्छ; GATE 2026 स्कोर स्वीकार गरिँदैन। UR र EWS का लागि माथिल्लो उमेर सीमा १ नोभेम्बर २०२६ का अनुसार ३० वर्ष हो।</p><h2>तलब कति छ</h2><p>तलब E-2 ग्रेडमा मासिक रु 50,000 देखि रु 1,60,000 सम्म छ, वार्षिक करिब रु 14.50 लाख CTC सहित। एक वर्षको तालिमपछि प्रशिक्षार्थीहरू रु 60,000 आधारभूत तलबमा E-3 ग्रेडमा जान्छन्।</p><h2>कसरी आवेदन दिने</h2><p>NLC इन्डिया वेबसाइट nlcindia.in को करियर खण्डबाट मात्र अनलाइन आवेदन दिनुहोस्, विज्ञापन नं. 10/2026 छनोट गरेर। शुल्क SBI e-Collect बाट अनलाइन तिर्नुहोस्, १४ डिसेम्बर २०२६ को राति ११:४५ सम्म।</p><h2>सूचनाले के भनेको छैन</h2><p>विज्ञापनले अन्तर्वार्ता मिति वा दस्तावेज प्रमाणीकरण मिति बताएको छैन। विस्तृत सूचनालाई शुद्धिपत्रले संशोधन गरेर कुल पद १४५ बाट १४३ मा झारेको छ, त्यसैले आवेदकले संशोधित संख्या १४३ मा भर पर्नुपर्छ।</p><p><strong>यो जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नतिर्नुहोस्।</strong> NLC इन्डिया आवेदन आधिकारिक वेबसाइटबाट मात्र जान्छ, र शुल्क SBI e-Collect बाट अनलाइन तिरिन्छ।</p><p>स्रोतहरू: <a href="https://www.nlcindia.in/">NLC इन्डिया लिमिटेड</a>, आधिकारिक वेबसाइट; <a href="https://www.jagranjosh.com/lite/articles/nlc-india-limited-recruitment-2026-apply-online-begins-for-graduate-executive-trainee-posts-check-eligibility-and-direct-link-here-1800019077-1">JagranJosh</a>, NLC इन्डिया GET सूचनाको रिपोर्ट।</p><h2>बारम्बार सोधिने प्रश्नहरू</h2><h3>कति पद खुलेका छन्?</h3><p>१४३ स्नातक कार्यकारी प्रशिक्षार्थी पद: मेकानिकल ६६, इलेक्ट्रिकल ४४, सिभिल २३ र माइनिङ १०।</p><h3>आवेदन कहिले बन्द हुन्छ?</h3><p>दर्ता सोमबार १४ डिसेम्बर २०२६ को दिउँसो ५:०० मा बन्द हुन्छ, शुल्क भुक्तानी सोही दिन राति ११:४५ सम्म।</p><h3>GATE 2025 आवश्यक छ?</h3><p>हो। मिल्दो पेपरमा GATE 2025 स्कोर मात्र मान्य हुन्छ; GATE 2026 स्कोर स्वीकार गरिँदैन।</p>$$,
